const CARD_STORIES={"苔庭裂角客领誓·阿珀":{"zh":"角上的刻痕记着每一个穿过雾的人。他曾答应等他们回来，后来连约定的年份也忘了。","en":"The notches on his horns count everyone who passed into the mist. He promised to wait for them. Eventually he forgot which year he made that promise."},"苔庭赤角兽领誓·艾珀":{"zh":"它撞断了渡口所有的围栏，却没有走出过雾林。没有谁告诉这头倔牛，墙也可能是一条看不见的路。","en":"The stubborn bull broke every fence at the crossing, yet never escaped the mist. No one told it that a road can also be a wall."},"苔庭攀崖羊灵领誓·伊珀":{"zh":"它把最险的崖路踩得很熟，却从不先到山顶。颈上的铃响三声，才肯再往前走。渡口没有人问今天是哪一天。","en":"It knows every dangerous ledge, yet never reaches the summit first. It waits for three bell notes before taking another step. Nobody at the crossing asks what day it is."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·欧珀":{"zh":"他把火藏进残破的双翼，夜夜试着飞过雾墙。每次落地，脚下都是同一块渡口石碑。","en":"Fire smolders in his torn wings. Each night he tries to fly beyond the mist wall. Each landing brings him to the same stone at the crossing."},"苔庭绛纹蝶领誓·乌珀":{"zh":"它在空灯旁孵化，翅上的斑纹像一封没有写完的信。风一吹，断句便落在两个相反的方向。","en":"It hatched beside an empty lamp. Its wings resemble an unfinished letter, scattered in opposite directions whenever the wind rises."},"苔庭晶棘蜥龙领誓·依珀":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。初来的人都以为，这只是旅途的第一站。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. New arrivals think this is only the first stop."},"苔庭织光蛛领誓·雅珀":{"zh":"它把每一条岔路织进发亮的丝网，却总在地图中央留一个空洞。那里曾经画着出口。","en":"It weaves each fork in the road into a shining map. One hole remains in the center, where the exit used to be."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·诺珀":{"zh":"它把自己困在窄门里太久，几乎忘了角也可以低下来。门外一直有人替它留着灯。有人说雾会散，只是从没说过时候。","en":"It has stood trapped in a narrow doorway so long it forgot that horns can be lowered. Someone still leaves a lamp outside. They say the mist will clear, but never when."},"苔庭峰脊巨灵领誓·瑟珀":{"zh":"巨人捧着山口最后一块路牌，字迹早已被雨洗净。他不肯放手，怕后来的人连方向都没有。","en":"The giant holds the mountain’s last signpost. Rain erased its words long ago. He will not let go while another traveler might need a direction."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·维珀":{"zh":"他的剑只在雷声响起时出鞘。剑柄缠着一只旧发带，和远方钟城传来的歌谣一样熟悉。","en":"His sword leaves its sheath only with thunder. An old ribbon binds the hilt, as familiar as the song drifting from the distant bell city."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·希珀":{"zh":"他守着雾林中央的空屋，屋里的桌子却摆了两份餐具。另一位住客每次都说，很快就会回来。","en":"He guards an empty house with two places set at its table. The other resident always said they would be back soon."},"苔庭灯议长·洛珀":{"zh":"法术书里夹的都是寻路纸条。最复杂的公式旁边，写着一句很小的字：这里也不通。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"The spellbook is full of directions. Beside the most elaborate formula, a small note reads: This way is closed too. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭缄骨客领誓·米珀":{"zh":"他把过路人的名字刻在遗骨上，免得雾吞掉所有证据。唯独自己的名字，已经没有地方可找。","en":"He carves travelers’ names into old bones so the mist cannot erase them all. His own name is the only one he cannot find."},"苔庭晶棘蜥龙领誓·岚珀":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。雾里来的人，总比离开的人多。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. More people arrive through the mist than leave."},"苔庭浮辉使领誓·索珀":{"zh":"它从一盏熄灭的灯里走出来，忘了自己原来照过谁。每当听见脚步，微光总会先亮一点。夜里总有人替空着的位置添一根柴。","en":"It emerged from an extinguished lamp, forgetting whom it once lit the way for. Footsteps still make it brighten. At night, someone adds a log for the empty place."},"苔庭峰脊巨灵领誓·莱珀":{"zh":"肩上的鸟巢早已空了，它仍在过桥时低头。旧习惯比石头重，却比石头暖和。不熟悉的路，也值得有人陪着走一次。","en":"The nest on its shoulder is empty. It still ducks under every bridge. Old habits weigh more than stone, and keep it warmer. Even an unknown road deserves company."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·岑珀":{"zh":"它把自己困在窄门里太久，几乎忘了角也可以低下来。门外一直有人替它留着灯。问起出口时，回答总要慢上一会儿。","en":"It has stood trapped in a narrow doorway so long it forgot that horns can be lowered. Someone still leaves a lamp outside. Answers come a little slower when the exit is mentioned."},"苔庭地缝蠕虫领誓·塔珀":{"zh":"它沿着地下的旧石缝前行，把断掉的路重新钻通。没人感谢过它，地上的脚步却因此少了一点孤单。夜里总有人替空着的位置添一根柴。","en":"It follows old cracks underground, reopening broken passages. No one thanks it, though footsteps above grow a little less lonely. At night, someone adds a log for the empty place."},"苔庭枝灯树灵领誓·莫珀":{"zh":"根须抱着一只生锈的旅行箱，枝条却一直伸向远方。箱子没打开过，像一个不能轻易答应的邀请。最暖和的树洞，永远留给刚醒来的人。","en":"Its roots clasp a rusted suitcase while its branches reach away. The case stays closed, an invitation not easily accepted. The warmest hollow is kept for those just waking."},"苔庭巡影狼领誓·伦珀":{"zh":"狼在每次进食前都把第一口留在地上。它已经独行很久，却还没有学会只等自己一个。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"The wolf leaves the first bite on the ground. It has traveled alone for years and has not learned to wait only for itself. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭灯议长·佩珀":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。初来的人都以为，这只是旅途的第一站。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. New arrivals think this is only the first stop."},"苔庭灯议长·泽珀":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。最暖和的树洞，永远留给刚醒来的人。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. The warmest hollow is kept for those just waking."},"苔庭灯议长·图珀":{"zh":"他掌管渡口的灯，最旧的账本里却有你的笔迹。你问起时，他只是把书页翻回了开头。","en":"He tends the crossing lamps. Your handwriting appears in his oldest ledger. When you ask about it, he quietly turns back to the first page."},"苔庭镜瞳山猫领誓·芮珀":{"zh":"它从不接受陌生人的呼唤，却总在旅人睡着后靠近灯火。等人醒来，行囊上便多一层温热的毛。远处的钟声听来像是一个邀请。","en":"It ignores every stranger’s call, but approaches the lamp once travelers sleep. Warm fur on a pack is the only sign it stayed. The distant bells sound like an invitation."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·阿恩":{"zh":"他总在挥剑前闭眼，像在等待某个人的口令。迟来的那一步，是他对一场旧败局的回答。","en":"He closes his eyes before drawing his blade, waiting for a command that never comes. That measured pause is his answer to an old defeat."},"苔庭晶棘蜥龙领誓·艾恩":{"zh":"龙鳞里封着烧焦的路标。它认得每一条通往边界的河，却只喝过河流尽头的灰。","en":"Scorched signposts lie sealed in its scales. The dragon knows every river leading to the border. All of them end in ash."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·伊恩":{"zh":"他能把强者变成一撮无名的灰，却说这不是惩罚。失去名字的人，偶尔能从守门者眼前溜走。","en":"He can reduce the mighty to nameless ash. He calls it mercy: sometimes a traveler without a name slips past the gatekeepers."},"苔庭铠卫·欧恩":{"zh":"他替旅人洗去伤口里的雾，盔甲上却结着擦不掉的白霜。那是另一段旅程留给他的东西。","en":"He washes the mist from travelers’ wounds. The white frost on his armor will not come off. It belongs to a journey he refuses to describe."},"苔庭铠卫·乌恩":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。初来的人都以为，这只是旅途的第一站。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. New arrivals think this is only the first stop."},"苔庭铠卫·依恩":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。林间的路牌只写着前方，没有写终点。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. The woodland signs point ahead, never to an end."},"苔庭铠卫·雅恩":{"zh":"他看过太多误入者受伤，所以从不丢下倒在渡口的人。他问你的来处，却避开了同一个问题。","en":"Too many strangers have fallen at this crossing. He never leaves one behind. He asks where you came from, but will not answer that question himself."},"苔庭巡灯使·诺恩":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。不熟悉的路，也值得有人陪着走一次。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. Even an unknown road deserves company."},"苔庭峰脊巨灵·瑟恩":{"zh":"肩上的鸟巢早已空了，它仍在过桥时低头。旧习惯比石头重，却比石头暖和。问起出口时，回答总要慢上一会儿。","en":"The nest on its shoulder is empty. It still ducks under every bridge. Old habits weigh more than stone, and keep it warmer. Answers come a little slower when the exit is mentioned."},"苔庭缄骨客·维恩":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。回家的念头，在这里比灯油更难熄灭。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. The thought of home lasts longer here than lamp oil."},"苔庭观灯师·希恩":{"zh":"法术书里夹的都是寻路纸条。最复杂的公式旁边，写着一句很小的字：这里也不通。回家的念头，在这里比灯油更难熄灭。","en":"The spellbook is full of directions. Beside the most elaborate formula, a small note reads: This way is closed too. The thought of home lasts longer here than lamp oil."},"苔庭观灯师·洛恩":{"zh":"帽檐缝着一圈错写的咒文。那是第一次学会法术时留下的失误，后来一直没有拆。雾里来的人，总比离开的人多。","en":"Misspelled charms line the hat brim. They are the first mistakes of a young apprentice, never unpicked. More people arrive through the mist than leave."},"苔庭观灯师·米恩":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。不熟悉的路，也值得有人陪着走一次。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. Even an unknown road deserves company."},"苔庭观灯师·岚恩":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。问起出口时，回答总要慢上一会儿。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. Answers come a little slower when the exit is mentioned."},"苔庭巡灯使·索恩":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭织光蛛·莱恩":{"zh":"它常把断掉的丝接成路标，却从不在网上画一条死路。困住谁之前，总先留一个缺口。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"It mends broken threads into signposts, never marking a dead end. Every web keeps a gap before it catches anyone. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭修灯师·岑恩":{"zh":"行李里最重的东西是一口小锅。只要还能煮出热汤，旅途就不算到了绝路。回家的念头，在这里比灯油更难熄灭。","en":"A small pot is the heaviest thing in the pack. As long as there is hot soup, the journey has not reached its end. The thought of home lasts longer here than lamp oil."},"苔庭修灯师·塔恩":{"zh":"每次包扎完伤口，都会在绷带上画一个笑脸。最初是哄孩子，后来发现大人也需要。回家的念头，在这里比灯油更难熄灭。","en":"A smiling face is drawn on every finished bandage. It began for children. Adults turned out to need it too. The thought of home lasts longer here than lamp oil."},"苔庭潜印客·莫恩":{"zh":"他专给陌生人指近路，自己却从不先走。袖口藏着一张折坏的地图，每一道折痕都通向悬崖。","en":"He offers strangers shortcuts, but never takes the lead. Every crease in the battered map up his sleeve ends at a cliff."},"苔庭修灯师·伦恩":{"zh":"总说药不够，所以从不给自己留。只有旧围裙上的结，记着这双手也曾抖得厉害。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"There is never enough medicine, so none is kept for the healer. The knots in the old apron remember how badly these hands once shook. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭铠卫·佩恩":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。远处的钟声听来像是一个邀请。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. The distant bells sound like an invitation."},"苔庭峰脊巨灵·泽恩":{"zh":"它怕踩坏路边的花，走路总绕很远。有人在它的脚印里挖了一口井，说这样再远也不怕没水。有人说雾会散，只是从没说过时候。","en":"It takes long detours to spare the roadside flowers. Someone dug a well in its footprint, so the extra miles would never mean thirst. They say the mist will clear, but never when."},"苔庭潜印客·图恩":{"zh":"从没偷过旅人的最后一块面包。被抓住时也只辩解一句：饿着肚子，跑不出这地方。林间的路牌只写着前方，没有写终点。","en":"The last piece of a traveler’s bread is never stolen. When caught, the only defense is that nobody escapes this place hungry. The woodland signs point ahead, never to an end."},"苔庭潜印客·芮恩":{"zh":"卖过很多条近路，只有一条从不标价。那是回家的路，至今还没找到。初来的人都以为，这只是旅途的第一站。","en":"Many shortcuts have been sold. Only the road home has no price, because it has not yet been found. New arrivals think this is only the first stop."},"苔庭环藤蛇·阿拉":{"zh":"它的鳞片认得土地的温度，身体却始终记得一只捧起过它的手。遇见脚步时，它不再立刻逃走。问起出口时，回答总要慢上一会儿。","en":"Its scales know the ground’s warmth. Its body remembers a hand that once lifted it. It no longer flees at the first footstep. Answers come a little slower when the exit is mentioned."},"苔庭环藤蛇·艾拉":{"zh":"它的鳞片认得土地的温度，身体却始终记得一只捧起过它的手。遇见脚步时，它不再立刻逃走。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"Its scales know the ground’s warmth. Its body remembers a hand that once lifted it. It no longer flees at the first footstep. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭缄骨客·伊拉":{"zh":"它沿着墓碑练习自己的字迹，写到最后，总把落款留成空白。也许是在等别人帮它想起。雾里来的人，总比离开的人多。","en":"It practices its handwriting on the gravestones, always leaving the signature blank. Perhaps someone else will remember. More people arrive through the mist than leave."},"苔庭缄骨客·欧拉":{"zh":"它沿着墓碑练习自己的字迹，写到最后，总把落款留成空白。也许是在等别人帮它想起。回家的念头，在这里比灯油更难熄灭。","en":"It practices its handwriting on the gravestones, always leaving the signature blank. Perhaps someone else will remember. The thought of home lasts longer here than lamp oil."},"苔庭巡灯使·乌拉":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。林间的路牌只写着前方，没有写终点。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. The woodland signs point ahead, never to an end."},"苔庭绒伞菌灵·依拉":{"zh":"它长在一只废弃的靴子里，菌褶藏着远行者踩过的尘土。入夜后，那些尘土会慢慢发光。有人说雾会散，只是从没说过时候。","en":"It grows in an abandoned boot. Dust from a traveler’s roads rests in its gills and glows slowly after nightfall. They say the mist will clear, but never when."},"苔庭观灯师·雅拉":{"zh":"能让星光停在指间，却没法让一封回信早些到来。于是每晚的灯都亮得比别人久。林间的路牌只写着前方，没有写终点。","en":"Starlight can be held between these fingers. A reply cannot be hurried. The study lamp burns later every night. The woodland signs point ahead, never to an end."},"苔庭铠卫·诺拉":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。初来的人都以为，这只是旅途的第一站。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. New arrivals think this is only the first stop."},"苔庭观灯师·瑟拉":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。回家的念头，在这里比灯油更难熄灭。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. The thought of home lasts longer here than lamp oil."},"苔庭琉纹缄骨客":{"zh":"这副骨架曾替旅人搬过行李，如今连自己的名字都背不动了。路牌倒还认得几个。不熟悉的路，也值得有人陪着走一次。","en":"This skeleton once carried travelers’ luggage. Now even its own name is too heavy, though a few signposts remain familiar. Even an unknown road deserves company."},"苔庭风蚀缄骨客":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。渡口没有人问今天是哪一天。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. Nobody at the crossing asks what day it is."},"苔庭静棱缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。远处的钟声听来像是一个邀请。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. The distant bells sound like an invitation."},"苔庭绒雾缄骨客":{"zh":"这副骨架曾替旅人搬过行李，如今连自己的名字都背不动了。路牌倒还认得几个。问起出口时，回答总要慢上一会儿。","en":"This skeleton once carried travelers’ luggage. Now even its own name is too heavy, though a few signposts remain familiar. Answers come a little slower when the exit is mentioned."},"苔庭微烛潜印客":{"zh":"擅长从人群中消失，却总在有人落单时现身。借口每次都一样：碰巧顺路。夜里总有人替空着的位置添一根柴。","en":"Expert at vanishing into crowds, yet always appearing beside anyone left alone. The excuse is always the same: Going that way anyway. At night, someone adds a log for the empty place."},"苔庭苔痕棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"它把捡到的手套排成一行，像在替走散的人准备重逢。最破的那只，始终留在自己脚边。有人说雾会散，只是从没说过时候。","en":"It lines up found gloves, preparing for a reunion. The most ragged one always stays beside its paws. They say the mist will clear, but never when."},"苔庭苔痕线尾鼠":{"zh":"它偷过面包，也把碎屑带给过困在墙里的同伴。人们只记得前一件事，所以它总走阴影里的路。远处的钟声听来像是一个邀请。","en":"It steals bread and takes crumbs to companions trapped in the walls. People remember only the first part, so it keeps to the shadows. The distant bells sound like an invitation."},"苔庭铜缄线尾鼠":{"zh":"它把亮纽扣藏在洞口，想让迟归的同伴找到家。后来洞口搬了很多次，纽扣始终带着。远处的钟声听来像是一个邀请。","en":"It places a bright button by its burrow for late companions. The burrow has moved many times. The button always comes too. The distant bells sound like an invitation."},"苔庭苔痕砂脊蜥":{"zh":"尾巴断过一次，新的长得很慢。它学会了在向前跑之前，先看看身后的同伴有没有跟上。有人说雾会散，只是从没说过时候。","en":"Its lost tail is growing back slowly. Before running ahead, it has learned to check whether its companions are following. They say the mist will clear, but never when."},"苔庭苔痕露囊蛙":{"zh":"雨停后它仍在叫，像怕晚到的人错过渡口。荷叶下压着一截旧绳，另一头早被水流带走。最暖和的树洞，永远留给刚醒来的人。","en":"It calls after the rain stops, afraid a late traveler might miss the crossing. An old rope lies beneath its leaf, its far end carried away. The warmest hollow is kept for those just waking."},"苔庭苔痕凝光泥团":{"zh":"它把掉进身体里的小东西一件件吐回岸上，唯独留着一颗玻璃珠。透过那颗珠子，天会显得很蓝。夜里总有人替空着的位置添一根柴。","en":"It returns everything that falls into its body to the bank, keeping one glass marble. Through it, the sky looks very blue. At night, someone adds a log for the empty place."},"苔庭铜缄枝灯树灵":{"zh":"它记得每个靠在树荫下睡着的人。年轮一圈圈长大，总给那些人的位置留一点空。雾里来的人，总比离开的人多。","en":"It remembers everyone who slept beneath its shade. Each new ring leaves a little room where they once rested. More people arrive through the mist than leave."},"苔庭铜缄绒伞菌灵":{"zh":"它长在一只废弃的靴子里，菌褶藏着远行者踩过的尘土。入夜后，那些尘土会慢慢发光。渡口没有人问今天是哪一天。","en":"It grows in an abandoned boot. Dust from a traveler’s roads rests in its gills and glows slowly after nightfall. Nobody at the crossing asks what day it is."},"苔庭回声绒伞菌灵":{"zh":"它长在一只废弃的靴子里，菌褶藏着远行者踩过的尘土。入夜后，那些尘土会慢慢发光。初来的人都以为，这只是旅途的第一站。","en":"It grows in an abandoned boot. Dust from a traveler’s roads rests in its gills and glows slowly after nightfall. New arrivals think this is only the first stop."},"苔庭流砂铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。远处的钟声听来像是一个邀请。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. The distant bells sound like an invitation."},"苔庭远路铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。最暖和的树洞，永远留给刚醒来的人。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. The warmest hollow is kept for those just waking."},"苔庭石封铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。雾里来的人，总比离开的人多。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. More people arrive through the mist than leave."},"苔庭鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。有人说雾会散，只是从没说过时候。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. They say the mist will clear, but never when."},"苔庭暖灰铠卫":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。夜里总有人替空着的位置添一根柴。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. At night, someone adds a log for the empty place."},"苔庭夜航缄骨客":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭流砂缄骨客":{"zh":"这副骨架曾替旅人搬过行李，如今连自己的名字都背不动了。路牌倒还认得几个。回家的念头，在这里比灯油更难熄灭。","en":"This skeleton once carried travelers’ luggage. Now even its own name is too heavy, though a few signposts remain familiar. The thought of home lasts longer here than lamp oil."},"苔庭夜航观灯师":{"zh":"能让星光停在指间，却没法让一封回信早些到来。于是每晚的灯都亮得比别人久。有人说雾会散，只是从没说过时候。","en":"Starlight can be held between these fingers. A reply cannot be hurried. The study lamp burns later every night. They say the mist will clear, but never when."},"苔庭镜纹缄骨客":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。有人说雾会散，只是从没说过时候。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. They say the mist will clear, but never when."},"苔庭远路缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。雾里来的人，总比离开的人多。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. More people arrive through the mist than leave."},"苔庭回声环藤蛇":{"zh":"它的鳞片认得土地的温度，身体却始终记得一只捧起过它的手。遇见脚步时，它不再立刻逃走。林间的路牌只写着前方，没有写终点。","en":"Its scales know the ground’s warmth. Its body remembers a hand that once lifted it. It no longer flees at the first footstep. The woodland signs point ahead, never to an end."},"苔庭微烛环藤蛇":{"zh":"它的鳞片认得土地的温度，身体却始终记得一只捧起过它的手。遇见脚步时，它不再立刻逃走。初来的人都以为，这只是旅途的第一站。","en":"Its scales know the ground’s warmth. Its body remembers a hand that once lifted it. It no longer flees at the first footstep. New arrivals think this is only the first stop."},"苔庭琉纹峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"肩上的鸟巢早已空了，它仍在过桥时低头。旧习惯比石头重，却比石头暖和。林间的路牌只写着前方，没有写终点。","en":"The nest on its shoulder is empty. It still ducks under every bridge. Old habits weigh more than stone, and keep it warmer. The woodland signs point ahead, never to an end."},"苔庭风蚀裂角客":{"zh":"它用尾巴把掉进沟里的灯捞起，再装作什么都没发生。谢意让它比火还要不自在。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"It fishes a fallen lamp from the ditch with its tail and pretends nothing happened. Gratitude makes it more uneasy than fire. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭铜缄浮辉使":{"zh":"它的影子比身体清楚，像另一个世界留在地上的窗。有人经过时，窗里偶尔会亮起灯。远处的钟声听来像是一个邀请。","en":"Its shadow is clearer than its body, a window from another world laid on the ground. Sometimes a passerby makes a lamp shine inside. The distant bells sound like an invitation."},"苔庭悬灯铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。夜里总有人替空着的位置添一根柴。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. At night, someone adds a log for the empty place."},"苔庭微烛晶棘蜥龙":{"zh":"龙在每一处落脚点都留下一道爪印。不是为了占有土地，只是怕回来时认不出自己走过的路。夜里总有人替空着的位置添一根柴。","en":"The dragon marks every resting place with a claw. It claims no land, only hopes to recognize the road if it returns. At night, someone adds a log for the empty place."},"苔庭琉纹晶棘蜥龙":{"zh":"它收集过很多亮晶晶的东西，最后只留下了一片窗玻璃。透过那一片，看出去的天最像故乡。初来的人都以为，这只是旅途的第一站。","en":"It collected many shining things, keeping only a shard of window glass. The sky through it looks most like home. New arrivals think this is only the first stop."},"苔庭苔痕掠风鸟":{"zh":"它把路上捡来的线头编成巢，巢里却总空着一个位置。风每次改变方向，它都往远处多看一眼。不熟悉的路，也值得有人陪着走一次。","en":"It nests with threads found on the road, leaving one place empty. Every shift of wind makes it look farther away. Even an unknown road deserves company."},"苔庭琉纹潜印客":{"zh":"开锁的工具藏在发带里，真正的钥匙却挂在胸前。那扇门早已不见，钥匙一直没舍得换。问起出口时，回答总要慢上一会儿。","en":"Lock picks hide in the hairband. The real key hangs at the neck. Its door is long gone, but no other key will do. Answers come a little slower when the exit is mentioned."},"苔庭铜缄凝光泥团":{"zh":"它把掉进身体里的小东西一件件吐回岸上，唯独留着一颗玻璃珠。透过那颗珠子，天会显得很蓝。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"It returns everything that falls into its body to the bank, keeping one glass marble. Through it, the sky looks very blue. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭石封缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。问起出口时，回答总要慢上一会儿。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. Answers come a little slower when the exit is mentioned."},"苔庭铜缄地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"它沿着地下的旧石缝前行，把断掉的路重新钻通。没人感谢过它，地上的脚步却因此少了一点孤单。问起出口时，回答总要慢上一会儿。","en":"It follows old cracks underground, reopening broken passages. No one thanks it, though footsteps above grow a little less lonely. Answers come a little slower when the exit is mentioned."},"苔庭苔痕折面星客":{"zh":"它用陌生的符号记录旅人的呼吸，纸上却总会出现一句你读得懂的话：还没到时候。回家的念头，在这里比灯油更难熄灭。","en":"It records travelers’ breathing in strange symbols. One sentence always appears that you can read: Not yet. The thought of home lasts longer here than lamp oil."},"苔庭静棱裂角客":{"zh":"被叫作怪物之后，它学会把笑藏起来。胸口那块干净的布，是第一个没有逃跑的人留下的。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"After being called a monster, it learned to hide its smile. The clean cloth at its chest came from the first person who did not run. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭银露铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。不熟悉的路，也值得有人陪着走一次。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. Even an unknown road deserves company."},"苔庭风蚀峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"它怕踩坏路边的花，走路总绕很远。有人在它的脚印里挖了一口井，说这样再远也不怕没水。问起出口时，回答总要慢上一会儿。","en":"It takes long detours to spare the roadside flowers. Someone dug a well in its footprint, so the extra miles would never mean thirst. Answers come a little slower when the exit is mentioned."},"苔庭流砂观灯师":{"zh":"记录了很多扇打不开的门，也记录了每个愿意陪着试一次的人。后一册薄得让人心疼。雾里来的人，总比离开的人多。","en":"One book lists doors that would not open. Another lists those willing to try together. The second is painfully thin. More people arrive through the mist than leave."},"苔庭琉纹环藤蛇":{"zh":"它把蜕下的皮留在温暖的石缝，自己守着更冷的入口。有人看见过小兽躲进那些旧皮里避雨。回家的念头，在这里比灯油更难熄灭。","en":"It leaves its cast skin in warm crevices and guards the colder entrance. Small animals have been seen sheltering in the old skins. The thought of home lasts longer here than lamp oil."},"苔庭苔痕潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"它只在岸边有灯时浮上水面，嘴里衔着一枚磨圆的石子。像是有一件太小的礼物，一直找不到收的人。雾里来的人，总比离开的人多。","en":"It surfaces only beside a lit bank, carrying a smooth pebble. A tiny gift has waited a long time for someone to receive it. More people arrive through the mist than leave."},"苔庭回声浮辉使":{"zh":"它的影子比身体清楚，像另一个世界留在地上的窗。有人经过时，窗里偶尔会亮起灯。初来的人都以为，这只是旅途的第一站。","en":"Its shadow is clearer than its body, a window from another world laid on the ground. Sometimes a passerby makes a lamp shine inside. New arrivals think this is only the first stop."},"苔庭绒雾裂角客":{"zh":"它用尾巴把掉进沟里的灯捞起，再装作什么都没发生。谢意让它比火还要不自在。远处的钟声听来像是一个邀请。","en":"It fishes a fallen lamp from the ditch with its tail and pretends nothing happened. Gratitude makes it more uneasy than fire. The distant bells sound like an invitation."},"苔庭镜纹观灯师":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。雾里来的人，总比离开的人多。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. More people arrive through the mist than leave."},"苔庭鸣枝缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭藤印铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。问起出口时，回答总要慢上一会儿。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. Answers come a little slower when the exit is mentioned."},"苔庭回声枝灯树灵":{"zh":"根须抱着一只生锈的旅行箱，枝条却一直伸向远方。箱子没打开过，像一个不能轻易答应的邀请。远处的钟声听来像是一个邀请。","en":"Its roots clasp a rusted suitcase while its branches reach away. The case stays closed, an invitation not easily accepted. The distant bells sound like an invitation."},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·维拉":{"zh":"巨人替停摆的钟摆来回推了很多年。他说城里人还需要清晨，哪怕自己早已不相信天会亮。","en":"For years the giant has pushed a stopped pendulum. The city still needs a morning, he says, though he no longer believes dawn will come."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·希拉":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·洛拉":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。有些空房里，晚餐仍冒着热气。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. Dinner still steams in some empty rooms."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·米拉":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·岚拉":{"zh":"钟楼塌下那天，巨人替所有人举起了穹顶。城里的新生儿已经长大，他的影子还停在原处。","en":"When the bell tower fell, the giant caught its roof. The children born that day are grown now. His shadow has never moved."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·索拉":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟灯议长·莱拉":{"zh":"他在每扇门前挂一盏不发光的灯，坚称总有人会认得归途。没有人知道他原来住在哪扇门后。","en":"He hangs an unlit lamp above every door, certain someone will recognize the way home. No one knows which door once belonged to him."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·岑拉":{"zh":"他用废弃的钟轮做车，推着走失者留下的行李。轮子每转一圈，箱子里就会响起不同的敲门声。","en":"His cart rides on discarded clock wheels and carries the luggage of the lost. Each turn brings a different knock from inside the trunks."},"铜钟踏铃驹领誓·塔拉":{"zh":"它认得每一处能避雨的屋檐，蹄下却从不在门前催促。有人愿意等，就是旅途里难得的好天气。城里的钟很多，走准的却一座也找不到。","en":"It knows every sheltering roof and never stamps impatiently at a door. Someone willing to wait is the journey’s rare good weather. The city has many clocks, and not one keeps time."},"铜钟苔脊软虫领誓·莫拉":{"zh":"它走过的地方留下细微的光，雨也洗不掉。走得慢的东西，也能替赶路的人留下一条线索。通向城外的台阶，总比记忆中多一级。","en":"A faint light marks its passing and survives the rain. Even something slow can leave a clue for someone hurrying home. The stairs out of the city always have one extra step."},"铜钟环藤蛇领誓·伦拉":{"zh":"蛇沿着铜管搬运药汁，也把毒带到锁死的花园。它分不清医师和囚徒，只记得谁曾为它留过水。","en":"The serpent carries remedies through copper pipes, and poison into a locked garden. It knows neither doctors nor prisoners, only those who left it water."},"铜钟裂角客领誓·佩拉":{"zh":"他的火来自钟炉熄灭前的最后一块炭。每次点燃拳头，他都会少记起一个故乡的地名。","en":"His fire comes from the bell furnace’s last coal. Each time he kindles his fist, another place from home slips out of his memory."},"铜钟裂角客领誓·泽拉":{"zh":"他只攻击钟声覆盖不到的街道，因为那里从不有人呼救。你在焦墙上看见了一行又一行求救的旧字。","en":"He strikes the streets the bells cannot reach, where no cry is ever heard. The burnt walls still carry line after line asking for help."},"铜钟钩针蝎领誓·图拉":{"zh":"尾刺碰过的东西都会留下痕迹，唯独一只旧手套仍然完好。那是它还愿意相信温暖的理由。一张过期的车票，也能让人等很多年。","en":"Everything touched by its sting bears a mark, except one old glove. That is why it still believes in warmth. An expired ticket can keep someone waiting for years."},"铜钟灯议长·芮拉":{"zh":"记录了很多扇打不开的门，也记录了每个愿意陪着试一次的人。后一册薄得让人心疼。迟到的人在这里常常比早到的人年轻。","en":"One book lists doors that would not open. Another lists those willing to try together. The second is painfully thin. Late arrivals here are often younger than those who came early."},"铜钟织光蛛领誓·阿温":{"zh":"它把幼蛛藏在废钟里，靠旅人遗落的碎布补巢。每一张网都留着缺口，好让误入的小东西逃走。","en":"It nests its young inside broken bells and patches their home with lost cloth. Every web has a gap for small creatures that wander in."},"铜钟线尾鼠领誓·艾温":{"zh":"它把亮纽扣藏在洞口，想让迟归的同伴找到家。后来洞口搬了很多次，纽扣始终带着。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"It places a bright button by its burrow for late companions. The burrow has moved many times. The button always comes too. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟线尾鼠领誓·伊温":{"zh":"它偷过面包，也把碎屑带给过困在墙里的同伴。人们只记得前一件事，所以它总走阴影里的路。每一扇关着的门，都曾经被认真敲过。","en":"It steals bread and takes crumbs to companions trapped in the walls. People remember only the first part, so it keeps to the shadows. Every closed door has been knocked on with hope."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·欧温":{"zh":"他记得城里每一个受伤的人，却不记得自己的手为何只剩白骨。药膏的气味让他想起一条开着花的街。","en":"He remembers every wounded person in the city, but not why his own hands are bone. The ointment smells like a street once lined with flowers."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·乌温":{"zh":"镜盾里映着一位没有变老的守卫。盾外的人早已疲倦，仍把镜子朝向每一个想离开的人。","en":"The mirror shield shows a guard who has never aged. The tired figure outside it still turns the glass toward anyone who tries to leave."},"铜钟露囊蛙领誓·依温":{"zh":"雨停后它仍在叫，像怕晚到的人错过渡口。荷叶下压着一截旧绳，另一头早被水流带走。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"It calls after the rain stops, afraid a late traveler might miss the crossing. An old rope lies beneath its leaf, its far end carried away. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·雅温":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。城门上最后一次维修的日期，还是明天。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. The city gate was last repaired tomorrow."},"铜钟枝灯树灵领誓·诺温":{"zh":"树从废钟的裂缝长出，叶片一面泛红，一面透明。它在同一个季节里，听过许多次相同的道别。","en":"A tree grew through a cracked bell, its leaves red on one side and clear on the other. It has heard the same farewell many times in one season."},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·瑟温":{"zh":"它捡走山道上的落石，也捡走人们不愿背的行李。只有一只破箱子，始终找不到原来的主人。迟到的人在这里常常比早到的人年轻。","en":"It clears fallen stones and carries the luggage others leave behind. One broken trunk has never found its owner. Late arrivals here are often younger than those who came early."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·维温":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。迟到的人在这里常常比早到的人年轻。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. Late arrivals here are often younger than those who came early."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·希温":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。路人偶尔会为一句旧问候停下脚步。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. An old greeting sometimes stops a passerby."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·洛温":{"zh":"他的书页能把面孔擦得干净，书脊却写满了被遗忘的名字。他不让任何人翻到最后一页。","en":"His pages can wipe faces clean. The spine bears the names of the forgotten. No one is allowed to reach the last page."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·米温":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。一张过期的车票，也能让人等很多年。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. An expired ticket can keep someone waiting for years."},"铜钟晶棘蜥龙领誓·岚温":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。通向城外的台阶，总比记忆中多一级。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. The stairs out of the city always have one extra step."},"铜钟晶棘蜥龙领誓·索温":{"zh":"它收集过很多亮晶晶的东西，最后只留下了一片窗玻璃。透过那一片，看出去的天最像故乡。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"It collected many shining things, keeping only a shard of window glass. The sky through it looks most like home. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·莱温":{"zh":"披风已经烂透，里面的针线包却一直收得整齐。想来从前也是个不忍看人挨冻的人。每一扇关着的门，都曾经被认真敲过。","en":"The cloak has rotted through. The sewing kit inside is perfectly kept. Once, surely, this was someone who could not let others freeze. Every closed door has been knocked on with hope."},"铜钟浮辉使领誓·岑温":{"zh":"它的影子比身体清楚，像另一个世界留在地上的窗。有人经过时，窗里偶尔会亮起灯。城里的钟很多，走准的却一座也找不到。","en":"Its shadow is clearer than its body, a window from another world laid on the ground. Sometimes a passerby makes a lamp shine inside. The city has many clocks, and not one keeps time."},"铜钟晶棘蜥龙领誓·塔温":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。城里的钟很多，走准的却一座也找不到。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. The city has many clocks, and not one keeps time."},"铜钟灯议长·莫温":{"zh":"法术书里夹的都是寻路纸条。最复杂的公式旁边，写着一句很小的字：这里也不通。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"The spellbook is full of directions. Beside the most elaborate formula, a small note reads: This way is closed too. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟灯议长·伦温":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。一张过期的车票，也能让人等很多年。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. An expired ticket can keep someone waiting for years."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·佩温":{"zh":"他把每一道伤疤都称作勋章，直到有一天忘了勋章属于哪场战斗。城里的钟从未给过他休息的时辰。","en":"He calls every scar a medal. Now he cannot remember the battles they honor. The city’s bells have never marked an hour for rest."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·泽温":{"zh":"他的剑能劈开盾牌，脚步却总比钟声迟一拍。那一拍里，他听得见城门外有人叫他的名字。","en":"His sword splits shields, but his steps trail the bells by one beat. In that gap, someone beyond the gate calls his name."},"铜钟裂角客领誓·图温":{"zh":"被叫作怪物之后，它学会把笑藏起来。胸口那块干净的布，是第一个没有逃跑的人留下的。路人偶尔会为一句旧问候停下脚步。","en":"After being called a monster, it learned to hide its smile. The clean cloth at its chest came from the first person who did not run. An old greeting sometimes stops a passerby."},"铜钟镜瞳山猫领誓·芮温":{"zh":"窗台上所有东西都被它推下过，只有那张旧车票还在。也许它比任何人都清楚，什么才不能弄丢。城门上最后一次维修的日期，还是明天。","en":"It has pushed everything off the sill except an old ticket. Perhaps it knows best what must not be lost. The city gate was last repaired tomorrow."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·阿雅":{"zh":"他冻结的从来不是钟，而是人伸向门把的那一瞬间。冰里有很多只手，其中一只戴着与你相似的旧戒指。","en":"He freezes the instant a hand reaches for a door, not the clock that measures it. One hand in the ice wears a ring much like yours."},"铜钟镜瞳山猫领誓·艾雅":{"zh":"窗台上所有东西都被它推下过，只有那张旧车票还在。也许它比任何人都清楚，什么才不能弄丢。路人偶尔会为一句旧问候停下脚步。","en":"It has pushed everything off the sill except an old ticket. Perhaps it knows best what must not be lost. An old greeting sometimes stops a passerby."},"铜钟修灯师·伊雅":{"zh":"总说药不够，所以从不给自己留。只有旧围裙上的结，记着这双手也曾抖得厉害。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"There is never enough medicine, so none is kept for the healer. The knots in the old apron remember how badly these hands once shook. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟铠卫·欧雅":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。每次钟响，都有人觉得该出发了。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. Every bell convinces someone it is time to leave."},"铜钟铠卫·乌雅":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。路人偶尔会为一句旧问候停下脚步。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. An old greeting sometimes stops a passerby."},"铜钟铠卫·依雅":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。每次钟响，都有人觉得该出发了。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. Every bell convinces someone it is time to leave."},"铜钟巡灯使·雅雅":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。迟到的人在这里常常比早到的人年轻。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. Late arrivals here are often younger than those who came early."},"铜钟巡灯使·诺雅":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。每一扇关着的门，都曾经被认真敲过。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. Every closed door has been knocked on with hope."},"铜钟巡灯使·瑟雅":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。有些空房里，晚餐仍冒着热气。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Dinner still steams in some empty rooms."},"铜钟巡灯使·维雅":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。城里的钟很多，走准的却一座也找不到。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. The city has many clocks, and not one keeps time."},"铜钟巡灯使·希雅":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。迟到的人在这里常常比早到的人年轻。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. Late arrivals here are often younger than those who came early."},"铜钟巡灯使·洛雅":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。屋顶的灯同时熄灭，却从来不一起点亮。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. The rooftop lamps go dark together and never relight together."},"铜钟镜瞳山猫·米雅":{"zh":"它从不接受陌生人的呼唤，却总在旅人睡着后靠近灯火。等人醒来，行囊上便多一层温热的毛。迟到的人在这里常常比早到的人年轻。","en":"It ignores every stranger’s call, but approaches the lamp once travelers sleep. Warm fur on a pack is the only sign it stayed. Late arrivals here are often younger than those who came early."},"铜钟巡灯使·岚雅":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟巡灯使·索雅":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。城里的钟很多，走准的却一座也找不到。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. The city has many clocks, and not one keeps time."},"铜钟铠卫·莱雅":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。通向城外的台阶，总比记忆中多一级。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. The stairs out of the city always have one extra step."},"铜钟修灯师·岑雅":{"zh":"把采来的草按气味分类，最温和的那一捆留给睡不着的人。长夜里，这样的人很多。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"The herbs are sorted by scent. The gentlest bunch is for those who cannot sleep. There are many in this long night. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟观灯师·塔雅":{"zh":"帽檐缝着一圈错写的咒文。那是第一次学会法术时留下的失误，后来一直没有拆。城里的钟很多，走准的却一座也找不到。","en":"Misspelled charms line the hat brim. They are the first mistakes of a young apprentice, never unpicked. The city has many clocks, and not one keeps time."},"铜钟观灯师·莫雅":{"zh":"能让星光停在指间，却没法让一封回信早些到来。于是每晚的灯都亮得比别人久。迟到的人在这里常常比早到的人年轻。","en":"Starlight can be held between these fingers. A reply cannot be hurried. The study lamp burns later every night. Late arrivals here are often younger than those who came early."},"铜钟观灯师·伦雅":{"zh":"把所有仪式都简化之后，桌上只剩两只杯子。原来最难实现的愿望，不过是有人回来坐下。路人偶尔会为一句旧问候停下脚步。","en":"After simplifying every ritual, only two cups remain on the table. The hardest wish was always for someone to come back and sit down. An old greeting sometimes stops a passerby."},"铜钟掠风鸟·佩雅":{"zh":"它把路上捡来的线头编成巢，巢里却总空着一个位置。风每次改变方向，它都往远处多看一眼。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"It nests with threads found on the road, leaving one place empty. Every shift of wind makes it look farther away. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟观灯师·泽雅":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。每一扇关着的门，都曾经被认真敲过。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. Every closed door has been knocked on with hope."},"铜钟观灯师·图雅":{"zh":"把所有仪式都简化之后，桌上只剩两只杯子。原来最难实现的愿望，不过是有人回来坐下。城门上最后一次维修的日期，还是明天。","en":"After simplifying every ritual, only two cups remain on the table. The hardest wish was always for someone to come back and sit down. The city gate was last repaired tomorrow."},"铜钟巡灯使·芮雅":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。路人偶尔会为一句旧问候停下脚步。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. An old greeting sometimes stops a passerby."},"铜钟钩针蝎·阿弥":{"zh":"尾刺碰过的东西都会留下痕迹，唯独一只旧手套仍然完好。那是它还愿意相信温暖的理由。每一扇关着的门，都曾经被认真敲过。","en":"Everything touched by its sting bears a mark, except one old glove. That is why it still believes in warmth. Every closed door has been knocked on with hope."},"铜钟观灯师·艾弥":{"zh":"能让星光停在指间，却没法让一封回信早些到来。于是每晚的灯都亮得比别人久。路人偶尔会为一句旧问候停下脚步。","en":"Starlight can be held between these fingers. A reply cannot be hurried. The study lamp burns later every night. An old greeting sometimes stops a passerby."},"铜钟修灯师·伊弥":{"zh":"把采来的草按气味分类，最温和的那一捆留给睡不着的人。长夜里，这样的人很多。迟到的人在这里常常比早到的人年轻。","en":"The herbs are sorted by scent. The gentlest bunch is for those who cannot sleep. There are many in this long night. Late arrivals here are often younger than those who came early."},"铜钟浮辉使·欧弥":{"zh":"它的影子比身体清楚，像另一个世界留在地上的窗。有人经过时，窗里偶尔会亮起灯。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"Its shadow is clearer than its body, a window from another world laid on the ground. Sometimes a passerby makes a lamp shine inside. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟琉纹缄骨客":{"zh":"胸口少了一根骨头，原来的位置挂着一只小铃。铃响起来时，空洞里像有人在笑。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"A small bell hangs where a rib is missing. When it rings, the hollow chest seems to laugh. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟银露铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。每次钟响，都有人觉得该出发了。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. Every bell convinces someone it is time to leave."},"铜钟苔痕砂脊蜥":{"zh":"它在碎瓦间找暖和的位置，每次都会留出半边。也许冷过的小东西，比人更懂得分享余温。屋顶的灯同时熄灭，却从来不一起点亮。","en":"It finds warmth between broken tiles, always leaving half the space free. Small cold creatures may understand shared warmth best. The rooftop lamps go dark together and never relight together."},"铜钟藤印铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟雾羽铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟苔痕潜印客":{"zh":"从没偷过旅人的最后一块面包。被抓住时也只辩解一句：饿着肚子，跑不出这地方。城门上最后一次维修的日期，还是明天。","en":"The last piece of a traveler’s bread is never stolen. When caught, the only defense is that nobody escapes this place hungry. The city gate was last repaired tomorrow."},"铜钟铜缄潜印客":{"zh":"从没偷过旅人的最后一块面包。被抓住时也只辩解一句：饿着肚子，跑不出这地方。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"The last piece of a traveler’s bread is never stolen. When caught, the only defense is that nobody escapes this place hungry. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟苔痕折面星客":{"zh":"它不知道该用哪种表情欢迎客人，只好把所有的面孔都收起来。空白处反而让人觉得熟悉。城门上最后一次维修的日期，还是明天。","en":"Unsure which face should welcome a guest, it puts every face away. The blank space feels strangely familiar. The city gate was last repaired tomorrow."},"铜钟弧光铠卫":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。路人偶尔会为一句旧问候停下脚步。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. An old greeting sometimes stops a passerby."},"铜钟风蚀缄骨客":{"zh":"这副骨架曾替旅人搬过行李，如今连自己的名字都背不动了。路牌倒还认得几个。一张过期的车票，也能让人等很多年。","en":"This skeleton once carried travelers’ luggage. Now even its own name is too heavy, though a few signposts remain familiar. An expired ticket can keep someone waiting for years."},"铜钟铜缄苔痕铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。城里的钟很多，走准的却一座也找不到。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. The city has many clocks, and not one keeps time."},"铜钟静棱缄骨客":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。每次钟响，都有人觉得该出发了。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. Every bell convinces someone it is time to leave."},"铜钟绒雾缄骨客":{"zh":"这副骨架曾替旅人搬过行李，如今连自己的名字都背不动了。路牌倒还认得几个。每一扇关着的门，都曾经被认真敲过。","en":"This skeleton once carried travelers’ luggage. Now even its own name is too heavy, though a few signposts remain familiar. Every closed door has been knocked on with hope."},"铜钟夜航缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。有些空房里，晚餐仍冒着热气。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. Dinner still steams in some empty rooms."},"铜钟远路巡灯使":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。每一扇关着的门，都曾经被认真敲过。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Every closed door has been knocked on with hope."},"铜钟夜航观灯师":{"zh":"能让星光停在指间，却没法让一封回信早些到来。于是每晚的灯都亮得比别人久。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"Starlight can be held between these fingers. A reply cannot be hurried. The study lamp burns later every night. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟铜缄铜缄铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟流砂观灯师":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。一张过期的车票，也能让人等很多年。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. An expired ticket can keep someone waiting for years."},"铜钟苔痕甲灯虫":{"zh":"壳上的细纹像一张过时的地图。它循着本能迁徙，偶尔也会在岔路上停下，像在等谁提醒。通向城外的台阶，总比记忆中多一级。","en":"The fine marks on its shell resemble an outdated map. Even instinct stops at a fork sometimes, as if waiting for a reminder. The stairs out of the city always have one extra step."},"铜钟回声线尾鼠":{"zh":"它把亮纽扣藏在洞口，想让迟归的同伴找到家。后来洞口搬了很多次，纽扣始终带着。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"It places a bright button by its burrow for late companions. The burrow has moved many times. The button always comes too. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟微烛镜瞳山猫":{"zh":"它从不接受陌生人的呼唤，却总在旅人睡着后靠近灯火。等人醒来，行囊上便多一层温热的毛。城门上最后一次维修的日期，还是明天。","en":"It ignores every stranger’s call, but approaches the lamp once travelers sleep. Warm fur on a pack is the only sign it stayed. The city gate was last repaired tomorrow."},"铜钟回声潜印客":{"zh":"开锁的工具藏在发带里，真正的钥匙却挂在胸前。那扇门早已不见，钥匙一直没舍得换。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"Lock picks hide in the hairband. The real key hangs at the neck. Its door is long gone, but no other key will do. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟苔痕岩铃象":{"zh":"它把干净的水藏在漫长的路途中，遇见旅人便缓缓低下头。长牙上刻过的名字，雨洗不掉。通向城外的台阶，总比记忆中多一级。","en":"It carries clean water through the long journey and lowers its head to travelers. Rain cannot wash the names carved on its tusks away. The stairs out of the city always have one extra step."},"铜钟铜缄回声铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。城里的钟很多，走准的却一座也找不到。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. The city has many clocks, and not one keeps time."},"铜钟铜缄微烛铠卫":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。通向城外的台阶，总比记忆中多一级。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. The stairs out of the city always have one extra step."},"铜钟铜缄织光蛛":{"zh":"蛛网绕开了窗边那只旧杯子。杯里没有虫，只有一点落雨，足够等很久的人喝上一口。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"The web leaves an old cup untouched by the window. There are no insects inside, only enough rain for someone who has waited a long time. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟回声织光蛛":{"zh":"它常把断掉的丝接成路标，却从不在网上画一条死路。困住谁之前，总先留一个缺口。有些空房里，晚餐仍冒着热气。","en":"It mends broken threads into signposts, never marking a dead end. Every web keeps a gap before it catches anyone. Dinner still steams in some empty rooms."},"铜钟镜纹观灯师":{"zh":"记录了很多扇打不开的门，也记录了每个愿意陪着试一次的人。后一册薄得让人心疼。路人偶尔会为一句旧问候停下脚步。","en":"One book lists doors that would not open. Another lists those willing to try together. The second is painfully thin. An old greeting sometimes stops a passerby."},"铜钟微烛修灯师":{"zh":"把采来的草按气味分类，最温和的那一捆留给睡不着的人。长夜里，这样的人很多。城门上最后一次维修的日期，还是明天。","en":"The herbs are sorted by scent. The gentlest bunch is for those who cannot sleep. There are many in this long night. The city gate was last repaired tomorrow."},"铜钟铜缄折面星客":{"zh":"它用陌生的符号记录旅人的呼吸，纸上却总会出现一句你读得懂的话：还没到时候。路人偶尔会为一句旧问候停下脚步。","en":"It records travelers’ breathing in strange symbols. One sentence always appears that you can read: Not yet. An old greeting sometimes stops a passerby."},"铜钟铜缄琉纹铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。屋顶的灯同时熄灭，却从来不一起点亮。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. The rooftop lamps go dark together and never relight together."},"铜钟铜缄风蚀铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟铜缄静棱铠卫":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟铜缄绒雾铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。每次钟响，都有人觉得该出发了。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. Every bell convinces someone it is time to leave."},"铜钟铜缄夜航铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟回声浮辉使":{"zh":"它从一盏熄灭的灯里走出来，忘了自己原来照过谁。每当听见脚步，微光总会先亮一点。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"It emerged from an extinguished lamp, forgetting whom it once lit the way for. Footsteps still make it brighten. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟远路观灯师":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。迟到的人在这里常常比早到的人年轻。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. Late arrivals here are often younger than those who came early."},"铜钟流砂缄骨客":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。一张过期的车票，也能让人等很多年。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. An expired ticket can keep someone waiting for years."},"铜钟铜缄流砂铠卫":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。城门上最后一次维修的日期，还是明天。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. The city gate was last repaired tomorrow."},"铜钟铜缄镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。迟到的人在这里常常比早到的人年轻。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. Late arrivals here are often younger than those who came early."},"铜钟铜缄远路铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。每一扇关着的门，都曾经被认真敲过。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. Every closed door has been knocked on with hope."},"铜钟石封观灯师":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟铜缄石封铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。相识的人少了，替人留的座位却多了。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. There are fewer familiar faces and more reserved seats."},"铜钟铜缄鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。谁也没见过报时人，却都认得那段旋律。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. No one has seen the bell ringer, but everyone knows the tune."},"铜钟铜缄暖灰铠卫":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。屋顶的灯同时熄灭，却从来不一起点亮。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. The rooftop lamps go dark together and never relight together."},"铜钟铜缄悬灯铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。迟到的人在这里常常比早到的人年轻。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. Late arrivals here are often younger than those who came early."},"铜钟苔痕刺灯兽":{"zh":"刺上挂着一路捡来的小果子。遇见空肚子的旅人时，它会转过身，假装那些东西只是碰巧掉下来。一张过期的车票，也能让人等很多年。","en":"Small fruits picked up along the road cling to its spines. Near a hungry traveler, it turns around and pretends they fell by accident. An expired ticket can keep someone waiting for years."},"铜钟铜缄银露铠卫":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。屋顶的灯同时熄灭，却从来不一起点亮。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. The rooftop lamps go dark together and never relight together."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·乌弥":{"zh":"他替没有主人的工坊巡夜，靴底带着熔化的铜。每次有人问路，他都会先把身后的炉门关好。","en":"He patrols ownerless workshops with melted copper under his boots. When anyone asks directions, he first closes the furnace behind him."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·依弥":{"zh":"他把走近熔炉的人拦在一臂之外。没人知道炉里烧的是什么，只知道他从不肯让背影留在火光里。","en":"He keeps everyone an arm’s length from the furnace. No one knows what it burns. He never turns his back on its light."},"炽砂枝灯树灵领誓·雅弥":{"zh":"它记得每个靠在树荫下睡着的人。年轮一圈圈长大，总给那些人的位置留一点空。这里最常听见的愿望，是下次一起走。","en":"It remembers everyone who slept beneath its shade. Each new ring leaves a little room where they once rested. The commonest wish here is to leave together next time."},"炽砂灯议长·诺弥":{"zh":"他造出的分身会在天亮前化成碎晶。分身们却总在散去之前，替他检查一遍那扇打不开的门。","en":"His crystal doubles fall apart before dawn. Each one checks the same locked door before it vanishes."},"炽砂灯议长·瑟弥":{"zh":"他把废弃工棚改成救护所，床位永远比伤员少一个。你看见门后的铺盖，才知道最后一个位置留给了谁。","en":"He made a hospital of an abandoned shed. There is always one bed too few. The bedding behind the door reveals who gave up the last place."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·维弥":{"zh":"他把余温分给还握得住武器的人，自己只留一盏冷灯。灯壳上刻着一句话：别再一个人走。","en":"He gives the remaining warmth to anyone still able to hold a weapon. His own lamp is cold. Its case reads: Do not walk alone again."},"炽砂缄骨客领誓·希弥":{"zh":"他从灰里拾起遇难者的扣子，装进一只不响的铁盒。盒盖内侧的字，你已经在别处见过。","en":"He gathers the lost travelers’ buttons into a silent tin. The words inside its lid are words you have seen elsewhere."},"炽砂裂角客领誓·洛弥":{"zh":"它把自己困在窄门里太久，几乎忘了角也可以低下来。门外一直有人替它留着灯。出城的地图总少一角，像被同一只手撕过。","en":"It has stood trapped in a narrow doorway so long it forgot that horns can be lowered. Someone still leaves a lamp outside. Every map out lacks one corner, torn by the same hand."},"炽砂灯议长·米弥":{"zh":"他让影子代自己出门，影子每次都空手回来。后来他发现，真正没有迈过门槛的一直是自己。","en":"He sends his shadow out in his place. It always returns empty-handed. At last he realizes which of them has never crossed the threshold."},"炽砂凝光泥团领誓·岚弥":{"zh":"它把掉进身体里的小东西一件件吐回岸上，唯独留着一颗玻璃珠。透过那颗珠子，天会显得很蓝。能带走的东西不多，温度算其中一种。","en":"It returns everything that falls into its body to the bank, keeping one glass marble. Through it, the sky looks very blue. Few things can be taken along. Warmth is one of them."},"炽砂峰脊巨灵领誓·索弥":{"zh":"巨人把火捂在掌中，以为这样就不会有人再受伤。直到你看见，他掌心里的路一直没有熄灭。","en":"The giant cups the fire to keep it from hurting anyone. In his palms you find a road that has never stopped burning."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·莱弥":{"zh":"他曾为每条出城的路点灯，后来灯全熔成了红色的河。他仍沿河巡视，不肯承认自己已经迷路。","en":"He once lit every road out of the city. The lamps melted into red rivers. He patrols their banks, unwilling to admit he is lost."},"炽砂晶棘蜥龙领誓·岑弥":{"zh":"翅膀上的伤口已经长好，试飞却总在最后一刻停住。有些距离不是伤好了，就敢再走一次。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"The wing has healed, but every test flight stops at the last moment. Some distances remain frightening after wounds close. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·塔弥":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。有人留下工具，有人留下等人的习惯。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. Some leave tools behind. Others leave the habit of waiting."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·莫弥":{"zh":"他的盾上嵌着一块不会冷却的雷石。雷声每次落下，都像有人在远处替他敲开一扇门。","en":"A thunderstone set in his shield never cools. Each peal sounds like someone opening a distant door for him."},"炽砂灯议长·伦弥":{"zh":"他能把灰里的旧友叫回身边，却总在对方开口前先道歉。有人已经回来过太多次，不再记得为何要出发。","en":"He can call old friends back from the ash. He apologizes before they speak. Some have returned too often to remember why they once set out."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·佩弥":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。修补过的东西，往往比新的更能让人放心。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. Repaired things can be more reassuring than new ones."},"炽砂晶棘蜥龙领誓·泽弥":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。能带走的东西不多，温度算其中一种。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. Few things can be taken along. Warmth is one of them."},"炽砂灯议长·图弥":{"zh":"他把雷引到身后，让所有人误以为自己走在最前面。只有停电的夜里，才有人发现他也在找路。","en":"He draws lightning behind him so everyone thinks he leads the way. Only on powerless nights does anyone notice he is searching too."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·芮弥":{"zh":"他为同一场离别练过许多种姿态，拿剑、拿枪、空着双手。对方始终没有回来教他该如何放下。","en":"He rehearsed the same farewell with sword, spear, and empty hands. The one who left never returned to teach him how to let go."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·阿罗":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂巡影狼领誓·艾罗":{"zh":"它闻得出藏在雪里的路，也闻得出同行者的恐惧。所以它偶尔停下，假装只是需要休息。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"It scents roads under the snow, and fear in its companions. Sometimes it stops and pretends it needs a rest. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂灯议长·伊罗":{"zh":"他记得一句话的三个版本：别走、带我走、你已经回来过。每到炉火变色时，他便换一种说法。","en":"He remembers three versions of one plea: Do not go. Take me with you. You have already returned. The furnace changes color, and so does his answer."},"炽砂峰脊巨灵领誓·欧罗":{"zh":"它捡走山道上的落石，也捡走人们不愿背的行李。只有一只破箱子，始终找不到原来的主人。能带走的东西不多，温度算其中一种。","en":"It clears fallen stones and carries the luggage others leave behind. One broken trunk has never found its owner. Few things can be taken along. Warmth is one of them."},"炽砂裂角客领誓·乌罗":{"zh":"它把自己困在窄门里太久，几乎忘了角也可以低下来。门外一直有人替它留着灯。修补过的东西，往往比新的更能让人放心。","en":"It has stood trapped in a narrow doorway so long it forgot that horns can be lowered. Someone still leaves a lamp outside. Repaired things can be more reassuring than new ones."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·依罗":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。墙上画着一个门框，里面的天还没有颜色。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. A doorway is painted on the wall. Its sky has no color yet."},"炽砂晶棘蜥龙领誓·雅罗":{"zh":"龙把烧成黑色的星图压在爪下，那里标着一条向上的路。你觉得图上的裂纹，像极了自己的掌纹。","en":"A charred star chart lies beneath the dragon’s claws, marking a road upward. Its cracks resemble the lines of your palm."},"炽砂灯议长·诺罗":{"zh":"他不再打造兵器，只在炉边替旅人修补旧物。轮到你的灯时，他惊讶地发现，里面已有自己的修补痕迹。","en":"He no longer forges weapons, only repairs what travelers bring. Inside your lamp he finds a repair he remembers making."},"炽砂修灯师·瑟罗":{"zh":"每次包扎完伤口，都会在绷带上画一个笑脸。最初是哄孩子，后来发现大人也需要。这里最常听见的愿望，是下次一起走。","en":"A smiling face is drawn on every finished bandage. It began for children. Adults turned out to need it too. The commonest wish here is to leave together next time."},"炽砂铠卫·维罗":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。越往前走，旧修补的痕迹就越熟悉。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. The farther the road goes, the more familiar the repairs become."},"炽砂巡灯使·希罗":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂巡灯使·洛罗":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。旅途留下的裂口，也会变成认人的记号。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. The journey’s cracks can become marks of recognition."},"炽砂缄骨客·米罗":{"zh":"披风已经烂透，里面的针线包却一直收得整齐。想来从前也是个不忍看人挨冻的人。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"The cloak has rotted through. The sewing kit inside is perfectly kept. Once, surely, this was someone who could not let others freeze. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂缄骨客·岚罗":{"zh":"胸口少了一根骨头，原来的位置挂着一只小铃。铃响起来时，空洞里像有人在笑。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"A small bell hangs where a rib is missing. When it rings, the hollow chest seems to laugh. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂潜印客·索罗":{"zh":"擅长从人群中消失，却总在有人落单时现身。借口每次都一样：碰巧顺路。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"Expert at vanishing into crowds, yet always appearing beside anyone left alone. The excuse is always the same: Going that way anyway. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂铠卫·莱罗":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂铠卫·岑罗":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂铠卫·塔罗":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。每次火停下来，远处都会响起很轻的脚步。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. When the fire falls quiet, faint footsteps sound far away."},"炽砂潜印客·莫罗":{"zh":"围巾背面缝满暗袋，只有一个口袋是空的。有人欠下一句道别，至今还没来放进去。旅途留下的裂口，也会变成认人的记号。","en":"Hidden pockets line the scarf. Only one is empty. Someone still owes it a farewell. The journey’s cracks can become marks of recognition."},"炽砂铠卫·伦罗":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂潜印客·佩罗":{"zh":"擅长从人群中消失，却总在有人落单时现身。借口每次都一样：碰巧顺路。旅途留下的裂口，也会变成认人的记号。","en":"Expert at vanishing into crowds, yet always appearing beside anyone left alone. The excuse is always the same: Going that way anyway. The journey’s cracks can become marks of recognition."},"炽砂巡灯使·泽罗":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。旅途留下的裂口，也会变成认人的记号。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. The journey’s cracks can become marks of recognition."},"炽砂修灯师·图罗":{"zh":"行李里最重的东西是一口小锅。只要还能煮出热汤，旅途就不算到了绝路。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"A small pot is the heaviest thing in the pack. As long as there is hot soup, the journey has not reached its end. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂铠卫·芮罗":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂观灯师·阿安":{"zh":"记录了很多扇打不开的门，也记录了每个愿意陪着试一次的人。后一册薄得让人心疼。有人留下工具，有人留下等人的习惯。","en":"One book lists doors that would not open. Another lists those willing to try together. The second is painfully thin. Some leave tools behind. Others leave the habit of waiting."},"炽砂观灯师·艾安":{"zh":"记录了很多扇打不开的门，也记录了每个愿意陪着试一次的人。后一册薄得让人心疼。墙上画着一个门框，里面的天还没有颜色。","en":"One book lists doors that would not open. Another lists those willing to try together. The second is painfully thin. A doorway is painted on the wall. Its sky has no color yet."},"炽砂观灯师·伊安":{"zh":"记录了很多扇打不开的门，也记录了每个愿意陪着试一次的人。后一册薄得让人心疼。出城的地图总少一角，像被同一只手撕过。","en":"One book lists doors that would not open. Another lists those willing to try together. The second is painfully thin. Every map out lacks one corner, torn by the same hand."},"炽砂潜印客·欧安":{"zh":"开锁的工具藏在发带里，真正的钥匙却挂在胸前。那扇门早已不见，钥匙一直没舍得换。有人留下工具，有人留下等人的习惯。","en":"Lock picks hide in the hairband. The real key hangs at the neck. Its door is long gone, but no other key will do. Some leave tools behind. Others leave the habit of waiting."},"炽砂观灯师·乌安":{"zh":"帽檐缝着一圈错写的咒文。那是第一次学会法术时留下的失误，后来一直没有拆。墙上画着一个门框，里面的天还没有颜色。","en":"Misspelled charms line the hat brim. They are the first mistakes of a young apprentice, never unpicked. A doorway is painted on the wall. Its sky has no color yet."},"炽砂铠卫·依安":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。这里最常听见的愿望，是下次一起走。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. The commonest wish here is to leave together next time."},"炽砂铠卫·雅安":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。越往前走，旧修补的痕迹就越熟悉。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. The farther the road goes, the more familiar the repairs become."},"炽砂修灯师·诺安":{"zh":"行李里最重的东西是一口小锅。只要还能煮出热汤，旅途就不算到了绝路。每次火停下来，远处都会响起很轻的脚步。","en":"A small pot is the heaviest thing in the pack. As long as there is hot soup, the journey has not reached its end. When the fire falls quiet, faint footsteps sound far away."},"炽砂潜印客·瑟安":{"zh":"开锁的工具藏在发带里，真正的钥匙却挂在胸前。那扇门早已不见，钥匙一直没舍得换。出城的地图总少一角，像被同一只手撕过。","en":"Lock picks hide in the hairband. The real key hangs at the neck. Its door is long gone, but no other key will do. Every map out lacks one corner, torn by the same hand."},"炽砂铠卫·维安":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。修补过的东西，往往比新的更能让人放心。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. Repaired things can be more reassuring than new ones."},"炽砂巡灯使·希安":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。越往前走，旧修补的痕迹就越熟悉。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. The farther the road goes, the more familiar the repairs become."},"炽砂铠卫·洛安":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。墙上画着一个门框，里面的天还没有颜色。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. A doorway is painted on the wall. Its sky has no color yet."},"炽砂铠卫·米安":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。炉里的火，有时会照出还没发生的重逢。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. The furnace sometimes shows reunions that have not happened yet."},"炽砂微烛缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。每次火停下来，远处都会响起很轻的脚步。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. When the fire falls quiet, faint footsteps sound far away."},"炽砂琉纹缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。出城的地图总少一角，像被同一只手撕过。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. Every map out lacks one corner, torn by the same hand."},"炽砂苔痕环藤蛇":{"zh":"它把蜕下的皮留在温暖的石缝，自己守着更冷的入口。有人看见过小兽躲进那些旧皮里避雨。能带走的东西不多，温度算其中一种。","en":"It leaves its cast skin in warm crevices and guards the colder entrance. Small animals have been seen sheltering in the old skins. Few things can be taken along. Warmth is one of them."},"炽砂苔痕棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"脖子上的绳扣早已空了，它还是每天到同一盏灯下等。陌生人伸手时，它会先闻一闻故乡的气味。这里最常听见的愿望，是下次一起走。","en":"The clasp at its neck is empty. It still waits beneath the same lamp, sniffing every offered hand for a trace of home. The commonest wish here is to leave together next time."},"炽砂铜缄铜缄铠卫":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。修补过的东西，往往比新的更能让人放心。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. Repaired things can be more reassuring than new ones."},"炽砂铜缄回声铠卫":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂铜缄微烛铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。修补过的东西，往往比新的更能让人放心。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. Repaired things can be more reassuring than new ones."},"炽砂铜缄琉纹铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。每次火停下来，远处都会响起很轻的脚步。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. When the fire falls quiet, faint footsteps sound far away."},"炽砂铜缄风蚀铠卫":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。旅途留下的裂口，也会变成认人的记号。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. The journey’s cracks can become marks of recognition."},"炽砂琉纹修灯师":{"zh":"总说药不够，所以从不给自己留。只有旧围裙上的结，记着这双手也曾抖得厉害。越往前走，旧修补的痕迹就越熟悉。","en":"There is never enough medicine, so none is kept for the healer. The knots in the old apron remember how badly these hands once shook. The farther the road goes, the more familiar the repairs become."},"炽砂风蚀缄骨客":{"zh":"胸口少了一根骨头，原来的位置挂着一只小铃。铃响起来时，空洞里像有人在笑。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"A small bell hangs where a rib is missing. When it rings, the hollow chest seems to laugh. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂静棱缄骨客":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。炉里的火，有时会照出还没发生的重逢。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. The furnace sometimes shows reunions that have not happened yet."},"炽砂回声裂角客":{"zh":"角上的旧绳结是别人替系的。模样看着凶，路边落单的小东西却总往它脚下躲。墙上画着一个门框，里面的天还没有颜色。","en":"Someone else tied the old knot around its horns. Fearsome as it looks, small lost creatures shelter at its feet. A doorway is painted on the wall. Its sky has no color yet."},"炽砂绒雾缄骨客":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。这里最常听见的愿望，是下次一起走。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. The commonest wish here is to leave together next time."},"炽砂夜航缄骨客":{"zh":"这副骨架曾替旅人搬过行李，如今连自己的名字都背不动了。路牌倒还认得几个。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"This skeleton once carried travelers’ luggage. Now even its own name is too heavy, though a few signposts remain familiar. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂苔痕掠风鸟":{"zh":"翅下藏着一片来自别处的落叶。飞得再远，那片叶子也没有掉下来过。炉里的火，有时会照出还没发生的重逢。","en":"A leaf from elsewhere rests beneath one wing. No flight has ever shaken it loose. The furnace sometimes shows reunions that have not happened yet."},"炽砂铜缄掠风鸟":{"zh":"翅下藏着一片来自别处的落叶。飞得再远，那片叶子也没有掉下来过。有人留下工具，有人留下等人的习惯。","en":"A leaf from elsewhere rests beneath one wing. No flight has ever shaken it loose. Some leave tools behind. Others leave the habit of waiting."},"炽砂铜缄巡影狼":{"zh":"狼在每次进食前都把第一口留在地上。它已经独行很久，却还没有学会只等自己一个。旅途留下的裂口，也会变成认人的记号。","en":"The wolf leaves the first bite on the ground. It has traveled alone for years and has not learned to wait only for itself. The journey’s cracks can become marks of recognition."},"炽砂铜缄静棱铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂铜缄绒雾铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。有人留下工具，有人留下等人的习惯。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. Some leave tools behind. Others leave the habit of waiting."},"炽砂苔痕砂脊蜥":{"zh":"它在碎瓦间找暖和的位置，每次都会留出半边。也许冷过的小东西，比人更懂得分享余温。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"It finds warmth between broken tiles, always leaving half the space free. Small cold creatures may understand shared warmth best. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂铜缄砂脊蜥":{"zh":"尾巴断过一次，新的长得很慢。它学会了在向前跑之前，先看看身后的同伴有没有跟上。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"Its lost tail is growing back slowly. Before running ahead, it has learned to check whether its companions are following. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂风蚀修灯师":{"zh":"行李里最重的东西是一口小锅。只要还能煮出热汤，旅途就不算到了绝路。出城的地图总少一角，像被同一只手撕过。","en":"A small pot is the heaviest thing in the pack. As long as there is hot soup, the journey has not reached its end. Every map out lacks one corner, torn by the same hand."},"炽砂铜缄夜航铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。旅途留下的裂口，也会变成认人的记号。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. The journey’s cracks can become marks of recognition."},"炽砂回声峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"肩上的鸟巢早已空了，它仍在过桥时低头。旧习惯比石头重，却比石头暖和。出城的地图总少一角，像被同一只手撕过。","en":"The nest on its shoulder is empty. It still ducks under every bridge. Old habits weigh more than stone, and keep it warmer. Every map out lacks one corner, torn by the same hand."},"炽砂流砂缄骨客":{"zh":"胸口少了一根骨头，原来的位置挂着一只小铃。铃响起来时，空洞里像有人在笑。修补过的东西，往往比新的更能让人放心。","en":"A small bell hangs where a rib is missing. When it rings, the hollow chest seems to laugh. Repaired things can be more reassuring than new ones."},"炽砂苔痕匣中客":{"zh":"箱盖里藏着很多牙，也藏着一只没有拆开的礼物盒。它学会咬人之前，似乎也曾学过等待主人。旅途留下的裂口，也会变成认人的记号。","en":"The lid conceals teeth and an unopened gift. Before learning to bite, the chest may have learned to wait for its owner. The journey’s cracks can become marks of recognition."},"炽砂镜纹缄骨客":{"zh":"胸口少了一根骨头，原来的位置挂着一只小铃。铃响起来时，空洞里像有人在笑。炉里的火，有时会照出还没发生的重逢。","en":"A small bell hangs where a rib is missing. When it rings, the hollow chest seems to laugh. The furnace sometimes shows reunions that have not happened yet."},"炽砂铜缄流砂铠卫":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。每次火停下来，远处都会响起很轻的脚步。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. When the fire falls quiet, faint footsteps sound far away."},"炽砂远路缄骨客":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。越往前走，旧修补的痕迹就越熟悉。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. The farther the road goes, the more familiar the repairs become."},"炽砂石封缄骨客":{"zh":"它沿着墓碑练习自己的字迹，写到最后，总把落款留成空白。也许是在等别人帮它想起。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"It practices its handwriting on the gravestones, always leaving the signature blank. Perhaps someone else will remember. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂苔痕铜壳蟹":{"zh":"它横着搬走路上的碎玻璃，又把每一片摆在洞口。月亮照下来时，那座小屋比别处都亮。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"It clears shards from the path and arranges them outside its burrow. In moonlight, its little home shines brighter than any other. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂微烛裂角客":{"zh":"它把自己困在窄门里太久，几乎忘了角也可以低下来。门外一直有人替它留着灯。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"It has stood trapped in a narrow doorway so long it forgot that horns can be lowered. Someone still leaves a lamp outside. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂静棱修灯师":{"zh":"每次包扎完伤口，都会在绷带上画一个笑脸。最初是哄孩子，后来发现大人也需要。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"A smiling face is drawn on every finished bandage. It began for children. Adults turned out to need it too. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂苔痕地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"它沿着地下的旧石缝前行，把断掉的路重新钻通。没人感谢过它，地上的脚步却因此少了一点孤单。墙上画着一个门框，里面的天还没有颜色。","en":"It follows old cracks underground, reopening broken passages. No one thanks it, though footsteps above grow a little less lonely. A doorway is painted on the wall. Its sky has no color yet."},"炽砂铜缄镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂静棱观灯师":{"zh":"把所有仪式都简化之后，桌上只剩两只杯子。原来最难实现的愿望，不过是有人回来坐下。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"After simplifying every ritual, only two cups remain on the table. The hardest wish was always for someone to come back and sit down. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂铜缄远路铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。旅途留下的裂口，也会变成认人的记号。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. The journey’s cracks can become marks of recognition."},"炽砂铜缄石封铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。能带走的东西不多，温度算其中一种。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. Few things can be taken along. Warmth is one of them."},"炽砂鸣枝缄骨客":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。能带走的东西不多，温度算其中一种。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. Few things can be taken along. Warmth is one of them."},"炽砂回声巡影狼":{"zh":"它闻得出藏在雪里的路，也闻得出同行者的恐惧。所以它偶尔停下，假装只是需要休息。能带走的东西不多，温度算其中一种。","en":"It scents roads under the snow, and fear in its companions. Sometimes it stops and pretends it needs a rest. Few things can be taken along. Warmth is one of them."},"炽砂夜航巡灯使":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。旅途留下的裂口，也会变成认人的记号。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. The journey’s cracks can become marks of recognition."},"炽砂苔痕折面星客":{"zh":"它用陌生的符号记录旅人的呼吸，纸上却总会出现一句你读得懂的话：还没到时候。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"It records travelers’ breathing in strange symbols. One sentence always appears that you can read: Not yet. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂琉纹裂角客":{"zh":"角上的旧绳结是别人替系的。模样看着凶，路边落单的小东西却总往它脚下躲。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"Someone else tied the old knot around its horns. Fearsome as it looks, small lost creatures shelter at its feet. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂苔痕石指傀儡":{"zh":"它学会了敲门，却没有学会等门打开。如今总在同一扇空门框旁练习，动作一天比一天轻。城里的灰落得很轻，像怕惊醒谁。","en":"It learned to knock, but not to wait for a door to open. Now it practices at an empty frame, more gently each day. The city ash falls softly, afraid to wake someone."},"炽砂铜缄环藤蛇":{"zh":"它的鳞片认得土地的温度，身体却始终记得一只捧起过它的手。遇见脚步时，它不再立刻逃走。修补过的东西，往往比新的更能让人放心。","en":"Its scales know the ground’s warmth. Its body remembers a hand that once lifted it. It no longer flees at the first footstep. Repaired things can be more reassuring than new ones."},"炽砂回声环藤蛇":{"zh":"它的鳞片认得土地的温度，身体却始终记得一只捧起过它的手。遇见脚步时，它不再立刻逃走。能带走的东西不多，温度算其中一种。","en":"Its scales know the ground’s warmth. Its body remembers a hand that once lifted it. It no longer flees at the first footstep. Few things can be taken along. Warmth is one of them."},"炽砂微烛环藤蛇":{"zh":"它的鳞片认得土地的温度，身体却始终记得一只捧起过它的手。遇见脚步时，它不再立刻逃走。有人留下工具，有人留下等人的习惯。","en":"Its scales know the ground’s warmth. Its body remembers a hand that once lifted it. It no longer flees at the first footstep. Some leave tools behind. Others leave the habit of waiting."},"炽砂回声砂脊蜥":{"zh":"它在碎瓦间找暖和的位置，每次都会留出半边。也许冷过的小东西，比人更懂得分享余温。越往前走，旧修补的痕迹就越熟悉。","en":"It finds warmth between broken tiles, always leaving half the space free. Small cold creatures may understand shared warmth best. The farther the road goes, the more familiar the repairs become."},"炽砂铜缄鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。有人留下工具，有人留下等人的习惯。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. Some leave tools behind. Others leave the habit of waiting."},"炽砂铜缄暖灰铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。墙上画着一个门框，里面的天还没有颜色。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. A doorway is painted on the wall. Its sky has no color yet."},"炽砂铜缄悬灯铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。火光里偶尔闪过一座不该出现的渡口。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. A crossing that should not be here flickers in the fire."},"炽砂铜缄银露铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。墙上画着一个门框，里面的天还没有颜色。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. A doorway is painted on the wall. Its sky has no color yet."},"炽砂铜缄枝灯树灵":{"zh":"根须抱着一只生锈的旅行箱，枝条却一直伸向远方。箱子没打开过，像一个不能轻易答应的邀请。墙上画着一个门框，里面的天还没有颜色。","en":"Its roots clasp a rusted suitcase while its branches reach away. The case stays closed, an invitation not easily accepted. A doorway is painted on the wall. Its sky has no color yet."},"炽砂微烛巡影狼":{"zh":"狼在每次进食前都把第一口留在地上。它已经独行很久，却还没有学会只等自己一个。墙上画着一个门框，里面的天还没有颜色。","en":"The wolf leaves the first bite on the ground. It has traveled alone for years and has not learned to wait only for itself. A doorway is painted on the wall. Its sky has no color yet."},"炽砂铜缄藤印铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。炉里的火，有时会照出还没发生的重逢。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. The furnace sometimes shows reunions that have not happened yet."},"炽砂铜缄雾羽铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。越往前走，旧修补的痕迹就越熟悉。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. The farther the road goes, the more familiar the repairs become."},"炽砂铜缄弧光铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。修补过的东西，往往比新的更能让人放心。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. Repaired things can be more reassuring than new ones."},"炽砂苔痕甲灯虫":{"zh":"壳上的细纹像一张过时的地图。它循着本能迁徙，偶尔也会在岔路上停下，像在等谁提醒。出城的地图总少一角，像被同一只手撕过。","en":"The fine marks on its shell resemble an outdated map. Even instinct stops at a fork sometimes, as if waiting for a reminder. Every map out lacks one corner, torn by the same hand."},"炽砂绒雾修灯师":{"zh":"总说药不够，所以从不给自己留。只有旧围裙上的结，记着这双手也曾抖得厉害。修补过的东西，往往比新的更能让人放心。","en":"There is never enough medicine, so none is kept for the healer. The knots in the old apron remember how badly these hands once shook. Repaired things can be more reassuring than new ones."},"炽砂苔痕绛纹蝶":{"zh":"它落在破损的信纸上，把没有写完的部分当作翅膀。收信的人不在这里，它仍追着光飞。墙上画着一个门框，里面的天还没有颜色。","en":"It settles on a torn letter and wears the unwritten part as wings. The recipient is elsewhere. It keeps following the light. A doorway is painted on the wall. Its sky has no color yet."},"炽砂苔痕露囊蛙":{"zh":"雨停后它仍在叫，像怕晚到的人错过渡口。荷叶下压着一截旧绳，另一头早被水流带走。每次火停下来，远处都会响起很轻的脚步。","en":"It calls after the rain stops, afraid a late traveler might miss the crossing. An old rope lies beneath its leaf, its far end carried away. When the fire falls quiet, faint footsteps sound far away."},"炽砂暖灰缄骨客":{"zh":"胸口少了一根骨头，原来的位置挂着一只小铃。铃响起来时，空洞里像有人在笑。旅途留下的裂口，也会变成认人的记号。","en":"A small bell hangs where a rib is missing. When it rings, the hollow chest seems to laugh. The journey’s cracks can become marks of recognition."},"炽砂微烛峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"它捡走山道上的落石，也捡走人们不愿背的行李。只有一只破箱子，始终找不到原来的主人。出城的地图总少一角，像被同一只手撕过。","en":"It clears fallen stones and carries the luggage others leave behind. One broken trunk has never found its owner. Every map out lacks one corner, torn by the same hand."},"苔庭铠卫·岚安":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。问起出口时，回答总要慢上一会儿。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. Answers come a little slower when the exit is mentioned."},"铜钟缄骨客·索安":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。屋顶的灯同时熄灭，却从来不一起点亮。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. The rooftop lamps go dark together and never relight together."},"炽砂回声苔痕铠卫":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。每次火停下来，远处都会响起很轻的脚步。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. When the fire falls quiet, faint footsteps sound far away."},"炽砂铠卫·莱安":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。炉里的火，有时会照出还没发生的重逢。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. The furnace sometimes shows reunions that have not happened yet."},"砂镜凝光泥团领誓·岑安":{"zh":"它把掉进身体里的小东西一件件吐回岸上，唯独留着一颗玻璃珠。透过那颗珠子，天会显得很蓝。它像一条岔路，又像一段被落下的往事。","en":"It returns everything that falls into its body to the bank, keeping one glass marble. Through it, the sky looks very blue. This place resembles both a side road and a memory left behind."},"砂镜铠卫领誓·塔安":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。旧物上的灰，藏着比文字更久的记忆。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. Dust on old things holds memories older than words."},"砂镜铠卫领誓·莫安":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。矿井的深处，有时听得见熟悉的笑声。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. Familiar laughter sometimes rises from the deep mine."},"砂镜裂角客领誓·伦安":{"zh":"它用尾巴把掉进沟里的灯捞起，再装作什么都没发生。谢意让它比火还要不自在。它像一条岔路，又像一段被落下的往事。","en":"It fishes a fallen lamp from the ditch with its tail and pretends nothing happened. Gratitude makes it more uneasy than fire. This place resembles both a side road and a memory left behind."},"砂镜峰脊巨灵领誓·佩安":{"zh":"肩上的鸟巢早已空了，它仍在过桥时低头。旧习惯比石头重，却比石头暖和。一个空口袋，也可能装着很重的约定。","en":"The nest on its shoulder is empty. It still ducks under every bridge. Old habits weigh more than stone, and keep it warmer. An empty pocket can hold a very heavy promise."},"砂镜裂角客领誓·泽安":{"zh":"它用尾巴把掉进沟里的灯捞起，再装作什么都没发生。谢意让它比火还要不自在。矿井的深处，有时听得见熟悉的笑声。","en":"It fishes a fallen lamp from the ditch with its tail and pretends nothing happened. Gratitude makes it more uneasy than fire. Familiar laughter sometimes rises from the deep mine."},"砂镜铠卫领誓·图安":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。矿井的深处，有时听得见熟悉的笑声。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. Familiar laughter sometimes rises from the deep mine."},"砂镜凝光泥团领誓·芮安":{"zh":"它把掉进身体里的小东西一件件吐回岸上，唯独留着一颗玻璃珠。透过那颗珠子，天会显得很蓝。没寄出的信，也能把人带到很远的地方。","en":"It returns everything that falls into its body to the bank, keeping one glass marble. Through it, the sky looks very blue. An unsent letter can still carry someone far."},"砂镜织光蛛领誓·阿瑟":{"zh":"它常把断掉的丝接成路标，却从不在网上画一条死路。困住谁之前，总先留一个缺口。陌生的回声，偶尔也会用自己的声音回答。","en":"It mends broken threads into signposts, never marking a dead end. Every web keeps a gap before it catches anyone. An unfamiliar echo sometimes answers in your own voice."},"砂镜裂角客领誓·艾瑟":{"zh":"角上的旧绳结是别人替系的。模样看着凶，路边落单的小东西却总往它脚下躲。被遗忘的名字，在石壁上反而刻得最深。","en":"Someone else tied the old knot around its horns. Fearsome as it looks, small lost creatures shelter at its feet. Forgotten names are carved deepest in the stone."},"砂镜晶棘蜥龙领誓·伊瑟":{"zh":"翅膀上的伤口已经长好，试飞却总在最后一刻停住。有些距离不是伤好了，就敢再走一次。陌生的回声，偶尔也会用自己的声音回答。","en":"The wing has healed, but every test flight stops at the last moment. Some distances remain frightening after wounds close. An unfamiliar echo sometimes answers in your own voice."},"砂镜灯议长·欧瑟":{"zh":"能让星光停在指间，却没法让一封回信早些到来。于是每晚的灯都亮得比别人久。回声从不回答来处，只回答还在不在。","en":"Starlight can be held between these fingers. A reply cannot be hurried. The study lamp burns later every night. The echo never tells where you came from, only whether you remain."},"砂镜灯议长·乌瑟":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。镜子里少了一条路，也多了一个等人的位置。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. The mirror lacks a road and holds one extra waiting place."},"砂镜潮纹游鱼领誓·依瑟":{"zh":"它只在岸边有灯时浮上水面，嘴里衔着一枚磨圆的石子。像是有一件太小的礼物，一直找不到收的人。旧物上的灰，藏着比文字更久的记忆。","en":"It surfaces only beside a lit bank, carrying a smooth pebble. A tiny gift has waited a long time for someone to receive it. Dust on old things holds memories older than words."},"砂镜峰脊巨灵领誓·雅瑟":{"zh":"它捡走山道上的落石，也捡走人们不愿背的行李。只有一只破箱子，始终找不到原来的主人。被遗忘的名字，在石壁上反而刻得最深。","en":"It clears fallen stones and carries the luggage others leave behind. One broken trunk has never found its owner. Forgotten names are carved deepest in the stone."},"砂镜地缝蠕虫领誓·诺瑟":{"zh":"它沿着地下的旧石缝前行，把断掉的路重新钻通。没人感谢过它，地上的脚步却因此少了一点孤单。被遗忘的名字，在石壁上反而刻得最深。","en":"It follows old cracks underground, reopening broken passages. No one thanks it, though footsteps above grow a little less lonely. Forgotten names are carved deepest in the stone."},"砂镜峰脊巨灵领誓·瑟瑟":{"zh":"它捡走山道上的落石，也捡走人们不愿背的行李。只有一只破箱子，始终找不到原来的主人。镜子里少了一条路，也多了一个等人的位置。","en":"It clears fallen stones and carries the luggage others leave behind. One broken trunk has never found its owner. The mirror lacks a road and holds one extra waiting place."},"砂镜灯议长·维瑟":{"zh":"行李里最重的东西是一口小锅。只要还能煮出热汤，旅途就不算到了绝路。被遗忘的名字，在石壁上反而刻得最深。","en":"A small pot is the heaviest thing in the pack. As long as there is hot soup, the journey has not reached its end. Forgotten names are carved deepest in the stone."},"砂镜修灯师·希瑟":{"zh":"每次包扎完伤口，都会在绷带上画一个笑脸。最初是哄孩子，后来发现大人也需要。旧物上的灰，藏着比文字更久的记忆。","en":"A smiling face is drawn on every finished bandage. It began for children. Adults turned out to need it too. Dust on old things holds memories older than words."},"砂镜浮辉使·洛瑟":{"zh":"它的影子比身体清楚，像另一个世界留在地上的窗。有人经过时，窗里偶尔会亮起灯。镜子里少了一条路，也多了一个等人的位置。","en":"Its shadow is clearer than its body, a window from another world laid on the ground. Sometimes a passerby makes a lamp shine inside. The mirror lacks a road and holds one extra waiting place."},"砂镜修灯师·米瑟":{"zh":"行李里最重的东西是一口小锅。只要还能煮出热汤，旅途就不算到了绝路。陌生的回声，偶尔也会用自己的声音回答。","en":"A small pot is the heaviest thing in the pack. As long as there is hot soup, the journey has not reached its end. An unfamiliar echo sometimes answers in your own voice."},"砂镜修灯师·岚瑟":{"zh":"每次包扎完伤口，都会在绷带上画一个笑脸。最初是哄孩子，后来发现大人也需要。被遗忘的名字，在石壁上反而刻得最深。","en":"A smiling face is drawn on every finished bandage. It began for children. Adults turned out to need it too. Forgotten names are carved deepest in the stone."},"砂镜铠卫·索瑟":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。镜子里少了一条路，也多了一个等人的位置。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. The mirror lacks a road and holds one extra waiting place."},"砂镜铠卫·莱瑟":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。镜子里少了一条路，也多了一个等人的位置。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. The mirror lacks a road and holds one extra waiting place."},"砂镜巡灯使·岑瑟":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。陌生的回声，偶尔也会用自己的声音回答。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. An unfamiliar echo sometimes answers in your own voice."},"砂镜巡灯使·塔瑟":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。回声从不回答来处，只回答还在不在。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. The echo never tells where you came from, only whether you remain."},"砂镜巡灯使·莫瑟":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。每一处倒影，都替某个迷路的人留着灯。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Every reflection keeps a lamp for someone lost."},"砂镜铠卫·伦瑟":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。每一处倒影，都替某个迷路的人留着灯。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. Every reflection keeps a lamp for someone lost."},"砂镜铠卫·佩瑟":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。没寄出的信，也能把人带到很远的地方。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. An unsent letter can still carry someone far."},"砂镜铠卫·泽瑟":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。陌生的回声，偶尔也会用自己的声音回答。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. An unfamiliar echo sometimes answers in your own voice."},"砂镜铠卫·图瑟":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。每一处倒影，都替某个迷路的人留着灯。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. Every reflection keeps a lamp for someone lost."},"砂镜巡灯使·芮瑟":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。每一处倒影，都替某个迷路的人留着灯。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. Every reflection keeps a lamp for someone lost."},"砂镜巡灯使·阿尘":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。回声从不回答来处，只回答还在不在。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. The echo never tells where you came from, only whether you remain."},"砂镜铠卫·艾尘":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。旧物上的灰，藏着比文字更久的记忆。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. Dust on old things holds memories older than words."},"砂镜潜印客·伊尘":{"zh":"脚步很轻，口袋里的旧纽扣却总会出卖行踪。那枚纽扣是别人替缝的，舍不得扔。一个空口袋，也可能装着很重的约定。","en":"The steps are silent. An old button rattles in the pocket. Someone else sewed it on once; throwing it away is unthinkable. An empty pocket can hold a very heavy promise."},"砂镜巡灯使·欧尘":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。陌生的回声，偶尔也会用自己的声音回答。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. An unfamiliar echo sometimes answers in your own voice."},"砂镜巡灯使·乌尘":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。被遗忘的名字，在石壁上反而刻得最深。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. Forgotten names are carved deepest in the stone."},"砂镜巡灯使·依尘":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。镜子里少了一条路，也多了一个等人的位置。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. The mirror lacks a road and holds one extra waiting place."},"砂镜巡灯使·雅尘":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。若不是有人回头看，这地方也许早就不在了。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. Without someone looking back, this place might no longer exist."},"砂镜掠风鸟·诺尘":{"zh":"它把路上捡来的线头编成巢，巢里却总空着一个位置。风每次改变方向，它都往远处多看一眼。镜子里少了一条路，也多了一个等人的位置。","en":"It nests with threads found on the road, leaving one place empty. Every shift of wind makes it look farther away. The mirror lacks a road and holds one extra waiting place."},"砂镜潜印客·瑟尘":{"zh":"脚步很轻，口袋里的旧纽扣却总会出卖行踪。那枚纽扣是别人替缝的，舍不得扔。这里的门只通向来过的人留下的影子。","en":"The steps are silent. An old button rattles in the pocket. Someone else sewed it on once; throwing it away is unthinkable. These doors open only onto the shadows of past visitors."},"砂镜潜印客·维尘":{"zh":"脚步很轻，口袋里的旧纽扣却总会出卖行踪。那枚纽扣是别人替缝的，舍不得扔。没寄出的信，也能把人带到很远的地方。","en":"The steps are silent. An old button rattles in the pocket. Someone else sewed it on once; throwing it away is unthinkable. An unsent letter can still carry someone far."},"砂镜观灯师·希尘":{"zh":"记录了很多扇打不开的门，也记录了每个愿意陪着试一次的人。后一册薄得让人心疼。陌生的回声，偶尔也会用自己的声音回答。","en":"One book lists doors that would not open. Another lists those willing to try together. The second is painfully thin. An unfamiliar echo sometimes answers in your own voice."},"砂镜观灯师·洛尘":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。这里的门只通向来过的人留下的影子。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. These doors open only onto the shadows of past visitors."},"砂镜观灯师·米尘":{"zh":"帽檐缝着一圈错写的咒文。那是第一次学会法术时留下的失误，后来一直没有拆。镜子里少了一条路，也多了一个等人的位置。","en":"Misspelled charms line the hat brim. They are the first mistakes of a young apprentice, never unpicked. The mirror lacks a road and holds one extra waiting place."},"砂镜观灯师·岚尘":{"zh":"记录了很多扇打不开的门，也记录了每个愿意陪着试一次的人。后一册薄得让人心疼。若不是有人回头看，这地方也许早就不在了。","en":"One book lists doors that would not open. Another lists those willing to try together. The second is painfully thin. Without someone looking back, this place might no longer exist."},"砂镜巡灯使·索尘":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。它像一条岔路，又像一段被落下的往事。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. This place resembles both a side road and a memory left behind."},"砂镜镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。这里的门只通向来过的人留下的影子。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. These doors open only onto the shadows of past visitors."},"砂镜远路铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。被遗忘的名字，在石壁上反而刻得最深。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. Forgotten names are carved deepest in the stone."},"砂镜苔痕缄骨客":{"zh":"胸口少了一根骨头，原来的位置挂着一只小铃。铃响起来时，空洞里像有人在笑。矿井的深处，有时听得见熟悉的笑声。","en":"A small bell hangs where a rib is missing. When it rings, the hollow chest seems to laugh. Familiar laughter sometimes rises from the deep mine."},"砂镜苔痕棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"它把捡到的手套排成一行，像在替走散的人准备重逢。最破的那只，始终留在自己脚边。回声从不回答来处，只回答还在不在。","en":"It lines up found gloves, preparing for a reunion. The most ragged one always stays beside its paws. The echo never tells where you came from, only whether you remain."},"砂镜镜纹巡灯使":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。被遗忘的名字，在石壁上反而刻得最深。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Forgotten names are carved deepest in the stone."},"砂镜铜缄缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。矿井的深处，有时听得见熟悉的笑声。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. Familiar laughter sometimes rises from the deep mine."},"砂镜回声缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。一个空口袋，也可能装着很重的约定。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. An empty pocket can hold a very heavy promise."},"砂镜苔痕甲灯虫":{"zh":"壳上的细纹像一张过时的地图。它循着本能迁徙，偶尔也会在岔路上停下，像在等谁提醒。这里的门只通向来过的人留下的影子。","en":"The fine marks on its shell resemble an outdated map. Even instinct stops at a fork sometimes, as if waiting for a reminder. These doors open only onto the shadows of past visitors."},"砂镜回声凝光泥团":{"zh":"它把掉进身体里的小东西一件件吐回岸上，唯独留着一颗玻璃珠。透过那颗珠子，天会显得很蓝。一个空口袋，也可能装着很重的约定。","en":"It returns everything that falls into its body to the bank, keeping one glass marble. Through it, the sky looks very blue. An empty pocket can hold a very heavy promise."},"砂镜苔痕砂脊蜥":{"zh":"它在碎瓦间找暖和的位置，每次都会留出半边。也许冷过的小东西，比人更懂得分享余温。一个空口袋，也可能装着很重的约定。","en":"It finds warmth between broken tiles, always leaving half the space free. Small cold creatures may understand shared warmth best. An empty pocket can hold a very heavy promise."},"砂镜铜缄地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"它沿着地下的旧石缝前行，把断掉的路重新钻通。没人感谢过它，地上的脚步却因此少了一点孤单。若不是有人回头看，这地方也许早就不在了。","en":"It follows old cracks underground, reopening broken passages. No one thanks it, though footsteps above grow a little less lonely. Without someone looking back, this place might no longer exist."},"砂镜铜缄浮辉使":{"zh":"它的影子比身体清楚，像另一个世界留在地上的窗。有人经过时，窗里偶尔会亮起灯。每一处倒影，都替某个迷路的人留着灯。","en":"Its shadow is clearer than its body, a window from another world laid on the ground. Sometimes a passerby makes a lamp shine inside. Every reflection keeps a lamp for someone lost."},"砂镜微烛裂角客":{"zh":"角上的旧绳结是别人替系的。模样看着凶，路边落单的小东西却总往它脚下躲。矿井的深处，有时听得见熟悉的笑声。","en":"Someone else tied the old knot around its horns. Fearsome as it looks, small lost creatures shelter at its feet. Familiar laughter sometimes rises from the deep mine."},"砂镜铜缄潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"它只在岸边有灯时浮上水面，嘴里衔着一枚磨圆的石子。像是有一件太小的礼物，一直找不到收的人。每一处倒影，都替某个迷路的人留着灯。","en":"It surfaces only beside a lit bank, carrying a smooth pebble. A tiny gift has waited a long time for someone to receive it. Every reflection keeps a lamp for someone lost."},"砂镜微烛缄骨客":{"zh":"胸口少了一根骨头，原来的位置挂着一只小铃。铃响起来时，空洞里像有人在笑。被遗忘的名字，在石壁上反而刻得最深。","en":"A small bell hangs where a rib is missing. When it rings, the hollow chest seems to laugh. Forgotten names are carved deepest in the stone."},"砂镜苔痕苔脊软虫":{"zh":"它走过的地方留下细微的光，雨也洗不掉。走得慢的东西，也能替赶路的人留下一条线索。回声从不回答来处，只回答还在不在。","en":"A faint light marks its passing and survives the rain. Even something slow can leave a clue for someone hurrying home. The echo never tells where you came from, only whether you remain."},"砂镜苔痕线尾鼠":{"zh":"它把亮纽扣藏在洞口，想让迟归的同伴找到家。后来洞口搬了很多次，纽扣始终带着。这里的门只通向来过的人留下的影子。","en":"It places a bright button by its burrow for late companions. The burrow has moved many times. The button always comes too. These doors open only onto the shadows of past visitors."},"砂镜铜缄甲灯虫":{"zh":"壳上的细纹像一张过时的地图。它循着本能迁徙，偶尔也会在岔路上停下，像在等谁提醒。每一处倒影，都替某个迷路的人留着灯。","en":"The fine marks on its shell resemble an outdated map. Even instinct stops at a fork sometimes, as if waiting for a reminder. Every reflection keeps a lamp for someone lost."},"砂镜石封铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。一个空口袋，也可能装着很重的约定。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. An empty pocket can hold a very heavy promise."},"砂镜鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。它像一条岔路，又像一段被落下的往事。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. This place resembles both a side road and a memory left behind."},"砂镜微烛潜印客":{"zh":"开锁的工具藏在发带里，真正的钥匙却挂在胸前。那扇门早已不见，钥匙一直没舍得换。若不是有人回头看，这地方也许早就不在了。","en":"Lock picks hide in the hairband. The real key hangs at the neck. Its door is long gone, but no other key will do. Without someone looking back, this place might no longer exist."},"砂镜琉纹缄骨客":{"zh":"它沿着墓碑练习自己的字迹，写到最后，总把落款留成空白。也许是在等别人帮它想起。矿井的深处，有时听得见熟悉的笑声。","en":"It practices its handwriting on the gravestones, always leaving the signature blank. Perhaps someone else will remember. Familiar laughter sometimes rises from the deep mine."},"砂镜风蚀缄骨客":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。旧物上的灰，藏着比文字更久的记忆。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. Dust on old things holds memories older than words."},"砂镜静棱缄骨客":{"zh":"它沿着墓碑练习自己的字迹，写到最后，总把落款留成空白。也许是在等别人帮它想起。陌生的回声，偶尔也会用自己的声音回答。","en":"It practices its handwriting on the gravestones, always leaving the signature blank. Perhaps someone else will remember. An unfamiliar echo sometimes answers in your own voice."},"砂镜微烛峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"它捡走山道上的落石，也捡走人们不愿背的行李。只有一只破箱子，始终找不到原来的主人。旧物上的灰，藏着比文字更久的记忆。","en":"It clears fallen stones and carries the luggage others leave behind. One broken trunk has never found its owner. Dust on old things holds memories older than words."},"砂镜苔痕折面星客":{"zh":"它不知道该用哪种表情欢迎客人，只好把所有的面孔都收起来。空白处反而让人觉得熟悉。矿井的深处，有时听得见熟悉的笑声。","en":"Unsure which face should welcome a guest, it puts every face away. The blank space feels strangely familiar. Familiar laughter sometimes rises from the deep mine."},"砂镜静棱观灯师":{"zh":"能让星光停在指间，却没法让一封回信早些到来。于是每晚的灯都亮得比别人久。被遗忘的名字，在石壁上反而刻得最深。","en":"Starlight can be held between these fingers. A reply cannot be hurried. The study lamp burns later every night. Forgotten names are carved deepest in the stone."},"砂镜绒雾观灯师":{"zh":"能让星光停在指间，却没法让一封回信早些到来。于是每晚的灯都亮得比别人久。镜子里少了一条路，也多了一个等人的位置。","en":"Starlight can be held between these fingers. A reply cannot be hurried. The study lamp burns later every night. The mirror lacks a road and holds one extra waiting place."},"砂镜铜缄晶棘蜥龙":{"zh":"它收集过很多亮晶晶的东西，最后只留下了一片窗玻璃。透过那一片，看出去的天最像故乡。镜子里少了一条路，也多了一个等人的位置。","en":"It collected many shining things, keeping only a shard of window glass. The sky through it looks most like home. The mirror lacks a road and holds one extra waiting place."},"砂镜回声晶棘蜥龙":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。若不是有人回头看，这地方也许早就不在了。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. Without someone looking back, this place might no longer exist."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·莱尘":{"zh":"它用鹿角为溺水者撑住浮木，伤口却总在落潮时重新裂开。远航的船没有一艘回来，它仍守着浅滩。","en":"It braces driftwood for the drowning with its antlers. Its wounds reopen with every low tide. No ship returns, but the deer keeps watch."},"暮潮灯议长·岑尘":{"zh":"他的船从不离港，船帆却每天都换一个方向。有人说，风是从他一直不敢打开的船舱吹出来的。","en":"His boat never leaves port, yet its sail turns daily. They say the wind comes from the cabin he has never dared open."},"暮潮浮辉使领誓·塔尘":{"zh":"它曾是灯塔里的一束光，熄灭后才学会沿着海面走。每当有人说起家，它身上便浮出一扇模糊的窗。","en":"It was once a lighthouse beam. Only after going dark did it learn to walk the water. Mention home, and a blurred window forms inside its light."},"暮潮裂角客领誓·莫尘":{"zh":"他靠借来的血与热度走过长夜，遇到陌生人时总先藏起獠牙。旧药瓶里装着最后一个救过他的人的名字。","en":"Borrowed blood and warmth carry him through the night. He hides his fangs from strangers. His old medicine bottle holds the name of the last person who saved him."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·伦尘":{"zh":"它曾把迷航的船拖回岸边，后来船变成了会发光的骨架。它不再问船要去哪，只在夜里静静陪着。","en":"It once towed a lost boat ashore. Now the boat is a glowing skeleton. The deer no longer asks its destination, but stays with it at night."},"暮潮灯议长·佩尘":{"zh":"他在墓地替失踪的水手守夜，每一座空坟都有一条归港日期。最旧的那块石碑，刻的却是明天。","en":"He watches over empty sailors’ graves. Each lists a date of return. The oldest stone names tomorrow."},"暮潮潜印客领誓·泽尘":{"zh":"他把毒藏进蛇形的手杖，声称只是为了吓退追债的人。账本的最后一页写着：借来的一生，迟早要还。","en":"Poison sleeps in his serpent-headed cane. He claims it only deters creditors. His ledger ends: A borrowed life must be repaid."},"暮潮织光蛛领誓·图尘":{"zh":"它替怕水的幼蛛撑起一片干燥的帆，自己却站在涨潮的石头上。帆布背面画着同一颗反复升起的月亮。","en":"It holds a dry sail above its little spiders while the tide climbs its rock. The same rising moon is drawn again and again on the canvas."},"暮潮缄骨客领誓·芮尘":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。潮水退去后，总能找到一件似曾相识的旧物。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. Each low tide leaves something strangely familiar."},"暮潮缄骨客领誓·阿汀":{"zh":"他只在有人落水后敲响岸边的铃。铃舌早已锈住，港口却每夜都能听见它响，仿佛灾难还没来得及结束。","en":"He rings the shore bell only when someone falls into the sea. Its tongue has rusted still, yet the harbor hears it every night."},"暮潮灯议长·艾汀":{"zh":"他替远航者保存船票，票根一律没有日期。你递出自己的那张时，他说这道折痕以前也见过。","en":"He keeps tickets for departed sailors. None carries a date. When you offer yours, he says he has seen that crease before."},"暮潮折面星客领誓·伊汀":{"zh":"它用陌生的符号记录旅人的呼吸，纸上却总会出现一句你读得懂的话：还没到时候。港口的陌生人，越来越像久别的旧友。","en":"It records travelers’ breathing in strange symbols. One sentence always appears that you can read: Not yet. The strangers at the harbor seem more and more like old friends."},"暮潮折面星客领誓·欧汀":{"zh":"它不知道该用哪种表情欢迎客人，只好把所有的面孔都收起来。空白处反而让人觉得熟悉。漂回来的瓶中信，总少一句最后的道别。","en":"Unsure which face should welcome a guest, it puts every face away. The blank space feels strangely familiar. Every returned bottle lacks one final farewell."},"暮潮灯议长·乌汀":{"zh":"他替困在礁石上的人交换行李，直到每个人都能找到熟悉的东西。唯独他的口袋，装着一把无人认领的钥匙。","en":"He trades the stranded travelers’ belongings until everyone finds something familiar. His own pocket holds only an unclaimed key."},"暮潮折面星客领誓·依汀":{"zh":"它戴着一张不断变换表情的面具，只有挨痛时会短暂露出自己的脸。那张脸让你想起醒来之前的某个人。","en":"Its mask changes expression without rest. Pain briefly reveals the face beneath, reminding you of someone from before you woke here."},"暮潮踏铃驹领誓·雅汀":{"zh":"小马听见铃声便奔向海边，却总在最后一级台阶前停下。蹄下的水迹，恰好拼出一条你刚走过的路。","en":"The little horse runs seaward with each bell, but stops at the final step. Its wet hoofprints trace the road you have just traveled."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·诺汀":{"zh":"它鹿角上的火会随心跳改变颜色。你靠近时，火忽然变得很安静，像认出了一个不该还活着的人。","en":"The fire in its antlers changes with its heartbeat. As you approach, the flames grow still, as if recognizing someone who should not be alive."},"暮潮折面星客领誓·瑟汀":{"zh":"它不知道该用哪种表情欢迎客人，只好把所有的面孔都收起来。空白处反而让人觉得熟悉。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"Unsure which face should welcome a guest, it puts every face away. The blank space feels strangely familiar. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮灯议长·维汀":{"zh":"他用自己的热血点亮熄灭的船灯，以为只要灯还亮，船就没有离开。你发现他手里一直握着一张送别信。","en":"He rekindles ship lamps with his own warmth, believing a lit lamp means its ship has not left. A farewell letter never leaves his hand."},"暮潮灯议长·希汀":{"zh":"他负责把漂回港口的船重新推向海里。所有船头都刻着不同的名字，船尾却只有一句话：你又回来了。","en":"He sends washed-up boats back to sea. Their bows bear different names. Every stern reads the same: You came back."},"暮潮灯议长·洛汀":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。每一段堤岸，都有人留过不肯放手的绳结。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. Every seawall has held a knot someone would not release."},"暮潮灯议长·米汀":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。这里的月亮像一扇始终开不了的窗。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. The moon here resembles a window that never opens."},"暮潮灯议长·岚汀":{"zh":"把所有仪式都简化之后，桌上只剩两只杯子。原来最难实现的愿望，不过是有人回来坐下。港口没有返程表，只有一张反复擦写的名单。","en":"After simplifying every ritual, only two cups remain on the table. The hardest wish was always for someone to come back and sit down. The harbor has no return timetable, only a much-erased list."},"暮潮峰脊巨灵领誓·索汀":{"zh":"它捡走山道上的落石，也捡走人们不愿背的行李。只有一只破箱子，始终找不到原来的主人。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"It clears fallen stones and carries the luggage others leave behind. One broken trunk has never found its owner. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮裂角客领誓·莱汀":{"zh":"它用尾巴把掉进沟里的灯捞起，再装作什么都没发生。谢意让它比火还要不自在。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"It fishes a fallen lamp from the ditch with its tail and pretends nothing happened. Gratitude makes it more uneasy than fire. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮地缝蠕虫领誓·岑汀":{"zh":"它沿着地下的旧石缝前行，把断掉的路重新钻通。没人感谢过它，地上的脚步却因此少了一点孤单。海里的倒影有时会比岸上的人先转身。","en":"It follows old cracks underground, reopening broken passages. No one thanks it, though footsteps above grow a little less lonely. Reflections sometimes turn before the people on the shore."},"暮潮棱耳猎犬领誓·塔汀":{"zh":"它把捡到的手套排成一行，像在替走散的人准备重逢。最破的那只，始终留在自己脚边。海里的倒影有时会比岸上的人先转身。","en":"It lines up found gloves, preparing for a reunion. The most ragged one always stays beside its paws. Reflections sometimes turn before the people on the shore."},"暮潮缄骨客领誓·莫汀":{"zh":"它沿着墓碑练习自己的字迹，写到最后，总把落款留成空白。也许是在等别人帮它想起。港口没有返程表，只有一张反复擦写的名单。","en":"It practices its handwriting on the gravestones, always leaving the signature blank. Perhaps someone else will remember. The harbor has no return timetable, only a much-erased list."},"暮潮灯议长·伦汀":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。潮水退去后，总能找到一件似曾相识的旧物。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Each low tide leaves something strangely familiar."},"暮潮裂角客领誓·佩汀":{"zh":"它用尾巴把掉进沟里的灯捞起，再装作什么都没发生。谢意让它比火还要不自在。海里的倒影有时会比岸上的人先转身。","en":"It fishes a fallen lamp from the ditch with its tail and pretends nothing happened. Gratitude makes it more uneasy than fire. Reflections sometimes turn before the people on the shore."},"暮潮琉纹折面星客":{"zh":"它用陌生的符号记录旅人的呼吸，纸上却总会出现一句你读得懂的话：还没到时候。港口没有返程表，只有一张反复擦写的名单。","en":"It records travelers’ breathing in strange symbols. One sentence always appears that you can read: Not yet. The harbor has no return timetable, only a much-erased list."},"暮潮修灯师·泽汀":{"zh":"总说药不够，所以从不给自己留。只有旧围裙上的结，记着这双手也曾抖得厉害。海里的倒影有时会比岸上的人先转身。","en":"There is never enough medicine, so none is kept for the healer. The knots in the old apron remember how badly these hands once shook. Reflections sometimes turn before the people on the shore."},"暮潮巡灯使·图汀":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。港口没有返程表，只有一张反复擦写的名单。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. The harbor has no return timetable, only a much-erased list."},"暮潮巡灯使·芮汀":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。潮水退去后，总能找到一件似曾相识的旧物。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. Each low tide leaves something strangely familiar."},"暮潮修灯师·阿芙":{"zh":"药袋上写的不是药名，而是来求药的人的名字。最常用的那一包，字已经摸得看不清了。漂回来的瓶中信，总少一句最后的道别。","en":"The packets bear patients’ names, not medicine names. The most often used label is worn beyond reading. Every returned bottle lacks one final farewell."},"暮潮巡灯使·艾芙":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮巡灯使·伊芙":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。船灯照过的脸，比海图上的线更容易记住。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. Faces in lamplight are easier to remember than lines on charts."},"暮潮巡灯使·欧芙":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮巡灯使·乌芙":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。每一段堤岸，都有人留过不肯放手的绳结。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. Every seawall has held a knot someone would not release."},"暮潮修灯师·依芙":{"zh":"把采来的草按气味分类，最温和的那一捆留给睡不着的人。长夜里，这样的人很多。下一次靠岸的钟声，有时会提前响起。","en":"The herbs are sorted by scent. The gentlest bunch is for those who cannot sleep. There are many in this long night. The next arrival’s bell sometimes rings too soon."},"暮潮修灯师·雅芙":{"zh":"行李里最重的东西是一口小锅。只要还能煮出热汤，旅途就不算到了绝路。港口的陌生人，越来越像久别的旧友。","en":"A small pot is the heaviest thing in the pack. As long as there is hot soup, the journey has not reached its end. The strangers at the harbor seem more and more like old friends."},"暮潮潜印客·诺芙":{"zh":"开锁的工具藏在发带里，真正的钥匙却挂在胸前。那扇门早已不见，钥匙一直没舍得换。下一次靠岸的钟声，有时会提前响起。","en":"Lock picks hide in the hairband. The real key hangs at the neck. Its door is long gone, but no other key will do. The next arrival’s bell sometimes rings too soon."},"暮潮潜印客·瑟芙":{"zh":"擅长从人群中消失，却总在有人落单时现身。借口每次都一样：碰巧顺路。这里的月亮像一扇始终开不了的窗。","en":"Expert at vanishing into crowds, yet always appearing beside anyone left alone. The excuse is always the same: Going that way anyway. The moon here resembles a window that never opens."},"暮潮铠卫·维芙":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。下一次靠岸的钟声，有时会提前响起。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. The next arrival’s bell sometimes rings too soon."},"暮潮潜印客·希芙":{"zh":"从没偷过旅人的最后一块面包。被抓住时也只辩解一句：饿着肚子，跑不出这地方。潮水退去后，总能找到一件似曾相识的旧物。","en":"The last piece of a traveler’s bread is never stolen. When caught, the only defense is that nobody escapes this place hungry. Each low tide leaves something strangely familiar."},"暮潮巡灯使·洛芙":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。船灯照过的脸，比海图上的线更容易记住。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. Faces in lamplight are easier to remember than lines on charts."},"暮潮巡灯使·米芙":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮潜印客·岚芙":{"zh":"开锁的工具藏在发带里，真正的钥匙却挂在胸前。那扇门早已不见，钥匙一直没舍得换。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"Lock picks hide in the hairband. The real key hangs at the neck. Its door is long gone, but no other key will do. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮潜印客·索芙":{"zh":"开锁的工具藏在发带里，真正的钥匙却挂在胸前。那扇门早已不见，钥匙一直没舍得换。港口的陌生人，越来越像久别的旧友。","en":"Lock picks hide in the hairband. The real key hangs at the neck. Its door is long gone, but no other key will do. The strangers at the harbor seem more and more like old friends."},"暮潮折面星客·莱芙":{"zh":"它用陌生的符号记录旅人的呼吸，纸上却总会出现一句你读得懂的话：还没到时候。海风带来的名字，常常先于本人抵达。","en":"It records travelers’ breathing in strange symbols. One sentence always appears that you can read: Not yet. Names often arrive on the sea wind before their owners."},"暮潮巡灯使·岑芙":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮织光蛛·塔芙":{"zh":"蛛网绕开了窗边那只旧杯子。杯里没有虫，只有一点落雨，足够等很久的人喝上一口。船灯照过的脸，比海图上的线更容易记住。","en":"The web leaves an old cup untouched by the window. There are no insects inside, only enough rain for someone who has waited a long time. Faces in lamplight are easier to remember than lines on charts."},"暮潮潜印客·莫芙":{"zh":"从没偷过旅人的最后一块面包。被抓住时也只辩解一句：饿着肚子，跑不出这地方。下一次靠岸的钟声，有时会提前响起。","en":"The last piece of a traveler’s bread is never stolen. When caught, the only defense is that nobody escapes this place hungry. The next arrival’s bell sometimes rings too soon."},"暮潮潜印客·伦芙":{"zh":"卖过很多条近路，只有一条从不标价。那是回家的路，至今还没找到。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"Many shortcuts have been sold. Only the road home has no price, because it has not yet been found. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮微烛缄骨客":{"zh":"胸口少了一根骨头，原来的位置挂着一只小铃。铃响起来时，空洞里像有人在笑。漂回来的瓶中信，总少一句最后的道别。","en":"A small bell hangs where a rib is missing. When it rings, the hollow chest seems to laugh. Every returned bottle lacks one final farewell."},"暮潮铜缄铠卫":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。港口没有返程表，只有一张反复擦写的名单。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. The harbor has no return timetable, only a much-erased list."},"暮潮琉纹缄骨客":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。船灯照过的脸，比海图上的线更容易记住。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. Faces in lamplight are easier to remember than lines on charts."},"暮潮铜缄棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"脖子上的绳扣早已空了，它还是每天到同一盏灯下等。陌生人伸手时，它会先闻一闻故乡的气味。海风带来的名字，常常先于本人抵达。","en":"The clasp at its neck is empty. It still waits beneath the same lamp, sniffing every offered hand for a trace of home. Names often arrive on the sea wind before their owners."},"暮潮苔痕掠风鸟":{"zh":"翅下藏着一片来自别处的落叶。飞得再远，那片叶子也没有掉下来过。每一段堤岸，都有人留过不肯放手的绳结。","en":"A leaf from elsewhere rests beneath one wing. No flight has ever shaken it loose. Every seawall has held a knot someone would not release."},"暮潮苔痕线尾鼠":{"zh":"它偷过面包，也把碎屑带给过困在墙里的同伴。人们只记得前一件事，所以它总走阴影里的路。海里的倒影有时会比岸上的人先转身。","en":"It steals bread and takes crumbs to companions trapped in the walls. People remember only the first part, so it keeps to the shadows. Reflections sometimes turn before the people on the shore."},"暮潮雾羽巡灯使":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。港口的陌生人，越来越像久别的旧友。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. The strangers at the harbor seem more and more like old friends."},"暮潮静棱折面星客":{"zh":"它用陌生的符号记录旅人的呼吸，纸上却总会出现一句你读得懂的话：还没到时候。漂回来的瓶中信，总少一句最后的道别。","en":"It records travelers’ breathing in strange symbols. One sentence always appears that you can read: Not yet. Every returned bottle lacks one final farewell."},"暮潮风蚀缄骨客":{"zh":"它沿着墓碑练习自己的字迹，写到最后，总把落款留成空白。也许是在等别人帮它想起。潮水退去后，总能找到一件似曾相识的旧物。","en":"It practices its handwriting on the gravestones, always leaving the signature blank. Perhaps someone else will remember. Each low tide leaves something strangely familiar."},"暮潮苔痕巡影狼":{"zh":"狼在每次进食前都把第一口留在地上。它已经独行很久，却还没有学会只等自己一个。船灯照过的脸，比海图上的线更容易记住。","en":"The wolf leaves the first bite on the ground. It has traveled alone for years and has not learned to wait only for itself. Faces in lamplight are easier to remember than lines on charts."},"暮潮绒雾折面星客":{"zh":"它不知道该用哪种表情欢迎客人，只好把所有的面孔都收起来。空白处反而让人觉得熟悉。海风带来的名字，常常先于本人抵达。","en":"Unsure which face should welcome a guest, it puts every face away. The blank space feels strangely familiar. Names often arrive on the sea wind before their owners."},"暮潮苔痕甲灯虫":{"zh":"壳上的细纹像一张过时的地图。它循着本能迁徙，偶尔也会在岔路上停下，像在等谁提醒。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"The fine marks on its shell resemble an outdated map. Even instinct stops at a fork sometimes, as if waiting for a reminder. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮苔痕环藤蛇":{"zh":"它的鳞片认得土地的温度，身体却始终记得一只捧起过它的手。遇见脚步时，它不再立刻逃走。港口没有返程表，只有一张反复擦写的名单。","en":"Its scales know the ground’s warmth. Its body remembers a hand that once lifted it. It no longer flees at the first footstep. The harbor has no return timetable, only a much-erased list."},"暮潮铜缄环藤蛇":{"zh":"它把蜕下的皮留在温暖的石缝，自己守着更冷的入口。有人看见过小兽躲进那些旧皮里避雨。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"It leaves its cast skin in warm crevices and guards the colder entrance. Small animals have been seen sheltering in the old skins. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮铜缄峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"肩上的鸟巢早已空了，它仍在过桥时低头。旧习惯比石头重，却比石头暖和。港口的陌生人，越来越像久别的旧友。","en":"The nest on its shoulder is empty. It still ducks under every bridge. Old habits weigh more than stone, and keep it warmer. The strangers at the harbor seem more and more like old friends."},"暮潮回声峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"它怕踩坏路边的花，走路总绕很远。有人在它的脚印里挖了一口井，说这样再远也不怕没水。漂回来的瓶中信，总少一句最后的道别。","en":"It takes long detours to spare the roadside flowers. Someone dug a well in its footprint, so the extra miles would never mean thirst. Every returned bottle lacks one final farewell."},"暮潮微烛峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"肩上的鸟巢早已空了，它仍在过桥时低头。旧习惯比石头重，却比石头暖和。回家的路若只剩传闻，就先相信同行的人。","en":"The nest on its shoulder is empty. It still ducks under every bridge. Old habits weigh more than stone, and keep it warmer. When home is only a rumor, believe first in those beside you."},"暮潮弧光巡灯使":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。船灯照过的脸，比海图上的线更容易记住。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Faces in lamplight are easier to remember than lines on charts."},"暮潮铜缄巡影狼":{"zh":"狼在每次进食前都把第一口留在地上。它已经独行很久，却还没有学会只等自己一个。下一次靠岸的钟声，有时会提前响起。","en":"The wolf leaves the first bite on the ground. It has traveled alone for years and has not learned to wait only for itself. The next arrival’s bell sometimes rings too soon."},"暮潮铜缄观灯师":{"zh":"帽檐缝着一圈错写的咒文。那是第一次学会法术时留下的失误，后来一直没有拆。漂回来的瓶中信，总少一句最后的道别。","en":"Misspelled charms line the hat brim. They are the first mistakes of a young apprentice, never unpicked. Every returned bottle lacks one final farewell."},"暮潮夜航折面星客":{"zh":"它不知道该用哪种表情欢迎客人，只好把所有的面孔都收起来。空白处反而让人觉得熟悉。港口没有返程表，只有一张反复擦写的名单。","en":"Unsure which face should welcome a guest, it puts every face away. The blank space feels strangely familiar. The harbor has no return timetable, only a much-erased list."},"暮潮流砂折面星客":{"zh":"它用陌生的符号记录旅人的呼吸，纸上却总会出现一句你读得懂的话：还没到时候。每一段堤岸，都有人留过不肯放手的绳结。","en":"It records travelers’ breathing in strange symbols. One sentence always appears that you can read: Not yet. Every seawall has held a knot someone would not release."},"暮潮苔痕锈鬃豕":{"zh":"它用鼻子翻开潮湿的土，找到的食物却总比吃下的多。旁边那条小径，已经很久没有新的足印。漂回来的瓶中信，总少一句最后的道别。","en":"It roots through damp soil, finding more food than it eats. No new tracks have appeared on the path beside it for a long time. Every returned bottle lacks one final farewell."},"暮潮夜航潜印客":{"zh":"开锁的工具藏在发带里，真正的钥匙却挂在胸前。那扇门早已不见，钥匙一直没舍得换。这里的月亮像一扇始终开不了的窗。","en":"Lock picks hide in the hairband. The real key hangs at the neck. Its door is long gone, but no other key will do. The moon here resembles a window that never opens."},"暮潮苔痕潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"它只在岸边有灯时浮上水面，嘴里衔着一枚磨圆的石子。像是有一件太小的礼物，一直找不到收的人。回家的路若只剩传闻，就先相信同行的人。","en":"It surfaces only beside a lit bank, carrying a smooth pebble. A tiny gift has waited a long time for someone to receive it. When home is only a rumor, believe first in those beside you."},"暮潮铜缄潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"它只在岸边有灯时浮上水面，嘴里衔着一枚磨圆的石子。像是有一件太小的礼物，一直找不到收的人。每一段堤岸，都有人留过不肯放手的绳结。","en":"It surfaces only beside a lit bank, carrying a smooth pebble. A tiny gift has waited a long time for someone to receive it. Every seawall has held a knot someone would not release."},"暮潮回声潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"它只在岸边有灯时浮上水面，嘴里衔着一枚磨圆的石子。像是有一件太小的礼物，一直找不到收的人。海风带来的名字，常常先于本人抵达。","en":"It surfaces only beside a lit bank, carrying a smooth pebble. A tiny gift has waited a long time for someone to receive it. Names often arrive on the sea wind before their owners."},"暮潮苔痕凝光泥团":{"zh":"它把掉进身体里的小东西一件件吐回岸上，唯独留着一颗玻璃珠。透过那颗珠子，天会显得很蓝。海风带来的名字，常常先于本人抵达。","en":"It returns everything that falls into its body to the bank, keeping one glass marble. Through it, the sky looks very blue. Names often arrive on the sea wind before their owners."},"暮潮微烛裂角客":{"zh":"被叫作怪物之后，它学会把笑藏起来。胸口那块干净的布，是第一个没有逃跑的人留下的。下一次靠岸的钟声，有时会提前响起。","en":"After being called a monster, it learned to hide its smile. The clean cloth at its chest came from the first person who did not run. The next arrival’s bell sometimes rings too soon."},"暮潮铜缄浮辉使":{"zh":"它从一盏熄灭的灯里走出来，忘了自己原来照过谁。每当听见脚步，微光总会先亮一点。船灯照过的脸，比海图上的线更容易记住。","en":"It emerged from an extinguished lamp, forgetting whom it once lit the way for. Footsteps still make it brighten. Faces in lamplight are easier to remember than lines on charts."},"暮潮回声铠卫":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。船灯照过的脸，比海图上的线更容易记住。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. Faces in lamplight are easier to remember than lines on charts."},"暮潮铜缄苔痕巡灯使":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。海里的倒影有时会比岸上的人先转身。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. Reflections sometimes turn before the people on the shore."},"暮潮回声织光蛛":{"zh":"蛛网绕开了窗边那只旧杯子。杯里没有虫，只有一点落雨，足够等很久的人喝上一口。漂回来的瓶中信，总少一句最后的道别。","en":"The web leaves an old cup untouched by the window. There are no insects inside, only enough rain for someone who has waited a long time. Every returned bottle lacks one final farewell."},"暮潮铜缄铜缄巡灯使":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。海里的倒影有时会比岸上的人先转身。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Reflections sometimes turn before the people on the shore."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·佩芙":{"zh":"从没偷过旅人的最后一块面包。被抓住时也只辩解一句：饿着肚子，跑不出这地方。天亮前的梦，开始和初来时一模一样。","en":"The last piece of a traveler’s bread is never stolen. When caught, the only defense is that nobody escapes this place hungry. The dreams before dawn begin to match those of your arrival."},"霜枝铠卫领誓·泽芙":{"zh":"他护送别人翻过一座又一座雪桥，每次只走到桥的中央。那里刻着的旧记号，比你记得的还多一道。","en":"He escorts travelers across snow bridges, stopping halfway. The old tally at the center has one mark more than you remember."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·图芙":{"zh":"他把幻影留在门前，真身却藏在一封迟迟没寄出的信里。收信人写的是你，字迹却像你自己的。","en":"He leaves a phantom at the door while his true self hides in an unsent letter. It is addressed to you, in handwriting much like yours."},"霜枝铠卫领誓·芮芙":{"zh":"他以雷声计算雪崩前的距离，已经很久没数错。唯独你走来时，他漏掉了那一声最先响起的回音。","en":"He counts thunder to judge an avalanche’s distance and has not been wrong for years. Your arrival makes him miss the first echo."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·阿诺":{"zh":"老猿把旅人的冻伤藏进冰里，声称等春天就能一起归还。冰层深处，已经堆满从未到来的春天。","en":"The old ape seals travelers’ frostbite in ice, promising to return it in spring. The glacier holds more springs than have ever arrived."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·艾诺":{"zh":"它在雪中倒下过，又带着相同的伤口回来。如今它会先看一眼身后，确认那条旧路有没有跟着自己。","en":"It has fallen in the snow and returned with the same wound. Now it checks behind itself first, to see whether the old road has followed it."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·伊诺":{"zh":"猿群曾沿着它的叫声穿过风雪，如今只有回音还会回答。它随身带着一颗干果，从不肯独自吃下。","en":"Its calls once guided a troop through snow. Only echoes answer now. It carries one dried fruit that it refuses to eat alone."},"霜枝灯议长·欧诺":{"zh":"他写了一本只记录晴天的日记，最后一页却画着雾林渡口。你还没开口，他就把那页藏进了袖子。","en":"His diary records only clear days. Its last page shows the misty crossing. Before you can ask, he hides it in his sleeve."},"霜枝灯议长·乌诺":{"zh":"他替爬山的人缝好行囊，总会留一根线不剪断。线的另一端早已埋进雪里，他说那是防止自己走散。","en":"He mends climbers’ packs, leaving one thread uncut. Its other end lies buried in snow. He says it keeps him from getting lost."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·依诺":{"zh":"他把山风收进细小的针管，想听见风从哪里来。最旧的一支里，却只有你醒来时那盏灯的声音。","en":"He bottles mountain winds in fine needles to learn where they begin. The oldest holds only the sound of the lamp beside which you woke."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·雅诺":{"zh":"他习惯让别人慢一步，好赶在雪崩前把人推开。你认出那只手：第一次醒来时，也是它把灯放在你身边。","en":"He makes others hesitate so he can push them clear before the avalanche. You recognize the hand that placed a lamp beside you when you first awoke."},"霜枝灯议长·诺诺":{"zh":"他知道最后的山门在哪里，也知道门后是什么。问到为什么留下时，他说：总得有人提醒你带上朋友。","en":"He knows where the last mountain gate stands, and what is behind it. He stayed, he says, because someone must remind you to bring your friends."},"霜枝裂角客领誓·瑟诺":{"zh":"他守着山上的旧火坑，每一撮灰都留着一点不肯散去的暖意。你在其中听见了曾经交手的人的笑声。","en":"He tends an old fire pit on the mountain. Every pinch of ash keeps a little warmth. In it, you hear the laughter of people you once fought."},"霜枝晶棘蜥龙领誓·维诺":{"zh":"龙沿着雷光沉睡，鳞片下藏着一枚碎裂的指南针。每当你想起出口，断针都会悄悄指向身后。","en":"The dragon sleeps along a seam of lightning. A broken compass beneath its scales turns toward your back whenever you think of the exit."},"霜枝灯议长·希诺":{"zh":"他只在别人快撑不住时点亮灯，自己的灯却从没熄过。灯油早已干涸，火里烧着一封没有落款的邀请。","en":"He lights a lamp when others falter. His own has never gone out. With the oil long gone, it burns an unsigned invitation."},"霜枝铠卫·洛诺":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。寒冷教会人，记忆也需要彼此保温。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. The cold teaches that memories need shared warmth too."},"霜枝铠卫·米诺":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。山顶已经看得见，风却带来渡口的气味。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. The summit is visible. The wind smells of the first crossing."},"霜枝铠卫·岚诺":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。旧伤会痒，旧约定也会。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. Old wounds ache. Old promises do too."},"霜枝铠卫·索诺":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。山顶已经看得见，风却带来渡口的气味。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. The summit is visible. The wind smells of the first crossing."},"霜枝铠卫·莱诺":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。下山的路偶尔出现在上山的地图上。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. The road down sometimes appears on the map upward."},"霜枝铠卫·岑诺":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。风吹散了很多话，却没有吹散同行的脚步。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. The wind scatters words, never the steps of companions."},"霜枝铠卫·塔诺":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。最深的雪里，埋着一片温热的苔。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. A warm scrap of moss lies in the deepest snow."},"霜枝铜缄裂角客":{"zh":"他用冻僵的手把旅人拉回山道，救下的人却总说自己正要离开。雪越下越厚，山道两端的脚印开始重合。","en":"With frozen hands he pulls travelers back onto the path. They always insist they were leaving. In deeper snow, the footprints at both ends begin to overlap."},"霜枝巡灯使·莫诺":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。每一次道别，都像是在练习重逢。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. Every farewell feels like practice for meeting again."},"霜枝巡灯使·伦诺":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。门越近，身后的路就越清楚。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. The nearer the gate, the clearer the road behind becomes."},"霜枝铠卫·佩诺":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。天亮前的梦，开始和初来时一模一样。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. The dreams before dawn begin to match those of your arrival."},"霜枝苔痕赤角兽":{"zh":"它把积雪撞进峡谷，为后来者清出一条险路。谷底回荡的不是牛鸣，而是一遍又一遍出发时的钟声。","en":"It clears the pass by driving snow into the ravine. The valley echoes not with its bellow, but with the bell that rang when you set out."},"霜枝铜缄赤角兽":{"zh":"它能撞开最结实的围栏，却总在一扇歪门前停住。门后放过盐和清水，那段记忆比铁还牢。寒冷教会人，记忆也需要彼此保温。","en":"It breaks the strongest fences, yet stops at one crooked gate. Someone once left salt and clean water there. That memory holds better than iron. The cold teaches that memories need shared warmth too."},"霜枝镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。寒冷教会人，记忆也需要彼此保温。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. The cold teaches that memories need shared warmth too."},"霜枝巡灯使·泽诺":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。山顶已经看得见，风却带来渡口的气味。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. The summit is visible. The wind smells of the first crossing."},"霜枝巡灯使·图诺":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。天亮前的梦，开始和初来时一模一样。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. The dreams before dawn begin to match those of your arrival."},"霜枝潜印客·芮诺":{"zh":"从没偷过旅人的最后一块面包。被抓住时也只辩解一句：饿着肚子，跑不出这地方。有人在路边写过，别忘了带朋友走。","en":"The last piece of a traveler’s bread is never stolen. When caught, the only defense is that nobody escapes this place hungry. Someone wrote beside the road: Remember your friends."},"霜枝潜印客·阿烙":{"zh":"围巾背面缝满暗袋，只有一个口袋是空的。有人欠下一句道别，至今还没来放进去。有些人先记起你，才想起自己的名字。","en":"Hidden pockets line the scarf. Only one is empty. Someone still owes it a farewell. Some remember you before remembering their own names."},"霜枝静棱潜印客":{"zh":"脚步很轻，口袋里的旧纽扣却总会出卖行踪。那枚纽扣是别人替缝的，舍不得扔。门越近，身后的路就越清楚。","en":"The steps are silent. An old button rattles in the pocket. Someone else sewed it on once; throwing it away is unthinkable. The nearer the gate, the clearer the road behind becomes."},"霜枝绒雾潜印客":{"zh":"卖过很多条近路，只有一条从不标价。那是回家的路，至今还没找到。旧伤会痒，旧约定也会。","en":"Many shortcuts have been sold. Only the road home has no price, because it has not yet been found. Old wounds ache. Old promises do too."},"霜枝潜印客·艾烙":{"zh":"卖过很多条近路，只有一条从不标价。那是回家的路，至今还没找到。山顶已经看得见，风却带来渡口的气味。","en":"Many shortcuts have been sold. Only the road home has no price, because it has not yet been found. The summit is visible. The wind smells of the first crossing."},"霜枝苔痕折面星客":{"zh":"它用陌生的符号记录旅人的呼吸，纸上却总会出现一句你读得懂的话：还没到时候。每一次道别，都像是在练习重逢。","en":"It records travelers’ breathing in strange symbols. One sentence always appears that you can read: Not yet. Every farewell feels like practice for meeting again."},"霜枝苔痕浮辉使":{"zh":"它从一盏熄灭的灯里走出来，忘了自己原来照过谁。每当听见脚步，微光总会先亮一点。有些人先记起你，才想起自己的名字。","en":"It emerged from an extinguished lamp, forgetting whom it once lit the way for. Footsteps still make it brighten. Some remember you before remembering their own names."},"霜枝铜缄浮辉使":{"zh":"它的影子比身体清楚，像另一个世界留在地上的窗。有人经过时，窗里偶尔会亮起灯。风吹散了很多话，却没有吹散同行的脚步。","en":"Its shadow is clearer than its body, a window from another world laid on the ground. Sometimes a passerby makes a lamp shine inside. The wind scatters words, never the steps of companions."},"霜枝铠卫·伊烙":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。旧伤会痒，旧约定也会。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. Old wounds ache. Old promises do too."},"霜枝苔痕环藤蛇":{"zh":"它的鳞片认得土地的温度，身体却始终记得一只捧起过它的手。遇见脚步时，它不再立刻逃走。有些人先记起你，才想起自己的名字。","en":"Its scales know the ground’s warmth. Its body remembers a hand that once lifted it. It no longer flees at the first footstep. Some remember you before remembering their own names."},"霜枝苔痕潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"它只在岸边有灯时浮上水面，嘴里衔着一枚磨圆的石子。像是有一件太小的礼物，一直找不到收的人。下山的路偶尔出现在上山的地图上。","en":"It surfaces only beside a lit bank, carrying a smooth pebble. A tiny gift has waited a long time for someone to receive it. The road down sometimes appears on the map upward."},"霜枝巡灯使·欧烙":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。旧伤会痒，旧约定也会。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. Old wounds ache. Old promises do too."},"霜枝修灯师·乌烙":{"zh":"行李里最重的东西是一口小锅。只要还能煮出热汤，旅途就不算到了绝路。山顶已经看得见，风却带来渡口的气味。","en":"A small pot is the heaviest thing in the pack. As long as there is hot soup, the journey has not reached its end. The summit is visible. The wind smells of the first crossing."},"霜枝潜印客·依烙":{"zh":"卖过很多条近路，只有一条从不标价。那是回家的路，至今还没找到。天亮前的梦，开始和初来时一模一样。","en":"Many shortcuts have been sold. Only the road home has no price, because it has not yet been found. The dreams before dawn begin to match those of your arrival."},"霜枝巡灯使·雅烙":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。每一次道别，都像是在练习重逢。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Every farewell feels like practice for meeting again."},"霜枝巡灯使·诺烙":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。天亮前的梦，开始和初来时一模一样。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. The dreams before dawn begin to match those of your arrival."},"霜枝峰脊巨灵·瑟烙":{"zh":"巨人记不住小地方的名字，便把见过的屋顶都刻在石头上。每一块都能在掌心放稳。最深的雪里，埋着一片温热的苔。","en":"The giant forgets small places’ names, so carves their roofs into stones. Every one rests safely in its palm. A warm scrap of moss lies in the deepest snow."},"霜枝铠卫·维烙":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。门越近，身后的路就越清楚。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. The nearer the gate, the clearer the road behind becomes."},"霜枝铠卫·希烙":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。有人在路边写过，别忘了带朋友走。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. Someone wrote beside the road: Remember your friends."},"霜枝铠卫·洛烙":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。旧伤会痒，旧约定也会。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. Old wounds ache. Old promises do too."},"霜枝潜印客·米烙":{"zh":"开锁的工具藏在发带里，真正的钥匙却挂在胸前。那扇门早已不见，钥匙一直没舍得换。门越近，身后的路就越清楚。","en":"Lock picks hide in the hairband. The real key hangs at the neck. Its door is long gone, but no other key will do. The nearer the gate, the clearer the road behind becomes."},"霜枝修灯师·岚烙":{"zh":"每次包扎完伤口，都会在绷带上画一个笑脸。最初是哄孩子，后来发现大人也需要。有些人先记起你，才想起自己的名字。","en":"A smiling face is drawn on every finished bandage. It began for children. Adults turned out to need it too. Some remember you before remembering their own names."},"霜枝修灯师·索烙":{"zh":"每次包扎完伤口，都会在绷带上画一个笑脸。最初是哄孩子，后来发现大人也需要。天亮前的梦，开始和初来时一模一样。","en":"A smiling face is drawn on every finished bandage. It began for children. Adults turned out to need it too. The dreams before dawn begin to match those of your arrival."},"霜枝铠卫·莱烙":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。每一次道别，都像是在练习重逢。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. Every farewell feels like practice for meeting again."},"霜枝窑心偶·岑烙":{"zh":"罐身被仔细补过很多次，里面装的却只有一撮泥土。每逢有人说起家，土便轻轻晃一下。每一次道别，都像是在练习重逢。","en":"The jar has been carefully mended many times. Inside is only a handful of soil, stirring gently whenever someone mentions home. Every farewell feels like practice for meeting again."},"霜枝窑心偶·塔烙":{"zh":"罐身被仔细补过很多次，里面装的却只有一撮泥土。每逢有人说起家，土便轻轻晃一下。天亮前的梦，开始和初来时一模一样。","en":"The jar has been carefully mended many times. Inside is only a handful of soil, stirring gently whenever someone mentions home. The dreams before dawn begin to match those of your arrival."},"霜枝潜印客·莫烙":{"zh":"围巾背面缝满暗袋，只有一个口袋是空的。有人欠下一句道别，至今还没来放进去。天亮前的梦，开始和初来时一模一样。","en":"Hidden pockets line the scarf. Only one is empty. Someone still owes it a farewell. The dreams before dawn begin to match those of your arrival."},"霜枝银露铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。旧伤会痒，旧约定也会。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. Old wounds ache. Old promises do too."},"霜枝藤印铠卫":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。山顶已经看得见，风却带来渡口的气味。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. The summit is visible. The wind smells of the first crossing."},"霜枝雾羽铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。旧伤会痒，旧约定也会。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. Old wounds ache. Old promises do too."},"霜枝镜纹巡灯使":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。最深的雪里，埋着一片温热的苔。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. A warm scrap of moss lies in the deepest snow."},"霜枝石封潜印客":{"zh":"围巾背面缝满暗袋，只有一个口袋是空的。有人欠下一句道别，至今还没来放进去。雪里的脚印，常常会在前面等你。","en":"Hidden pockets line the scarf. Only one is empty. Someone still owes it a farewell. Your footprints sometimes wait ahead in the snow."},"霜枝鸣枝潜印客":{"zh":"擅长从人群中消失，却总在有人落单时现身。借口每次都一样：碰巧顺路。门越近，身后的路就越清楚。","en":"Expert at vanishing into crowds, yet always appearing beside anyone left alone. The excuse is always the same: Going that way anyway. The nearer the gate, the clearer the road behind becomes."},"霜枝弧光铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。下山的路偶尔出现在上山的地图上。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. The road down sometimes appears on the map upward."},"霜枝苔痕棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"它把捡到的手套排成一行，像在替走散的人准备重逢。最破的那只，始终留在自己脚边。寒冷教会人，记忆也需要彼此保温。","en":"It lines up found gloves, preparing for a reunion. The most ragged one always stays beside its paws. The cold teaches that memories need shared warmth too."},"霜枝微烛攀钟猿":{"zh":"它学会了旅人打招呼的手势，却不知道什么时候该说再见。每次有人离开，它都会重新挥一遍。雪里的脚印，常常会在前面等你。","en":"It learned a traveler’s greeting but never when to say goodbye. Whenever someone leaves, it starts waving all over again. Your footprints sometimes wait ahead in the snow."},"霜枝铜缄苔痕铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。旧伤会痒，旧约定也会。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. Old wounds ache. Old promises do too."},"霜枝苔痕缄骨客":{"zh":"它沿着墓碑练习自己的字迹，写到最后，总把落款留成空白。也许是在等别人帮它想起。有人在路边写过，别忘了带朋友走。","en":"It practices its handwriting on the gravestones, always leaving the signature blank. Perhaps someone else will remember. Someone wrote beside the road: Remember your friends."},"霜枝铜缄折面星客":{"zh":"它用陌生的符号记录旅人的呼吸，纸上却总会出现一句你读得懂的话：还没到时候。有人在路边写过，别忘了带朋友走。","en":"It records travelers’ breathing in strange symbols. One sentence always appears that you can read: Not yet. Someone wrote beside the road: Remember your friends."},"霜枝苔痕砂脊蜥":{"zh":"尾巴断过一次，新的长得很慢。它学会了在向前跑之前，先看看身后的同伴有没有跟上。天亮前的梦，开始和初来时一模一样。","en":"Its lost tail is growing back slowly. Before running ahead, it has learned to check whether its companions are following. The dreams before dawn begin to match those of your arrival."},"霜枝暖灰潜印客":{"zh":"从没偷过旅人的最后一块面包。被抓住时也只辩解一句：饿着肚子，跑不出这地方。雪里的脚印，常常会在前面等你。","en":"The last piece of a traveler’s bread is never stolen. When caught, the only defense is that nobody escapes this place hungry. Your footprints sometimes wait ahead in the snow."},"霜枝悬灯潜印客":{"zh":"围巾背面缝满暗袋，只有一个口袋是空的。有人欠下一句道别，至今还没来放进去。寒冷教会人，记忆也需要彼此保温。","en":"Hidden pockets line the scarf. Only one is empty. Someone still owes it a farewell. The cold teaches that memories need shared warmth too."},"霜枝银露潜印客":{"zh":"从没偷过旅人的最后一块面包。被抓住时也只辩解一句：饿着肚子，跑不出这地方。最深的雪里，埋着一片温热的苔。","en":"The last piece of a traveler’s bread is never stolen. When caught, the only defense is that nobody escapes this place hungry. A warm scrap of moss lies in the deepest snow."},"霜枝远路巡灯使":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。旧伤会痒，旧约定也会。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. Old wounds ache. Old promises do too."},"霜枝石封巡灯使":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。下山的路偶尔出现在上山的地图上。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. The road down sometimes appears on the map upward."},"霜枝鸣枝巡灯使":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。最深的雪里，埋着一片温热的苔。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. A warm scrap of moss lies in the deepest snow."},"霜枝琉纹攀钟猿":{"zh":"它把最甜的果子留在高枝上，等那个再也没有回来的伙伴。后来枝头的果子，竟长成一盏小灯。下山的路偶尔出现在上山的地图上。","en":"It leaves the sweetest fruit on a high branch for a companion who never returned. One fruit has grown into a tiny lamp. The road down sometimes appears on the map upward."},"霜枝铜缄铜缄铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。旧伤会痒，旧约定也会。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. Old wounds ache. Old promises do too."},"霜枝苔痕掠风鸟":{"zh":"翅下藏着一片来自别处的落叶。飞得再远，那片叶子也没有掉下来过。雪里的脚印，常常会在前面等你。","en":"A leaf from elsewhere rests beneath one wing. No flight has ever shaken it loose. Your footprints sometimes wait ahead in the snow."},"霜枝铜缄回声铠卫":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。最深的雪里，埋着一片温热的苔。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. A warm scrap of moss lies in the deepest snow."},"霜枝铜缄微烛铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。门越近，身后的路就越清楚。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. The nearer the gate, the clearer the road behind becomes."},"霜枝铜缄琉纹铠卫":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。有人在路边写过，别忘了带朋友走。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. Someone wrote beside the road: Remember your friends."},"霜枝铜缄峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"肩上的鸟巢早已空了，它仍在过桥时低头。旧习惯比石头重，却比石头暖和。雪里的脚印，常常会在前面等你。","en":"The nest on its shoulder is empty. It still ducks under every bridge. Old habits weigh more than stone, and keep it warmer. Your footprints sometimes wait ahead in the snow."},"霜枝铜缄缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。寒冷教会人，记忆也需要彼此保温。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. The cold teaches that memories need shared warmth too."},"霜枝浮辉使·伦烙":{"zh":"它的影子比身体清楚，像另一个世界留在地上的窗。有人经过时，窗里偶尔会亮起灯。有些人先记起你，才想起自己的名字。","en":"Its shadow is clearer than its body, a window from another world laid on the ground. Sometimes a passerby makes a lamp shine inside. Some remember you before remembering their own names."},"星铸裂角客领誓·佩烙":{"zh":"他能让一步路长过整夜，自己却已经在门前站了太久。你靠近时，他第一次问：外面还有谁在等？","en":"He can stretch one step through a whole night. He has stood at the gate far longer. At your approach he finally asks who still waits outside."},"星铸灯议长·泽烙":{"zh":"他把写错的地图一张张烧掉，又从火里取回两张新的。最早的纸灰上，只有你刚刚醒来时的那张脸。","en":"He burns each mistaken map and takes two new ones from the fire. The oldest ash shows the face you wore when you first awoke."},"星铸灯议长·图烙":{"zh":"他把守门者的称号一一擦掉，说没有名字就不必遵守命令。等到最后，他发现命令是自己亲手写下的。","en":"He erases the gatekeepers’ titles, believing the nameless need not obey. The last command is in his own handwriting."},"星铸铠卫领誓·芮烙":{"zh":"他把所有偏离道路的人拉回中央，害怕他们掉进星间的空隙。你发现中央那条路，正弯向最初的渡口。","en":"He pulls every wanderer toward the center, away from the void. You notice the central path bending toward the crossing where you began."},"星铸环藤蛇领誓·阿玟":{"zh":"蛇蜕下的皮铺满台阶，最旧的一层比星门还要古老。它始终留着尾巴上的伤，像一枚不肯擦去的记号。","en":"The serpent’s cast skins cover the steps. The oldest predates the gate. It keeps the scar on its tail, a mark it refuses to erase."},"星铸裂角客领誓·艾玟":{"zh":"他把自己的心火借给每个走到这里的人，换来一句不会回头的承诺。如今他已经学会先问：你要带谁走？","en":"He lends heartfire to every traveler who reaches him, asking them not to turn back. Now he first asks whom they will take along."},"星铸裂角客领誓·伊玟":{"zh":"他曾替星门看守钥匙，后来钥匙长成了会咬人的藤。被困住的每个人，都说只差最后一步就能回家。","en":"He once kept the gate’s key. It grew into a biting vine. Everyone caught in it says they were one step from home."},"星铸峰脊巨灵领誓·欧玟":{"zh":"巨人捧着一颗落下的星，怕它烧穿回家的路。你在星光里看见的，却是最初那盏灯底下的影子。","en":"The giant cups a fallen star so it cannot burn through the road home. Inside its light is the shadow beneath your very first lamp."},"星铸巡影狼领誓·乌玟":{"zh":"狼记得每一位没有回来的人，也记得他们离开时的气味。它在你身上停了很久，最后只是安静地坐下。","en":"The wolf remembers the scent of everyone who never returned. It studies yours for a long time, then quietly sits beside you."},"星铸灯议长·依玟":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸灯议长·雅玟":{"zh":"他替即将分别的人绑紧鞋带，从不说再见。星门前散落的旧鞋里，有一双与你脚上的磨损完全相同。","en":"He tightens the laces of those about to leave and never says goodbye. One discarded pair at the gate is worn exactly like your own."},"星铸灯议长·诺玟":{"zh":"他擦去你的伤与疲惫，却没有擦去衣角那撮渡口的泥。那是他说过最轻的一句提醒：记住，你来过这里。","en":"He clears your pain and weariness, leaving the crossing mud on your coat. Remember that you were here, he says, very softly."},"星铸折面星客领誓·瑟玟":{"zh":"门后的来客与你有相同的脚步声。它始终不肯回头，仿佛认出你，比再次失去你更加可怕。","en":"The figure behind the gate walks with your footsteps. It will not turn around, as though recognizing you would hurt more than losing you again."},"星铸铠卫领誓·维玟":{"zh":"他把走到门前的人都称作归客，而不是旅人。你问他哪一次才算真正抵达，他说，先看看谁还在你身边。","en":"He calls those at the gate returners, never travelers. Asked when arrival becomes real, he tells you to look at who is still beside you."},"星铸修灯师·希玟":{"zh":"总说药不够，所以从不给自己留。只有旧围裙上的结，记着这双手也曾抖得厉害。走到这里的人，都开始留心身边的位置。","en":"There is never enough medicine, so none is kept for the healer. The knots in the old apron remember how badly these hands once shook. Those who reach this place count the spaces beside them."},"星铸铠卫领誓·洛玟":{"zh":"他守着星门前最后一段台阶，盾背刻满同行者的名字。你的名字在最下面，旁边留着一块新的空白。","en":"He guards the last steps to the star gate. His shield bears the names of companions. Yours sits at the bottom, beside a fresh blank space."},"星铸铠卫领誓·米玟":{"zh":"他的盾记住了每一道雷，剑却忘了该指向谁。你们交手时，天上的星排列成一张你熟悉的牌桌。","en":"His shield remembers every bolt. His sword has forgotten its enemy. As you fight, the stars arrange themselves like a familiar card table."},"星铸裂角客领誓·岚玟":{"zh":"它把自己困在窄门里太久，几乎忘了角也可以低下来。门外一直有人替它留着灯。走到这里的人，都开始留心身边的位置。","en":"It has stood trapped in a narrow doorway so long it forgot that horns can be lowered. Someone still leaves a lamp outside. Those who reach this place count the spaces beside them."},"星铸灯议长·索玟":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸镜瞳山猫领誓·莱玟":{"zh":"窗台上所有东西都被它推下过，只有那张旧车票还在。也许它比任何人都清楚，什么才不能弄丢。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"It has pushed everything off the sill except an old ticket. Perhaps it knows best what must not be lost. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸铠卫领誓·岑玟":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸铠卫领誓·塔玟":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸铠卫领誓·莫玟":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸铠卫领誓·伦玟":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸铠卫领誓·佩玟":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。出口像一个问句，从来没写过答案。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. The exit is a question without an answer."},"星铸潜印客领誓·泽玟":{"zh":"从没偷过旅人的最后一块面包。被抓住时也只辩解一句：饿着肚子，跑不出这地方。出口像一个问句，从来没写过答案。","en":"The last piece of a traveler’s bread is never stolen. When caught, the only defense is that nobody escapes this place hungry. The exit is a question without an answer."},"星铸潜印客领誓·图玟":{"zh":"脚步很轻，口袋里的旧纽扣却总会出卖行踪。那枚纽扣是别人替缝的，舍不得扔。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"The steps are silent. An old button rattles in the pocket. Someone else sewed it on once; throwing it away is unthinkable. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸铠卫领誓·芮玟":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸铠卫领誓·阿斐":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸铠卫领誓·艾斐":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸掠风鸟领誓·伊斐":{"zh":"翅下藏着一片来自别处的落叶。飞得再远，那片叶子也没有掉下来过。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"A leaf from elsewhere rests beneath one wing. No flight has ever shaken it loose. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸掠风鸟领誓·欧斐":{"zh":"翅下藏着一片来自别处的落叶。飞得再远，那片叶子也没有掉下来过。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"A leaf from elsewhere rests beneath one wing. No flight has ever shaken it loose. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸枝灯树灵领誓·乌斐":{"zh":"根须抱着一只生锈的旅行箱，枝条却一直伸向远方。箱子没打开过，像一个不能轻易答应的邀请。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"Its roots clasp a rusted suitcase while its branches reach away. The case stays closed, an invitation not easily accepted. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸枝灯树灵领誓·依斐":{"zh":"它记得每个靠在树荫下睡着的人。年轮一圈圈长大，总给那些人的位置留一点空。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"It remembers everyone who slept beneath its shade. Each new ring leaves a little room where they once rested. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸枝灯树灵领誓·雅斐":{"zh":"根须抱着一只生锈的旅行箱，枝条却一直伸向远方。箱子没打开过，像一个不能轻易答应的邀请。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"Its roots clasp a rusted suitcase while its branches reach away. The case stays closed, an invitation not easily accepted. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸枝灯树灵领誓·诺斐":{"zh":"根须抱着一只生锈的旅行箱，枝条却一直伸向远方。箱子没打开过，像一个不能轻易答应的邀请。走到这里的人，都开始留心身边的位置。","en":"Its roots clasp a rusted suitcase while its branches reach away. The case stays closed, an invitation not easily accepted. Those who reach this place count the spaces beside them."},"星铸镜瞳山猫领誓·瑟斐":{"zh":"它从不接受陌生人的呼唤，却总在旅人睡着后靠近灯火。等人醒来，行囊上便多一层温热的毛。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"It ignores every stranger’s call, but approaches the lamp once travelers sleep. Warm fur on a pack is the only sign it stayed. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸灯议长·维斐":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。出口像一个问句，从来没写过答案。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. The exit is a question without an answer."},"星铸灯议长·希斐":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸峰脊巨灵领誓·洛斐":{"zh":"巨人记不住小地方的名字，便把见过的屋顶都刻在石头上。每一块都能在掌心放稳。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"The giant forgets small places’ names, so carves their roofs into stones. Every one rests safely in its palm. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸灯议长·米斐":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸灯议长·岚斐":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸凝光泥团领誓·索斐":{"zh":"它把掉进身体里的小东西一件件吐回岸上，唯独留着一颗玻璃珠。透过那颗珠子，天会显得很蓝。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"It returns everything that falls into its body to the bank, keeping one glass marble. Through it, the sky looks very blue. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸裂角客领誓·莱斐":{"zh":"被叫作怪物之后，它学会把笑藏起来。胸口那块干净的布，是第一个没有逃跑的人留下的。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"After being called a monster, it learned to hide its smile. The clean cloth at its chest came from the first person who did not run. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸裂角客领誓·岑斐":{"zh":"角上的旧绳结是别人替系的。模样看着凶，路边落单的小东西却总往它脚下躲。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"Someone else tied the old knot around its horns. Fearsome as it looks, small lost creatures shelter at its feet. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸星枝鹿领誓·塔斐":{"zh":"鹿角缠着一条旧布，雨天会把它染成温柔的深色。它曾替走散的孩子挡雨，后来没有再把布甩掉。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"An old cloth wraps its antlers, darkening gently in rain. It once sheltered a lost child and never shook the cloth off. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸星枝鹿领誓·莫斐":{"zh":"它走得很轻，怕惊醒草间那些不愿醒来的梦。只有听见呼救时，才会踏出和体形不相称的响声。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"It steps lightly around dreams sleeping in the grass. Only a cry for help makes its hooves sound as heavy as they are. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·伦斐":{"zh":"龙在每一处落脚点都留下一道爪印。不是为了占有土地，只是怕回来时认不出自己走过的路。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"The dragon marks every resting place with a claw. It claims no land, only hopes to recognize the road if it returns. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·佩斐":{"zh":"龙在每一处落脚点都留下一道爪印。不是为了占有土地，只是怕回来时认不出自己走过的路。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"The dragon marks every resting place with a claw. It claims no land, only hopes to recognize the road if it returns. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸灯议长·泽斐":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸灯议长·图斐":{"zh":"能让星光停在指间，却没法让一封回信早些到来。于是每晚的灯都亮得比别人久。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"Starlight can be held between these fingers. A reply cannot be hurried. The study lamp burns later every night. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸灯议长·芮斐":{"zh":"法术书里夹的都是寻路纸条。最复杂的公式旁边，写着一句很小的字：这里也不通。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"The spellbook is full of directions. Beside the most elaborate formula, a small note reads: This way is closed too. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸巡影狼领誓·阿霖":{"zh":"狼沿着星光寻找走散的群伴，每一次抬头都少一颗熟悉的星。它终于开始低头，看地上还活着的脚印。","en":"The wolf follows starlight in search of its pack. Each time it looks up, another familiar star is missing. At last it studies the living tracks below."},"星铸巡影狼领誓·艾霖":{"zh":"狼在每次进食前都把第一口留在地上。它已经独行很久，却还没有学会只等自己一个。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"The wolf leaves the first bite on the ground. It has traveled alone for years and has not learned to wait only for itself. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸灯议长·伊霖":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸灯议长·欧霖":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸灯议长·乌霖":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸灯议长·依霖":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸灯议长·雅霖":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸灯议长·诺霖":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸灯议长·瑟霖":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸赤角兽领誓·维霖":{"zh":"它能撞开最结实的围栏，却总在一扇歪门前停住。门后放过盐和清水，那段记忆比铁还牢。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"It breaks the strongest fences, yet stops at one crooked gate. Someone once left salt and clean water there. That memory holds better than iron. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸赤角兽领誓·希霖":{"zh":"断角上挂着牧人留下的铃，早已敲不出声音。它仍在暮色里抬起头，等待熟悉的那一声口哨。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"A shepherd’s silent bell hangs from its broken horn. At dusk it still raises its head, waiting for a familiar whistle. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸灯议长·洛霖":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸灯议长·米霖":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。走到这里的人，都开始留心身边的位置。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. Those who reach this place count the spaces beside them."},"星铸甲灯虫领誓·岚霖":{"zh":"壳上的细纹像一张过时的地图。它循着本能迁徙，偶尔也会在岔路上停下，像在等谁提醒。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"The fine marks on its shell resemble an outdated map. Even instinct stops at a fork sometimes, as if waiting for a reminder. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸甲灯虫领誓·索霖":{"zh":"壳上的细纹像一张过时的地图。它循着本能迁徙，偶尔也会在岔路上停下，像在等谁提醒。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"The fine marks on its shell resemble an outdated map. Even instinct stops at a fork sometimes, as if waiting for a reminder. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸裂角客领誓·莱霖":{"zh":"角上的旧绳结是别人替系的。模样看着凶，路边落单的小东西却总往它脚下躲。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"Someone else tied the old knot around its horns. Fearsome as it looks, small lost creatures shelter at its feet. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸甲灯虫领誓·岑霖":{"zh":"壳上的细纹像一张过时的地图。它循着本能迁徙，偶尔也会在岔路上停下，像在等谁提醒。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"The fine marks on its shell resemble an outdated map. Even instinct stops at a fork sometimes, as if waiting for a reminder. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·塔霖":{"zh":"龙在每一处落脚点都留下一道爪印。不是为了占有土地，只是怕回来时认不出自己走过的路。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"The dragon marks every resting place with a claw. It claims no land, only hopes to recognize the road if it returns. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·莫霖":{"zh":"它收集过很多亮晶晶的东西，最后只留下了一片窗玻璃。透过那一片，看出去的天最像故乡。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"It collected many shining things, keeping only a shard of window glass. The sky through it looks most like home. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·伦霖":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·佩霖":{"zh":"它收集过很多亮晶晶的东西，最后只留下了一片窗玻璃。透过那一片，看出去的天最像故乡。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"It collected many shining things, keeping only a shard of window glass. The sky through it looks most like home. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·泽霖":{"zh":"翅膀上的伤口已经长好，试飞却总在最后一刻停住。有些距离不是伤好了，就敢再走一次。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"The wing has healed, but every test flight stops at the last moment. Some distances remain frightening after wounds close. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·图霖":{"zh":"它收集过很多亮晶晶的东西，最后只留下了一片窗玻璃。透过那一片，看出去的天最像故乡。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"It collected many shining things, keeping only a shard of window glass. The sky through it looks most like home. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·芮霖":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。走到这里的人，都开始留心身边的位置。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. Those who reach this place count the spaces beside them."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·阿沐":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。出口像一个问句，从来没写过答案。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. The exit is a question without an answer."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·艾沐":{"zh":"它收集过很多亮晶晶的东西，最后只留下了一片窗玻璃。透过那一片，看出去的天最像故乡。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"It collected many shining things, keeping only a shard of window glass. The sky through it looks most like home. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·伊沐":{"zh":"龙在每一处落脚点都留下一道爪印。不是为了占有土地，只是怕回来时认不出自己走过的路。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"The dragon marks every resting place with a claw. It claims no land, only hopes to recognize the road if it returns. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·欧沐":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·乌沐":{"zh":"翅膀上的伤口已经长好，试飞却总在最后一刻停住。有些距离不是伤好了，就敢再走一次。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"The wing has healed, but every test flight stops at the last moment. Some distances remain frightening after wounds close. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸石封铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸暖灰铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸悬灯铠卫":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸银露铠卫":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸藤印铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸雾羽铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸弧光巡灯使":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸微烛观灯师":{"zh":"帽檐缝着一圈错写的咒文。那是第一次学会法术时留下的失误，后来一直没有拆。出口像一个问句，从来没写过答案。","en":"Misspelled charms line the hat brim. They are the first mistakes of a young apprentice, never unpicked. The exit is a question without an answer."},"星铸铜缄苔痕巡灯使":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸苔痕露囊蛙":{"zh":"雨停后它仍在叫，像怕晚到的人错过渡口。荷叶下压着一截旧绳，另一头早被水流带走。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"It calls after the rain stops, afraid a late traveler might miss the crossing. An old rope lies beneath its leaf, its far end carried away. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸铜缄铜缄巡灯使":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸绒雾裂角客":{"zh":"它把自己困在窄门里太久，几乎忘了角也可以低下来。门外一直有人替它留着灯。出口像一个问句，从来没写过答案。","en":"It has stood trapped in a narrow doorway so long it forgot that horns can be lowered. Someone still leaves a lamp outside. The exit is a question without an answer."},"星铸夜航裂角客":{"zh":"它用尾巴把掉进沟里的灯捞起，再装作什么都没发生。谢意让它比火还要不自在。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"It fishes a fallen lamp from the ditch with its tail and pretends nothing happened. Gratitude makes it more uneasy than fire. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸流砂裂角客":{"zh":"它把自己困在窄门里太久，几乎忘了角也可以低下来。门外一直有人替它留着灯。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"It has stood trapped in a narrow doorway so long it forgot that horns can be lowered. Someone still leaves a lamp outside. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸镜纹裂角客":{"zh":"它用尾巴把掉进沟里的灯捞起，再装作什么都没发生。谢意让它比火还要不自在。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"It fishes a fallen lamp from the ditch with its tail and pretends nothing happened. Gratitude makes it more uneasy than fire. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸远路裂角客":{"zh":"角上的旧绳结是别人替系的。模样看着凶，路边落单的小东西却总往它脚下躲。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"Someone else tied the old knot around its horns. Fearsome as it looks, small lost creatures shelter at its feet. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸回声潜印客":{"zh":"围巾背面缝满暗袋，只有一个口袋是空的。有人欠下一句道别，至今还没来放进去。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"Hidden pockets line the scarf. Only one is empty. Someone still owes it a farewell. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸苔痕浮辉使":{"zh":"它从一盏熄灭的灯里走出来，忘了自己原来照过谁。每当听见脚步，微光总会先亮一点。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"It emerged from an extinguished lamp, forgetting whom it once lit the way for. Footsteps still make it brighten. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸苔痕缄骨客":{"zh":"这副骨架曾替旅人搬过行李，如今连自己的名字都背不动了。路牌倒还认得几个。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"This skeleton once carried travelers’ luggage. Now even its own name is too heavy, though a few signposts remain familiar. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸铜缄缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸石封裂角客":{"zh":"被叫作怪物之后，它学会把笑藏起来。胸口那块干净的布，是第一个没有逃跑的人留下的。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"After being called a monster, it learned to hide its smile. The clean cloth at its chest came from the first person who did not run. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸鸣枝裂角客":{"zh":"角上的旧绳结是别人替系的。模样看着凶，路边落单的小东西却总往它脚下躲。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"Someone else tied the old knot around its horns. Fearsome as it looks, small lost creatures shelter at its feet. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸回声掠风鸟":{"zh":"它把路上捡来的线头编成巢，巢里却总空着一个位置。风每次改变方向，它都往远处多看一眼。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"It nests with threads found on the road, leaving one place empty. Every shift of wind makes it look farther away. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸微烛掠风鸟":{"zh":"它把路上捡来的线头编成巢，巢里却总空着一个位置。风每次改变方向，它都往远处多看一眼。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"It nests with threads found on the road, leaving one place empty. Every shift of wind makes it look farther away. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸琉纹掠风鸟":{"zh":"翅下藏着一片来自别处的落叶。飞得再远，那片叶子也没有掉下来过。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"A leaf from elsewhere rests beneath one wing. No flight has ever shaken it loose. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸苔痕棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"脖子上的绳扣早已空了，它还是每天到同一盏灯下等。陌生人伸手时，它会先闻一闻故乡的气味。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"The clasp at its neck is empty. It still waits beneath the same lamp, sniffing every offered hand for a trace of home. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸微烛巡影狼":{"zh":"狼在每次进食前都把第一口留在地上。它已经独行很久，却还没有学会只等自己一个。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"The wolf leaves the first bite on the ground. It has traveled alone for years and has not learned to wait only for itself. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸苔痕石背熊":{"zh":"它把洞里的干草铺得很厚，却从不独自睡在中间。那些留出的凹陷，仍和许多年前一样暖和。出口像一个问句，从来没写过答案。","en":"It heaps the den with hay, never sleeping in the center alone. The places left for others are still as warm as they were years ago. The exit is a question without an answer."},"星铸苔痕铜壳蟹":{"zh":"它横着搬走路上的碎玻璃，又把每一片摆在洞口。月亮照下来时，那座小屋比别处都亮。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"It clears shards from the path and arranges them outside its burrow. In moonlight, its little home shines brighter than any other. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸铜缄铜壳蟹":{"zh":"它横着搬走路上的碎玻璃，又把每一片摆在洞口。月亮照下来时，那座小屋比别处都亮。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"It clears shards from the path and arranges them outside its burrow. In moonlight, its little home shines brighter than any other. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸铜缄凝光泥团":{"zh":"它把掉进身体里的小东西一件件吐回岸上，唯独留着一颗玻璃珠。透过那颗珠子，天会显得很蓝。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"It returns everything that falls into its body to the bank, keeping one glass marble. Through it, the sky looks very blue. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸苔痕流墨触灵":{"zh":"它把海底的信瓶一一拧开，再替里面的纸折好。读不懂的字很多，想回家的人却似乎都写得一样。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"It opens the message bottles on the seabed and folds their letters carefully. The words are strange, but those wishing for home all seem to write alike. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸琉纹枝灯树灵":{"zh":"根须抱着一只生锈的旅行箱，枝条却一直伸向远方。箱子没打开过，像一个不能轻易答应的邀请。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"Its roots clasp a rusted suitcase while its branches reach away. The case stays closed, an invitation not easily accepted. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸铜缄浮辉使":{"zh":"它的影子比身体清楚，像另一个世界留在地上的窗。有人经过时，窗里偶尔会亮起灯。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"Its shadow is clearer than its body, a window from another world laid on the ground. Sometimes a passerby makes a lamp shine inside. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸暖灰裂角客":{"zh":"被叫作怪物之后，它学会把笑藏起来。胸口那块干净的布，是第一个没有逃跑的人留下的。走到这里的人，都开始留心身边的位置。","en":"After being called a monster, it learned to hide its smile. The clean cloth at its chest came from the first person who did not run. Those who reach this place count the spaces beside them."},"星铸铜缄流墨触灵":{"zh":"它把海底的信瓶一一拧开，再替里面的纸折好。读不懂的字很多，想回家的人却似乎都写得一样。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"It opens the message bottles on the seabed and folds their letters carefully. The words are strange, but those wishing for home all seem to write alike. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸回声峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"它怕踩坏路边的花，走路总绕很远。有人在它的脚印里挖了一口井，说这样再远也不怕没水。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"It takes long detours to spare the roadside flowers. Someone dug a well in its footprint, so the extra miles would never mean thirst. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸铜缄回声巡灯使":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸苔痕石指傀儡":{"zh":"它学会了敲门，却没有学会等门打开。如今总在同一扇空门框旁练习，动作一天比一天轻。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"It learned to knock, but not to wait for a door to open. Now it practices at an empty frame, more gently each day. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸铜缄露囊蛙":{"zh":"雨停后它仍在叫，像怕晚到的人错过渡口。荷叶下压着一截旧绳，另一头早被水流带走。走到这里的人，都开始留心身边的位置。","en":"It calls after the rain stops, afraid a late traveler might miss the crossing. An old rope lies beneath its leaf, its far end carried away. Those who reach this place count the spaces beside them."},"星铸苔痕线尾鼠":{"zh":"它把亮纽扣藏在洞口，想让迟归的同伴找到家。后来洞口搬了很多次，纽扣始终带着。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"It places a bright button by its burrow for late companions. The burrow has moved many times. The button always comes too. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸回声凝光泥团":{"zh":"它把掉进身体里的小东西一件件吐回岸上，唯独留着一颗玻璃珠。透过那颗珠子，天会显得很蓝。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"It returns everything that falls into its body to the bank, keeping one glass marble. Through it, the sky looks very blue. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸铜缄棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"它把捡到的手套排成一行，像在替走散的人准备重逢。最破的那只，始终留在自己脚边。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"It lines up found gloves, preparing for a reunion. The most ragged one always stays beside its paws. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸回声缄骨客":{"zh":"它沿着墓碑练习自己的字迹，写到最后，总把落款留成空白。也许是在等别人帮它想起。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"It practices its handwriting on the gravestones, always leaving the signature blank. Perhaps someone else will remember. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸铜缄线尾鼠":{"zh":"它把亮纽扣藏在洞口，想让迟归的同伴找到家。后来洞口搬了很多次，纽扣始终带着。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"It places a bright button by its burrow for late companions. The burrow has moved many times. The button always comes too. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸弧光铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸风蚀掠风鸟":{"zh":"它把路上捡来的线头编成巢，巢里却总空着一个位置。风每次改变方向，它都往远处多看一眼。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"It nests with threads found on the road, leaving one place empty. Every shift of wind makes it look farther away. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸琉纹观灯师":{"zh":"帽檐缝着一圈错写的咒文。那是第一次学会法术时留下的失误，后来一直没有拆。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"Misspelled charms line the hat brim. They are the first mistakes of a young apprentice, never unpicked. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸铜缄苔痕铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸暖灰晶棘蜥龙":{"zh":"翅膀上的伤口已经长好，试飞却总在最后一刻停住。有些距离不是伤好了，就敢再走一次。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"The wing has healed, but every test flight stops at the last moment. Some distances remain frightening after wounds close. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸铜缄铜缄铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸铜缄回声铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸铜缄微烛铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸铜缄琉纹铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸铜缄风蚀铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸铜缄静棱铠卫":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸铠卫·依沐":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸铠卫·雅沐":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸铜缄修灯师":{"zh":"药袋上写的不是药名，而是来求药的人的名字。最常用的那一包，字已经摸得看不清了。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"The packets bear patients’ names, not medicine names. The most often used label is worn beyond reading. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸铜缄微烛巡灯使":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸铜缄琉纹巡灯使":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸风蚀观灯师":{"zh":"能让星光停在指间，却没法让一封回信早些到来。于是每晚的灯都亮得比别人久。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"Starlight can be held between these fingers. A reply cannot be hurried. The study lamp burns later every night. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸微烛凝光泥团":{"zh":"它把掉进身体里的小东西一件件吐回岸上，唯独留着一颗玻璃珠。透过那颗珠子，天会显得很蓝。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"It returns everything that falls into its body to the bank, keeping one glass marble. Through it, the sky looks very blue. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸铜缄环藤蛇":{"zh":"它的鳞片认得土地的温度，身体却始终记得一只捧起过它的手。遇见脚步时，它不再立刻逃走。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"Its scales know the ground’s warmth. Its body remembers a hand that once lifted it. It no longer flees at the first footstep. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸铠卫·诺沐":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸铠卫·瑟沐":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸铠卫·维沐":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸铠卫·希沐":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸修灯师·洛沐":{"zh":"行李里最重的东西是一口小锅。只要还能煮出热汤，旅途就不算到了绝路。出口像一个问句，从来没写过答案。","en":"A small pot is the heaviest thing in the pack. As long as there is hot soup, the journey has not reached its end. The exit is a question without an answer."},"星铸观灯师·米沐":{"zh":"把所有仪式都简化之后，桌上只剩两只杯子。原来最难实现的愿望，不过是有人回来坐下。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"After simplifying every ritual, only two cups remain on the table. The hardest wish was always for someone to come back and sit down. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸巡影狼·岚沐":{"zh":"狼在每次进食前都把第一口留在地上。它已经独行很久，却还没有学会只等自己一个。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"The wolf leaves the first bite on the ground. It has traveled alone for years and has not learned to wait only for itself. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸观灯师·索沐":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。出口像一个问句，从来没写过答案。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. The exit is a question without an answer."},"星铸潜印客·莱沐":{"zh":"卖过很多条近路，只有一条从不标价。那是回家的路，至今还没找到。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"Many shortcuts have been sold. Only the road home has no price, because it has not yet been found. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸巡灯使·岑沐":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸窑心偶·塔沐":{"zh":"罐身被仔细补过很多次，里面装的却只有一撮泥土。每逢有人说起家，土便轻轻晃一下。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"The jar has been carefully mended many times. Inside is only a handful of soil, stirring gently whenever someone mentions home. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸窑心偶·莫沐":{"zh":"罐身被仔细补过很多次，里面装的却只有一撮泥土。每逢有人说起家，土便轻轻晃一下。走到这里的人，都开始留心身边的位置。","en":"The jar has been carefully mended many times. Inside is only a handful of soil, stirring gently whenever someone mentions home. Those who reach this place count the spaces beside them."},"星铸铠卫·伦沐":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。走到这里的人，都开始留心身边的位置。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. Those who reach this place count the spaces beside them."},"星铸铠卫·佩沐":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸巡灯使·泽沐":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸巡灯使·图沐":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸攀钟猿·芮沐":{"zh":"它把最甜的果子留在高枝上，等那个再也没有回来的伙伴。后来枝头的果子，竟长成一盏小灯。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"It leaves the sweetest fruit on a high branch for a companion who never returned. One fruit has grown into a tiny lamp. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸潜印客·阿洛":{"zh":"围巾背面缝满暗袋，只有一个口袋是空的。有人欠下一句道别，至今还没来放进去。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"Hidden pockets line the scarf. Only one is empty. Someone still owes it a farewell. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸巡灯使·艾洛":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸铠卫·伊洛":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸铠卫·欧洛":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸铠卫·乌洛":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸铠卫·依洛":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。真正走失的人，未必是忘了路的人。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. Those who forget the road are not always the truly lost."},"星铸铠卫·雅洛":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸潜印客·诺洛":{"zh":"围巾背面缝满暗袋，只有一个口袋是空的。有人欠下一句道别，至今还没来放进去。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"Hidden pockets line the scarf. Only one is empty. Someone still owes it a farewell. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸铠卫·瑟洛":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸观灯师·维洛":{"zh":"记录了很多扇打不开的门，也记录了每个愿意陪着试一次的人。后一册薄得让人心疼。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"One book lists doors that would not open. Another lists those willing to try together. The second is painfully thin. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸观灯师·希洛":{"zh":"把所有仪式都简化之后，桌上只剩两只杯子。原来最难实现的愿望，不过是有人回来坐下。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"After simplifying every ritual, only two cups remain on the table. The hardest wish was always for someone to come back and sit down. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸观灯师·洛洛":{"zh":"法术书里夹的都是寻路纸条。最复杂的公式旁边，写着一句很小的字：这里也不通。出口像一个问句，从来没写过答案。","en":"The spellbook is full of directions. Beside the most elaborate formula, a small note reads: This way is closed too. The exit is a question without an answer."},"星铸观灯师·米洛":{"zh":"把所有仪式都简化之后，桌上只剩两只杯子。原来最难实现的愿望，不过是有人回来坐下。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"After simplifying every ritual, only two cups remain on the table. The hardest wish was always for someone to come back and sit down. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸观灯师·岚洛":{"zh":"帽檐缝着一圈错写的咒文。那是第一次学会法术时留下的失误，后来一直没有拆。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"Misspelled charms line the hat brim. They are the first mistakes of a young apprentice, never unpicked. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸观灯师·索洛":{"zh":"帽檐缝着一圈错写的咒文。那是第一次学会法术时留下的失误，后来一直没有拆。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"Misspelled charms line the hat brim. They are the first mistakes of a young apprentice, never unpicked. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸巡灯使·莱洛":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。有人认得你的归来，却不记得你的离去。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. Some remember your return, never your departure."},"星铸巡灯使·岑洛":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。走到这里的人，都开始留心身边的位置。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. Those who reach this place count the spaces beside them."},"星铸铠卫·塔洛":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸修灯师·莫洛":{"zh":"药袋上写的不是药名，而是来求药的人的名字。最常用的那一包，字已经摸得看不清了。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"The packets bear patients’ names, not medicine names. The most often used label is worn beyond reading. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸缄骨客·伦洛":{"zh":"披风已经烂透，里面的针线包却一直收得整齐。想来从前也是个不忍看人挨冻的人。若明天又是第一天，至少能记住一张脸。","en":"The cloak has rotted through. The sewing kit inside is perfectly kept. Once, surely, this was someone who could not let others freeze. If tomorrow is the first day again, one face may still be remembered."},"星铸修灯师·佩洛":{"zh":"总说药不够，所以从不给自己留。只有旧围裙上的结，记着这双手也曾抖得厉害。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"There is never enough medicine, so none is kept for the healer. The knots in the old apron remember how badly these hands once shook. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸峰脊巨灵·泽洛":{"zh":"它怕踩坏路边的花，走路总绕很远。有人在它的脚印里挖了一口井，说这样再远也不怕没水。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"It takes long detours to spare the roadside flowers. Someone dug a well in its footprint, so the extra miles would never mean thirst. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸峰脊巨灵·图洛":{"zh":"巨人记不住小地方的名字，便把见过的屋顶都刻在石头上。每一块都能在掌心放稳。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"The giant forgets small places’ names, so carves their roofs into stones. Every one rests safely in its palm. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸观灯师·芮洛":{"zh":"记录了很多扇打不开的门，也记录了每个愿意陪着试一次的人。后一册薄得让人心疼。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"One book lists doors that would not open. Another lists those willing to try together. The second is painfully thin. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸缄骨客·阿岚":{"zh":"这副骨架曾替旅人搬过行李，如今连自己的名字都背不动了。路牌倒还认得几个。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"This skeleton once carried travelers’ luggage. Now even its own name is too heavy, though a few signposts remain familiar. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸巡灯使·艾岚":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸修灯师·伊岚":{"zh":"每次包扎完伤口，都会在绷带上画一个笑脸。最初是哄孩子，后来发现大人也需要。有些门不是等钥匙，而是在等同行的人到齐。","en":"A smiling face is drawn on every finished bandage. It began for children. Adults turned out to need it too. Some gates wait for the whole company, not a key."},"星铸浮岛龟·欧岚":{"zh":"壳上刻的箭头早已朝向不同的地方。它不急着分清哪一条才对，只先把落水的人带到岸边。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"The arrows carved on its shell point in different directions. It can settle that later. First, it carries the drowning ashore. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸巡灯使·乌岚":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸潜印客·依岚":{"zh":"脚步很轻，口袋里的旧纽扣却总会出卖行踪。那枚纽扣是别人替缝的，舍不得扔。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"The steps are silent. An old button rattles in the pocket. Someone else sewed it on once; throwing it away is unthinkable. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"星铸铠卫·雅岚":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。出口像一个问句，从来没写过答案。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. The exit is a question without an answer."},"星铸巡灯使·诺岚":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。旧的终点，或许只是还没认出的起点。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. An old ending may be a beginning not yet recognized."},"星铸观灯师·瑟岚":{"zh":"收集瓶子不是为了配药，而是想把故乡的风留住。空瓶摇起来，偶尔真会响起海声。重新出发时，愿意同行的人仍然算数。","en":"The bottles are for keeping the winds of home, not making potions. Sometimes an empty one answers with the sea. When the road begins again, those who came with you still count."},"星铸巡灯使·维岚":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸巡灯使·希岚":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。走到这里的人，都开始留心身边的位置。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. Those who reach this place count the spaces beside them."},"星铸环藤蛇·洛岚":{"zh":"它把蜕下的皮留在温暖的石缝，自己守着更冷的入口。有人看见过小兽躲进那些旧皮里避雨。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"It leaves its cast skin in warm crevices and guards the colder entrance. Small animals have been seen sheltering in the old skins. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"星铸巡灯使·米岚":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。门后传来的风声，和第一夜的完全相同。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. The wind beyond the gate is the wind of the first night."},"星铸窑心偶·岚岚":{"zh":"罐身被仔细补过很多次，里面装的却只有一撮泥土。每逢有人说起家，土便轻轻晃一下。归途不一定通向故乡，也可能通向一句旧问候。","en":"The jar has been carefully mended many times. Inside is only a handful of soil, stirring gently whenever someone mentions home. A road home may lead instead to an old greeting."},"折光灯议长·索岚":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。同行不是走得一样快，而是还愿意等。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. Traveling together means still being willing to wait."},"折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·莱岚":{"zh":"它收集过很多亮晶晶的东西，最后只留下了一片窗玻璃。透过那一片，看出去的天最像故乡。一盏灯照不清所有选择，但可以照清一张脸。","en":"It collected many shining things, keeping only a shard of window glass. The sky through it looks most like home. One lamp cannot show every choice, but it can show one face."},"折光铠卫领誓·岑岚":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。倒影比本人先学会了等待。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. The reflection learned to wait before the person did."},"折光镜瞳山猫领誓·塔岚":{"zh":"它从不接受陌生人的呼唤，却总在旅人睡着后靠近灯火。等人醒来，行囊上便多一层温热的毛。倒影比本人先学会了等待。","en":"It ignores every stranger’s call, but approaches the lamp once travelers sleep. Warm fur on a pack is the only sign it stayed. The reflection learned to wait before the person did."},"折光锈鬃豕领誓·莫岚":{"zh":"它用鼻子翻开潮湿的土，找到的食物却总比吃下的多。旁边那条小径，已经很久没有新的足印。这里的人不问何时离开，只问这回带上谁。","en":"It roots through damp soil, finding more food than it eats. No new tracks have appeared on the path beside it for a long time. Here they ask not when you leave, but whom you take this time."},"折光钩针蝎领誓·伦岚":{"zh":"尾刺碰过的东西都会留下痕迹，唯独一只旧手套仍然完好。那是它还愿意相信温暖的理由。越过裂缝的光，总会替某个人停留片刻。","en":"Everything touched by its sting bears a mark, except one old glove. That is why it still believes in warmth. The light crossing the rift always pauses briefly for someone."},"折光石指傀儡领誓·佩岚":{"zh":"它学会了敲门，却没有学会等门打开。如今总在同一扇空门框旁练习，动作一天比一天轻。一盏灯照不清所有选择，但可以照清一张脸。","en":"It learned to knock, but not to wait for a door to open. Now it practices at an empty frame, more gently each day. One lamp cannot show every choice, but it can show one face."},"折光铠卫领誓·泽岚":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。一段没有发生的旅途，也会让人舍不得告别。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. Even a journey that never happened can be hard to leave."},"折光灯议长·图岚":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。传闻中的出口，在这里有很多张不同的草图。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. The rumored exit has many different sketches here."},"折光铠卫领誓·芮岚":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。一盏灯照不清所有选择，但可以照清一张脸。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. One lamp cannot show every choice, but it can show one face."},"折光铠卫领誓·阿泽":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。一段没有发生的旅途，也会让人舍不得告别。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. Even a journey that never happened can be hard to leave."},"折光铠卫领誓·艾泽":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。某扇门后的天气，像极了还没忘记的故乡。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. Beyond one door, the weather resembles a home not yet forgotten."},"折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·伊泽":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。某扇门后的天气，像极了还没忘记的故乡。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. Beyond one door, the weather resembles a home not yet forgotten."},"折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·欧泽":{"zh":"它收集过很多亮晶晶的东西，最后只留下了一片窗玻璃。透过那一片，看出去的天最像故乡。碎光会把一条路映成很多条，脚步却只有自己的。","en":"It collected many shining things, keeping only a shard of window glass. The sky through it looks most like home. Shattered light makes many roads. Only the footsteps are yours."},"折光磐颚河兽领誓·乌泽":{"zh":"它守着浅水里唯一的石阶，平时只露出两只眼睛。有人滑倒时，水下总会恰好升起一块宽大的背。传闻中的出口，在这里有很多张不同的草图。","en":"It watches the shallows’ only stone step with two eyes above water. Whenever someone slips, a broad back rises just in time. The rumored exit has many different sketches here."},"折光铠卫领誓·依泽":{"zh":"战利品只有一把折叠椅。每逢有人受伤，这位巡路者就停下来，把椅子摆在避风处。重逢未必需要同一条路，只需要有人还认得。","en":"The only trophy is a folding chair. Whenever someone is hurt, this patrol stops and sets it out of the wind. Reunion needs no shared road, only someone who remembers."},"折光灯议长·雅泽":{"zh":"把所有仪式都简化之后，桌上只剩两只杯子。原来最难实现的愿望，不过是有人回来坐下。这里的人不问何时离开，只问这回带上谁。","en":"After simplifying every ritual, only two cups remain on the table. The hardest wish was always for someone to come back and sit down. Here they ask not when you leave, but whom you take this time."},"折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·诺泽":{"zh":"龙把最后一枚没有裂开的蛋藏在旧鳞下。遇见旅人时，它先看行囊，再看对方是不是还愿意走远。同行不是走得一样快，而是还愿意等。","en":"The dragon keeps its last uncracked egg beneath an old scale. It studies travelers’ packs, then asks whether they still mean to go far. Traveling together means still being willing to wait."},"折光攀钟猿领誓·瑟泽":{"zh":"它学会了旅人打招呼的手势，却不知道什么时候该说再见。每次有人离开，它都会重新挥一遍。重逢未必需要同一条路，只需要有人还认得。","en":"It learned a traveler’s greeting but never when to say goodbye. Whenever someone leaves, it starts waving all over again. Reunion needs no shared road, only someone who remembers."},"折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·维泽":{"zh":"它收集过很多亮晶晶的东西，最后只留下了一片窗玻璃。透过那一片，看出去的天最像故乡。一段没有发生的旅途，也会让人舍不得告别。","en":"It collected many shining things, keeping only a shard of window glass. The sky through it looks most like home. Even a journey that never happened can be hard to leave."},"折光枝灯树灵领誓·希泽":{"zh":"它记得每个靠在树荫下睡着的人。年轮一圈圈长大，总给那些人的位置留一点空。重逢未必需要同一条路，只需要有人还认得。","en":"It remembers everyone who slept beneath its shade. Each new ring leaves a little room where they once rested. Reunion needs no shared road, only someone who remembers."},"折光静棱铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。某扇门后的天气，像极了还没忘记的故乡。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. Beyond one door, the weather resembles a home not yet forgotten."},"折光绒雾铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。这里收藏着没有说出口的第二种选择。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. This place keeps the second choices never spoken aloud."},"折光夜航铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。这里的人不问何时离开，只问这回带上谁。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. Here they ask not when you leave, but whom you take this time."},"折光苔痕浮辉使":{"zh":"它从一盏熄灭的灯里走出来，忘了自己原来照过谁。每当听见脚步，微光总会先亮一点。一段没有发生的旅途，也会让人舍不得告别。","en":"It emerged from an extinguished lamp, forgetting whom it once lit the way for. Footsteps still make it brighten. Even a journey that never happened can be hard to leave."},"折光流砂铠卫":{"zh":"剑鞘比剑锋磨损得更厉害。比起向人拔剑，这位老兵更擅长把危险挡在半途。碎光会把一条路映成很多条，脚步却只有自己的。","en":"The scabbard is more worn than the blade. The veteran has more practice stopping danger than drawing against people. Shattered light makes many roads. Only the footsteps are yours."},"折光镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。同行不是走得一样快，而是还愿意等。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. Traveling together means still being willing to wait."},"折光苔痕裂角客":{"zh":"角上的旧绳结是别人替系的。模样看着凶，路边落单的小东西却总往它脚下躲。传闻中的出口，在这里有很多张不同的草图。","en":"Someone else tied the old knot around its horns. Fearsome as it looks, small lost creatures shelter at its feet. The rumored exit has many different sketches here."},"折光铜缄观灯师":{"zh":"记录了很多扇打不开的门，也记录了每个愿意陪着试一次的人。后一册薄得让人心疼。碎光会把一条路映成很多条，脚步却只有自己的。","en":"One book lists doors that would not open. Another lists those willing to try together. The second is painfully thin. Shattered light makes many roads. Only the footsteps are yours."},"折光铜缄裂角客":{"zh":"它把自己困在窄门里太久，几乎忘了角也可以低下来。门外一直有人替它留着灯。碎光会把一条路映成很多条，脚步却只有自己的。","en":"It has stood trapped in a narrow doorway so long it forgot that horns can be lowered. Someone still leaves a lamp outside. Shattered light makes many roads. Only the footsteps are yours."},"折光铜缄枝灯树灵":{"zh":"根须抱着一只生锈的旅行箱，枝条却一直伸向远方。箱子没打开过，像一个不能轻易答应的邀请。没有走过的路，也会留下让人难过的影子。","en":"Its roots clasp a rusted suitcase while its branches reach away. The case stays closed, an invitation not easily accepted. Even a road never taken can leave a painful shadow."},"折光苔痕甲灯虫":{"zh":"壳上的细纹像一张过时的地图。它循着本能迁徙，偶尔也会在岔路上停下，像在等谁提醒。一盏灯照不清所有选择，但可以照清一张脸。","en":"The fine marks on its shell resemble an outdated map. Even instinct stops at a fork sometimes, as if waiting for a reminder. One lamp cannot show every choice, but it can show one face."},"折光铜缄钩针蝎":{"zh":"尾刺碰过的东西都会留下痕迹，唯独一只旧手套仍然完好。那是它还愿意相信温暖的理由。某扇门后的天气，像极了还没忘记的故乡。","en":"Everything touched by its sting bears a mark, except one old glove. That is why it still believes in warmth. Beyond one door, the weather resembles a home not yet forgotten."},"折光苔痕地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"它沿着地下的旧石缝前行，把断掉的路重新钻通。没人感谢过它，地上的脚步却因此少了一点孤单。一盏灯照不清所有选择，但可以照清一张脸。","en":"It follows old cracks underground, reopening broken passages. No one thanks it, though footsteps above grow a little less lonely. One lamp cannot show every choice, but it can show one face."},"折光铜缄地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"它沿着地下的旧石缝前行，把断掉的路重新钻通。没人感谢过它，地上的脚步却因此少了一点孤单。重逢未必需要同一条路，只需要有人还认得。","en":"It follows old cracks underground, reopening broken passages. No one thanks it, though footsteps above grow a little less lonely. Reunion needs no shared road, only someone who remembers."},"折光回声巡灯使":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。某扇门后的天气，像极了还没忘记的故乡。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. Beyond one door, the weather resembles a home not yet forgotten."},"折光苔痕窑心偶":{"zh":"罐身被仔细补过很多次，里面装的却只有一撮泥土。每逢有人说起家，土便轻轻晃一下。没有走过的路，也会留下让人难过的影子。","en":"The jar has been carefully mended many times. Inside is only a handful of soil, stirring gently whenever someone mentions home. Even a road never taken can leave a painful shadow."},"折光远路铠卫":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。同行不是走得一样快，而是还愿意等。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. Traveling together means still being willing to wait."},"折光石封铠卫":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。车次和时刻仍每天认真核对。同行不是走得一样快，而是还愿意等。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Its number and departure time are checked every day. Traveling together means still being willing to wait."},"折光鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。碎光会把一条路映成很多条，脚步却只有自己的。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. Shattered light makes many roads. Only the footsteps are yours."},"折光铠卫·洛泽":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。一盏灯照不清所有选择，但可以照清一张脸。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. One lamp cannot show every choice, but it can show one face."},"折光铠卫·米泽":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。传闻中的出口，在这里有很多张不同的草图。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. The rumored exit has many different sketches here."},"折光铠卫·岚泽":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。没有走过的路，也会留下让人难过的影子。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. Even a road never taken can leave a painful shadow."},"折光巡灯使·索泽":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。倒影比本人先学会了等待。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. The reflection learned to wait before the person did."},"折光巡灯使·莱泽":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。越过裂缝的光，总会替某个人停留片刻。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. The light crossing the rift always pauses briefly for someone."},"折光巡灯使·岑泽":{"zh":"随身的行李很少：半块面包、一条旧围巾，还有一封始终没有地址的家书。一盏灯照不清所有选择，但可以照清一张脸。","en":"The luggage is small: half a loaf, an old scarf, and a letter home without an address. One lamp cannot show every choice, but it can show one face."},"折光铠卫·塔泽":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。传闻中的出口，在这里有很多张不同的草图。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. The rumored exit has many different sketches here."},"折光巡灯使·莫泽":{"zh":"口袋里的碎零钱来自不同的城市。没有一枚能在这里花掉，却舍不得丢。重逢未必需要同一条路，只需要有人还认得。","en":"The pocket change comes from different cities. None can be spent here. None can be thrown away. Reunion needs no shared road, only someone who remembers."},"折光枝灯树灵·伦泽":{"zh":"根须抱着一只生锈的旅行箱，枝条却一直伸向远方。箱子没打开过，像一个不能轻易答应的邀请。一盏灯照不清所有选择，但可以照清一张脸。","en":"Its roots clasp a rusted suitcase while its branches reach away. The case stays closed, an invitation not easily accepted. One lamp cannot show every choice, but it can show one face."},"折光巡灯使·佩泽":{"zh":"每天都把同一张地图翻到背面看。正面的路已经走遍，空白处也许还藏着别的选择。倒影比本人先学会了等待。","en":"Every day the same map is turned over. All its roads have been walked. The blank side may offer another choice. The reflection learned to wait before the person did."},"折光巡灯使·泽泽":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。一盏灯照不清所有选择，但可以照清一张脸。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. One lamp cannot show every choice, but it can show one face."},"折光铠卫·图泽":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。一段没有发生的旅途，也会让人舍不得告别。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. Even a journey that never happened can be hard to leave."},"折光铠卫·芮泽":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。这里收藏着没有说出口的第二种选择。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. This place keeps the second choices never spoken aloud."},"折光巡灯使·阿翎":{"zh":"从不收走桌上最后一份餐具。有人问起时，就说出门在外，总得相信迟到的人。一盏灯照不清所有选择，但可以照清一张脸。","en":"The last place at the table is never cleared. Away from home, someone must keep faith with the late arrivals. One lamp cannot show every choice, but it can show one face."},"折光铠卫·艾翎":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。这里收藏着没有说出口的第二种选择。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. This place keeps the second choices never spoken aloud."},"折光铠卫·伊翎":{"zh":"这位守卫总给迟到的人留门。门前的沙漏早已漏空，值夜的习惯却改不掉。一盏灯照不清所有选择，但可以照清一张脸。","en":"This guard leaves the gate open for late arrivals. The hourglass is empty, but old night-watch habits persist. One lamp cannot show every choice, but it can show one face."},"折光巡灯使·欧翎":{"zh":"怀表里放着一幅旧画，画中人的脸已经模糊。只记得见面时，应该先说一句谢谢。重逢未必需要同一条路，只需要有人还认得。","en":"A blurred portrait sits inside the watch. Only one thing is remembered: when they meet again, first say thank you. Reunion needs no shared road, only someone who remembers."},"苔庭暖灰缄骨客":{"zh":"这副骨架曾替旅人搬过行李，如今连自己的名字都背不动了。路牌倒还认得几个。渡口没有人问今天是哪一天。","en":"This skeleton once carried travelers’ luggage. Now even its own name is too heavy, though a few signposts remain familiar. Nobody at the crossing asks what day it is."},"苔庭铜缄掠风鸟":{"zh":"它把路上捡来的线头编成巢，巢里却总空着一个位置。风每次改变方向，它都往远处多看一眼。一盏陌生的灯，偶尔也能照出熟悉的影子。","en":"It nests with threads found on the road, leaving one place empty. Every shift of wind makes it look farther away. An unfamiliar lamp can still cast a familiar shadow."},"苔庭悬灯缄骨客":{"zh":"骨头上系着几条不同颜色的布带。它不记得那些人，却知道每一条都不能弄丢。夜里总有人替空着的位置添一根柴。","en":"Several colored ribbons bind the bones. It remembers none of their owners, only that not one may be lost. At night, someone adds a log for the empty place."},"砂镜铠卫·乌翎":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。杯沿的缺口早已被手指磨平。矿井的深处，有时听得见熟悉的笑声。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. One is never used. The chipped rim has been worn smooth by waiting hands. Familiar laughter sometimes rises from the deep mine."},"砂镜观灯师·依翎":{"zh":"能让星光停在指间，却没法让一封回信早些到来。于是每晚的灯都亮得比别人久。旧物上的灰，藏着比文字更久的记忆。","en":"Starlight can be held between these fingers. A reply cannot be hurried. The study lamp burns later every night. Dust on old things holds memories older than words."},"砂镜修灯师·雅翎":{"zh":"把采来的草按气味分类，最温和的那一捆留给睡不着的人。长夜里，这样的人很多。矿井的深处，有时听得见熟悉的笑声。","en":"The herbs are sorted by scent. The gentlest bunch is for those who cannot sleep. There are many in this long night. Familiar laughter sometimes rises from the deep mine."},"砂镜铠卫领誓·诺翎":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。每一处倒影，都替某个迷路的人留着灯。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. The sword is still cared for exactly as promised. Every reflection keeps a lamp for someone lost."},"霜枝铜缄风蚀铠卫":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。门越近，身后的路就越清楚。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. The nearer the gate, the clearer the road behind becomes."},"暮潮回声棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"脖子上的绳扣早已空了，它还是每天到同一盏灯下等。陌生人伸手时，它会先闻一闻故乡的气味。这里的月亮像一扇始终开不了的窗。","en":"The clasp at its neck is empty. It still waits beneath the same lamp, sniffing every offered hand for a trace of home. The moon here resembles a window that never opens."},"苔庭银露缄骨客":{"zh":"披风已经烂透，里面的针线包却一直收得整齐。想来从前也是个不忍看人挨冻的人。夜里总有人替空着的位置添一根柴。","en":"The cloak has rotted through. The sewing kit inside is perfectly kept. Once, surely, this was someone who could not let others freeze. At night, someone adds a log for the empty place."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·瑟翎":{"zh":"他站在每一级台阶的侧面，为赶路的人让出中间。只有问到出口时，他才会突然拦住去路。","en":"He stands aside on every stair, leaving the center clear for travelers. Ask about the exit, and he suddenly blocks the way."},"暮潮流砂潜印客":{"zh":"脚步很轻，口袋里的旧纽扣却总会出卖行踪。那枚纽扣是别人替缝的，舍不得扔。没有人愿意独自登上最后一艘船。","en":"The steps are silent. An old button rattles in the pocket. Someone else sewed it on once; throwing it away is unthinkable. Nobody wants to board the last boat alone."},"暮潮微烛织光蛛":{"zh":"它常把断掉的丝接成路标，却从不在网上画一条死路。困住谁之前，总先留一个缺口。港口的陌生人，越来越像久别的旧友。","en":"It mends broken threads into signposts, never marking a dead end. Every web keeps a gap before it catches anyone. The strangers at the harbor seem more and more like old friends."},"暮潮镜纹折面星客":{"zh":"它用陌生的符号记录旅人的呼吸，纸上却总会出现一句你读得懂的话：还没到时候。潮水退去后，总能找到一件似曾相识的旧物。","en":"It records travelers’ breathing in strange symbols. One sentence always appears that you can read: Not yet. Each low tide leaves something strangely familiar."},"苔庭缄骨客·维翎":{"zh":"骨缝里夹着一封没送到的信。手指已经不听使唤，却总在下雨时先去护住信封。林间的路牌只写着前方，没有写终点。","en":"An undelivered letter rests between the bones. The fingers barely work, but still cover it when rain begins. The woodland signs point ahead, never to an end."},"苔庭回声地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"它沿着地下的旧石缝前行，把断掉的路重新钻通。没人感谢过它，地上的脚步却因此少了一点孤单。回家的念头，在这里比灯油更难熄灭。","en":"It follows old cracks underground, reopening broken passages. No one thanks it, though footsteps above grow a little less lonely. The thought of home lasts longer here than lamp oil."},"苔庭雾羽缄骨客":{"zh":"这副骨架曾替旅人搬过行李，如今连自己的名字都背不动了。路牌倒还认得几个。有人说雾会散，只是从没说过时候。","en":"This skeleton once carried travelers’ luggage. Now even its own name is too heavy, though a few signposts remain familiar. They say the mist will clear, but never when."},"砂镜回声浮辉使":{"zh":"它从一盏熄灭的灯里走出来，忘了自己原来照过谁。每当听见脚步，微光总会先亮一点。旧物上的灰，藏着比文字更久的记忆。","en":"It emerged from an extinguished lamp, forgetting whom it once lit the way for. Footsteps still make it brighten. Dust on old things holds memories older than words."},"砂镜绒雾缄骨客":{"zh":"它沿着墓碑练习自己的字迹，写到最后，总把落款留成空白。也许是在等别人帮它想起。回声从不回答来处，只回答还在不在。","en":"It practices its handwriting on the gravestones, always leaving the signature blank. Perhaps someone else will remember. The echo never tells where you came from, only whether you remain."},"霜枝铜缄静棱铠卫":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。每次修补盔甲，总有人顺手把那块布洗得很干净。有些人先记起你，才想起自己的名字。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. Whenever the armor is mended, someone quietly washes the cloth. Some remember you before remembering their own names."},"霜枝藤印潜印客":{"zh":"围巾背面缝满暗袋，只有一个口袋是空的。有人欠下一句道别，至今还没来放进去。山顶已经看得见，风却带来渡口的气味。","en":"Hidden pockets line the scarf. Only one is empty. Someone still owes it a farewell. The summit is visible. The wind smells of the first crossing."},"星铸回声线尾鼠":{"zh":"它把亮纽扣藏在洞口，想让迟归的同伴找到家。后来洞口搬了很多次，纽扣始终带着。越过最后一级，脚下却像踏回最初那块石头。","en":"It places a bright button by its burrow for late companions. The burrow has moved many times. The button always comes too. Beyond the final step, the ground feels like the very first stone."},"星铸回声微烛铠卫":{"zh":"头盔曾借给一个怕黑的孩子，取回来时，里面多画了一颗歪歪扭扭的太阳。星门很近，最初那盏灯也很近。","en":"The helmet was once lent to a child afraid of the dark. It came back with a crooked sun drawn inside. The star gate is near. So is the first lamp."},"鎏金·铜钟织光蛛领誓·阿温":{"zh":"它把幼蛛藏在废钟里，靠旅人遗落的碎布补巢。与你同行后，它仍把幼蛛护在身后。你终于明白，最难舍下的从来不是那张网。","en":"It nests its young inside broken bells and patches their home with lost cloth. Beside you, it still shelters its young. At last you understand that the web was never the hardest thing to leave."},"鎏金·苔庭铠卫领誓·阿恩":{"zh":"他总在挥剑前闭眼，像在等待某个人的口令。同行的日子被一笔笔刻进旧物。离出口还有多远，已经不再是唯一值得记住的事。","en":"He closes his eyes before drawing his blade, waiting for a command that never comes. Your days together are marked on old belongings. The distance to the exit is no longer the only thing worth remembering."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·诺罗":{"zh":"他不再打造兵器，只在炉边替旅人修补旧物。同行的日子被一笔笔刻进旧物。离出口还有多远，已经不再是唯一值得记住的事。","en":"He no longer forges weapons, only repairs what travelers bring. Your days together are marked on old belongings. The distance to the exit is no longer the only thing worth remembering."},"鎏金·砂镜铠卫领誓·塔安":{"zh":"每次值夜都带两只杯子，另一只从来不用。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"Two cups come on every night watch. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·苔庭绛纹蝶领誓·乌珀":{"zh":"它在空灯旁孵化，翅上的斑纹像一封没有写完的信。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"It hatched beside an empty lamp. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·星铸铠卫领誓·维玟":{"zh":"他把走到门前的人都称作归客，而不是旅人。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He calls those at the gate returners, never travelers. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·苔庭灯议长·图珀":{"zh":"他掌管渡口的灯，最旧的账本里却有你的笔迹。行囊里的最后一份药，仍留给与你同行的人。有些约定，比那扇门更让人安心。","en":"He tends the crossing lamps. The last medicine in the pack is still for your companions. Some promises are more reassuring than any gate."},"鎏金·苔庭缄骨客领誓·米珀":{"zh":"他把过路人的名字刻在遗骨上，免得雾吞掉所有证据。你们一起守过的火，留下了一点不肯熄灭的余温。下一次醒来，也许还能认得。","en":"He carves travelers’ names into old bones so the mist cannot erase them all. The fire you tended together left warmth that will not die. Perhaps it will be recognized at the next awakening."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·乌汀":{"zh":"他替困在礁石上的人交换行李，直到每个人都能找到熟悉的东西。临行前留下的纸条里，画着你们一起走过的路。即便走散，也还有重新找到彼此的可能。","en":"He trades the stranded travelers’ belongings until everyone finds something familiar. The parting note traces the roads you walked together. Even if separated, you might still find each other."},"鎏金·铜钟铠卫领誓·阿雅":{"zh":"他冻结的从来不是钟，而是人伸向门把的那一瞬间。行囊里的最后一份药，仍留给与你同行的人。有些约定，比那扇门更让人安心。","en":"He freezes the instant a hand reaches for a door, not the clock that measures it. The last medicine in the pack is still for your companions. Some promises are more reassuring than any gate."},"鎏金·霜枝铠卫领誓·泽芙":{"zh":"他护送别人翻过一座又一座雪桥，每次只走到桥的中央。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He escorts travelers across snow bridges, stopping halfway. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·霜枝潜印客领誓·图芙":{"zh":"他把幻影留在门前，真身却藏在一封迟迟没寄出的信里。临行前留下的纸条里，画着你们一起走过的路。即便走散，也还有重新找到彼此的可能。","en":"He leaves a phantom at the door while his true self hides in an unsent letter. The parting note traces the roads you walked together. Even if separated, you might still find each other."},"鎏金·霜枝灯议长·诺诺":{"zh":"他知道最后的山门在哪里，也知道门后是什么。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He knows where the last mountain gate stands, and what is behind it. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·砂镜铠卫领誓·莫安":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。同行的日子被一笔笔刻进旧物。离出口还有多远，已经不再是唯一值得记住的事。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Your days together are marked on old belongings. The distance to the exit is no longer the only thing worth remembering."},"鎏金·砂镜潮纹游鱼领誓·依瑟":{"zh":"它只在岸边有灯时浮上水面，嘴里衔着一枚磨圆的石子。临行前留下的纸条里，画着你们一起走过的路。即便走散，也还有重新找到彼此的可能。","en":"It surfaces only beside a lit bank, carrying a smooth pebble. The parting note traces the roads you walked together. Even if separated, you might still find each other."},"鎏金·砂镜灯议长·维瑟":{"zh":"行李里最重的东西是一口小锅。行囊里的最后一份药，仍留给与你同行的人。有些约定，比那扇门更让人安心。","en":"A small pot is the heaviest thing in the pack. The last medicine in the pack is still for your companions. Some promises are more reassuring than any gate."},"鎏金·折光灯议长·索岚":{"zh":"习惯在门口多摆一双鞋，说是为了让远来的客人知道，屋里还有位置。同行的日子被一笔笔刻进旧物。离出口还有多远，已经不再是唯一值得记住的事。","en":"An extra pair of shoes waits at the door, so distant guests will know there is still room inside. Your days together are marked on old belongings. The distance to the exit is no longer the only thing worth remembering."},"鎏金·折光镜瞳山猫领誓·塔岚":{"zh":"它从不接受陌生人的呼唤，却总在旅人睡着后靠近灯火。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"It ignores every stranger’s call, but approaches the lamp once travelers sleep. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·折光铠卫领誓·岑岚":{"zh":"盾背缝着一小片家乡的布。临行前留下的纸条里，画着你们一起走过的路。即便走散，也还有重新找到彼此的可能。","en":"A scrap of cloth from home is sewn behind the shield. The parting note traces the roads you walked together. Even if separated, you might still find each other."},"鎏金·折光枝灯树灵领誓·希泽":{"zh":"它记得每个靠在树荫下睡着的人。你们一起守过的火，留下了一点不肯熄灭的余温。下一次醒来，也许还能认得。","en":"It remembers everyone who slept beneath its shade. The fire you tended together left warmth that will not die. Perhaps it will be recognized at the next awakening."},"鎏金·砂镜铠卫领誓·诺翎":{"zh":"盔甲里的纸条已经读不清了，佩剑却仍按最初的约定保养着。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The note inside the armor is illegible now. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·苔庭裂角客领誓·阿珀":{"zh":"角上的刻痕记着每一个穿过雾的人。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The notches on his horns count everyone who passed into the mist. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟铠卫领誓·瑟翎":{"zh":"他站在每一级台阶的侧面，为赶路的人让出中间。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He stands aside on every stair, leaving the center clear for travelers. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·维弥":{"zh":"他把余温分给还握得住武器的人，自己只留一盏冷灯。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He gives the remaining warmth to anyone still able to hold a weapon. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·岑尘":{"zh":"他的船从不离港，船帆却每天都换一个方向。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"His boat never leaves port, yet its sail turns daily. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·希汀":{"zh":"他负责把漂回港口的船重新推向海里。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He sends washed-up boats back to sea. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·星铸灯议长·泽烙":{"zh":"他把写错的地图一张张烧掉，又从火里取回两张新的。同行的日子被一笔笔刻进旧物。离出口还有多远，已经不再是唯一值得记住的事。","en":"He burns each mistaken map and takes two new ones from the fire. Your days together are marked on old belongings. The distance to the exit is no longer the only thing worth remembering."},"鎏金·星铸折面星客领誓·瑟玟":{"zh":"门后的来客与你有相同的脚步声。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The figure behind the gate walks with your footsteps. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·折光铠卫领誓·芮岚":{"zh":"靴子里藏着一张车票，目的地被汗水泡白了。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"A ticket hides in one boot, its destination washed blank. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟铠卫领誓·乌温":{"zh":"镜盾里映着一位没有变老的守卫。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The mirror shield shows a guard who has never aged. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·依弥":{"zh":"他把走近熔炉的人拦在一臂之外。行囊里的最后一份药，仍留给与你同行的人。有些约定，比那扇门更让人安心。","en":"He keeps everyone an arm’s length from the furnace. The last medicine in the pack is still for your companions. Some promises are more reassuring than any gate."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·米弥":{"zh":"他让影子代自己出门，影子每次都空手回来。临行前留下的纸条里，画着你们一起走过的路。即便走散，也还有重新找到彼此的可能。","en":"He sends his shadow out in his place. The parting note traces the roads you walked together. Even if separated, you might still find each other."},"鎏金·暮潮星枝鹿领誓·莱尘":{"zh":"它用鹿角为溺水者撑住浮木，伤口却总在落潮时重新裂开。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"It braces driftwood for the drowning with its antlers. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·霜枝铠卫领誓·芮芙":{"zh":"他以雷声计算雪崩前的距离，已经很久没数错。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He counts thunder to judge an avalanche’s distance and has not been wrong for years. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·星铸灯议长·图烙":{"zh":"他把守门者的称号一一擦掉，说没有名字就不必遵守命令。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He erases the gatekeepers’ titles, believing the nameless need not obey. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·砂镜织光蛛领誓·阿瑟":{"zh":"它常把断掉的丝接成路标，却从不在网上画一条死路。与你同行后，它仍把幼蛛护在身后。你终于明白，最难舍下的从来不是那张网。","en":"It mends broken threads into signposts, never marking a dead end. Beside you, it still shelters its young. At last you understand that the web was never the hardest thing to leave."},"鎏金·苔庭裂角客领誓·伊恩":{"zh":"他能把强者变成一撮无名的灰，却说这不是惩罚。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He can reduce the mighty to nameless ash. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟裂角客领誓·佩拉":{"zh":"他的火来自钟炉熄灭前的最后一块炭。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"His fire comes from the bell furnace’s last coal. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟铠卫领誓·佩温":{"zh":"他把每一道伤疤都称作勋章，直到有一天忘了勋章属于哪场战斗。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He calls every scar a medal. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·芮弥":{"zh":"他为同一场离别练过许多种姿态，拿剑、拿枪、空着双手。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He rehearsed the same farewell with sword, spear, and empty hands. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·炽砂晶棘蜥龙领誓·雅罗":{"zh":"龙把烧成黑色的星图压在爪下，那里标着一条向上的路。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"A charred star chart lies beneath the dragon’s claws, marking a road upward. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·暮潮踏铃驹领誓·雅汀":{"zh":"小马听见铃声便奔向海边，却总在最后一级台阶前停下。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The little horse runs seaward with each bell, but stops at the final step. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·维汀":{"zh":"他用自己的热血点亮熄灭的船灯，以为只要灯还亮，船就没有离开。同行的日子被一笔笔刻进旧物。离出口还有多远，已经不再是唯一值得记住的事。","en":"He rekindles ship lamps with his own warmth, believing a lit lamp means its ship has not left. Your days together are marked on old belongings. The distance to the exit is no longer the only thing worth remembering."},"鎏金·霜枝攀钟猿领誓·艾诺":{"zh":"它在雪中倒下过，又带着相同的伤口回来。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"It has fallen in the snow and returned with the same wound. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·霜枝裂角客领誓·瑟诺":{"zh":"他守着山上的旧火坑，每一撮灰都留着一点不肯散去的暖意。同行的日子被一笔笔刻进旧物。离出口还有多远，已经不再是唯一值得记住的事。","en":"He tends an old fire pit on the mountain. Your days together are marked on old belongings. The distance to the exit is no longer the only thing worth remembering."},"鎏金·星铸裂角客领誓·佩烙":{"zh":"他能让一步路长过整夜，自己却已经在门前站了太久。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He can stretch one step through a whole night. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·星铸灯议长·诺玟":{"zh":"他擦去你的伤与疲惫，却没有擦去衣角那撮渡口的泥。行囊里的最后一份药，仍留给与你同行的人。有些约定，比那扇门更让人安心。","en":"He clears your pain and weariness, leaving the crossing mud on your coat. The last medicine in the pack is still for your companions. Some promises are more reassuring than any gate."},"鎏金·折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·莱岚":{"zh":"它收集过很多亮晶晶的东西，最后只留下了一片窗玻璃。同行的日子被一笔笔刻进旧物。离出口还有多远，已经不再是唯一值得记住的事。","en":"It collected many shining things, keeping only a shard of window glass. Your days together are marked on old belongings. The distance to the exit is no longer the only thing worth remembering."},"鎏金·苔庭铠卫·雅恩":{"zh":"他看过太多误入者受伤，所以从不丢下倒在渡口的人。行囊里的最后一份药，仍留给与你同行的人。有些约定，比那扇门更让人安心。","en":"Too many strangers have fallen at this crossing. The last medicine in the pack is still for your companions. Some promises are more reassuring than any gate."},"鎏金·苔庭赤角兽领誓·艾珀":{"zh":"它撞断了渡口所有的围栏，却没有走出过雾林。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The stubborn bull broke every fence at the crossing, yet never escaped the mist. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·苔庭裂角客领誓·欧珀":{"zh":"他把火藏进残破的双翼，夜夜试着飞过雾墙。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"Fire smolders in his torn wings. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·苔庭潜印客·莫恩":{"zh":"他专给陌生人指近路，自己却从不先走。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He offers strangers shortcuts, but never takes the lead. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·苔庭铠卫·欧恩":{"zh":"他替旅人洗去伤口里的雾，盔甲上却结着擦不掉的白霜。行囊里的最后一份药，仍留给与你同行的人。有些约定，比那扇门更让人安心。","en":"He washes the mist from travelers’ wounds. The last medicine in the pack is still for your companions. Some promises are more reassuring than any gate."},"鎏金·苔庭织光蛛领誓·雅珀":{"zh":"它把每一条岔路织进发亮的丝网，却总在地图中央留一个空洞。与你同行后，它仍把幼蛛护在身后。你终于明白，最难舍下的从来不是那张网。","en":"It weaves each fork in the road into a shining map. Beside you, it still shelters its young. At last you understand that the web was never the hardest thing to leave."},"鎏金·苔庭峰脊巨灵领誓·瑟珀":{"zh":"巨人捧着山口最后一块路牌，字迹早已被雨洗净。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The giant holds the mountain’s last signpost. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·苔庭铠卫领誓·维珀":{"zh":"他的剑只在雷声响起时出鞘。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"His sword leaves its sheath only with thunder. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·苔庭铠卫领誓·希珀":{"zh":"他守着雾林中央的空屋，屋里的桌子却摆了两份餐具。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He guards an empty house with two places set at its table. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·苔庭晶棘蜥龙领誓·艾恩":{"zh":"龙鳞里封着烧焦的路标。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"Scorched signposts lie sealed in its scales. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·维拉":{"zh":"巨人替停摆的钟摆来回推了很多年。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"For years the giant has pushed a stopped pendulum. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·岚拉":{"zh":"钟楼塌下那天，巨人替所有人举起了穹顶。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"When the bell tower fell, the giant caught its roof. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟灯议长·莱拉":{"zh":"他在每扇门前挂一盏不发光的灯，坚称总有人会认得归途。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He hangs an unlit lamp above every door, certain someone will recognize the way home. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟缄骨客领誓·岑拉":{"zh":"他用废弃的钟轮做车，推着走失者留下的行李。你们一起守过的火，留下了一点不肯熄灭的余温。下一次醒来，也许还能认得。","en":"His cart rides on discarded clock wheels and carries the luggage of the lost. The fire you tended together left warmth that will not die. Perhaps it will be recognized at the next awakening."},"鎏金·铜钟环藤蛇领誓·伦拉":{"zh":"蛇沿着铜管搬运药汁，也把毒带到锁死的花园。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The serpent carries remedies through copper pipes, and poison into a locked garden. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟裂角客领誓·泽拉":{"zh":"他只攻击钟声覆盖不到的街道，因为那里从不有人呼救。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He strikes the streets the bells cannot reach, where no cry is ever heard. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟缄骨客领誓·欧温":{"zh":"他记得城里每一个受伤的人，却不记得自己的手为何只剩白骨。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He remembers every wounded person in the city, but not why his own hands are bone. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟缄骨客领誓·洛温":{"zh":"他的书页能把面孔擦得干净，书脊却写满了被遗忘的名字。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"His pages can wipe faces clean. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟枝灯树灵领誓·诺温":{"zh":"树从废钟的裂缝长出，叶片一面泛红，一面透明。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"A tree grew through a cracked bell, its leaves red on one side and clear on the other. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·铜钟铠卫领誓·泽温":{"zh":"他的剑能劈开盾牌，脚步却总比钟声迟一拍。同行的日子被一笔笔刻进旧物。离出口还有多远，已经不再是唯一值得记住的事。","en":"His sword splits shields, but his steps trail the bells by one beat. Your days together are marked on old belongings. The distance to the exit is no longer the only thing worth remembering."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·乌弥":{"zh":"他替没有主人的工坊巡夜，靴底带着熔化的铜。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He patrols ownerless workshops with melted copper under his boots. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·诺弥":{"zh":"他造出的分身会在天亮前化成碎晶。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"His crystal doubles fall apart before dawn. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·瑟弥":{"zh":"他把废弃工棚改成救护所，床位永远比伤员少一个。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He made a hospital of an abandoned shed. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·炽砂缄骨客领誓·希弥":{"zh":"他从灰里拾起遇难者的扣子，装进一只不响的铁盒。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He gathers the lost travelers’ buttons into a silent tin. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·炽砂峰脊巨灵领誓·索弥":{"zh":"巨人把火捂在掌中，以为这样就不会有人再受伤。你们一起守过的火，留下了一点不肯熄灭的余温。下一次醒来，也许还能认得。","en":"The giant cups the fire to keep it from hurting anyone. The fire you tended together left warmth that will not die. Perhaps it will be recognized at the next awakening."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·莱弥":{"zh":"他曾为每条出城的路点灯，后来灯全熔成了红色的河。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He once lit every road out of the city. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·莫弥":{"zh":"他的盾上嵌着一块不会冷却的雷石。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"A thunderstone set in his shield never cools. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·伦弥":{"zh":"他能把灰里的旧友叫回身边，却总在对方开口前先道歉。行囊里的最后一份药，仍留给与你同行的人。有些约定，比那扇门更让人安心。","en":"He can call old friends back from the ash. The last medicine in the pack is still for your companions. Some promises are more reassuring than any gate."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·图弥":{"zh":"他把雷引到身后，让所有人误以为自己走在最前面。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He draws lightning behind him so everyone thinks he leads the way. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·伊罗":{"zh":"他记得一句话的三个版本：别走、带我走、你已经回来过。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He remembers three versions of one plea: Do not go. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·暮潮裂角客领誓·莫尘":{"zh":"他靠借来的血与热度走过长夜，遇到陌生人时总先藏起獠牙。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"Borrowed blood and warmth carry him through the night. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·暮潮星枝鹿领誓·伦尘":{"zh":"它曾把迷航的船拖回岸边，后来船变成了会发光的骨架。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"It once towed a lost boat ashore. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·佩尘":{"zh":"他在墓地替失踪的水手守夜，每一座空坟都有一条归港日期。临行前留下的纸条里，画着你们一起走过的路。即便走散，也还有重新找到彼此的可能。","en":"He watches over empty sailors’ graves. The parting note traces the roads you walked together. Even if separated, you might still find each other."},"鎏金·暮潮潜印客领誓·泽尘":{"zh":"他把毒藏进蛇形的手杖，声称只是为了吓退追债的人。你们一起守过的火，留下了一点不肯熄灭的余温。下一次醒来，也许还能认得。","en":"Poison sleeps in his serpent-headed cane. The fire you tended together left warmth that will not die. Perhaps it will be recognized at the next awakening."},"鎏金·暮潮织光蛛领誓·图尘":{"zh":"它替怕水的幼蛛撑起一片干燥的帆，自己却站在涨潮的石头上。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"It holds a dry sail above its little spiders while the tide climbs its rock. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·暮潮缄骨客领誓·阿汀":{"zh":"他只在有人落水后敲响岸边的铃。行囊里的最后一份药，仍留给与你同行的人。有些约定，比那扇门更让人安心。","en":"He rings the shore bell only when someone falls into the sea. The last medicine in the pack is still for your companions. Some promises are more reassuring than any gate."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·艾汀":{"zh":"他替远航者保存船票，票根一律没有日期。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He keeps tickets for departed sailors. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·暮潮浮辉使领誓·塔尘":{"zh":"它曾是灯塔里的一束光，熄灭后才学会沿着海面走。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"It was once a lighthouse beam. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·暮潮折面星客领誓·依汀":{"zh":"它戴着一张不断变换表情的面具，只有挨痛时会短暂露出自己的脸。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"Its mask changes expression without rest. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·暮潮星枝鹿领誓·诺汀":{"zh":"它鹿角上的火会随心跳改变颜色。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The fire in its antlers changes with its heartbeat. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·霜枝铜缄裂角客":{"zh":"他用冻僵的手把旅人拉回山道，救下的人却总说自己正要离开。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"With frozen hands he pulls travelers back onto the path. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·霜枝苔痕赤角兽":{"zh":"它把积雪撞进峡谷，为后来者清出一条险路。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"It clears the pass by driving snow into the ravine. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·霜枝攀钟猿领誓·阿诺":{"zh":"老猿把旅人的冻伤藏进冰里，声称等春天就能一起归还。临行前留下的纸条里，画着你们一起走过的路。即便走散，也还有重新找到彼此的可能。","en":"The old ape seals travelers’ frostbite in ice, promising to return it in spring. The parting note traces the roads you walked together. Even if separated, you might still find each other."},"鎏金·霜枝攀钟猿领誓·伊诺":{"zh":"猿群曾沿着它的叫声穿过风雪，如今只有回音还会回答。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"Its calls once guided a troop through snow. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·霜枝灯议长·欧诺":{"zh":"他写了一本只记录晴天的日记，最后一页却画着雾林渡口。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"His diary records only clear days. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·霜枝潜印客领誓·依诺":{"zh":"他把山风收进细小的针管，想听见风从哪里来。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He bottles mountain winds in fine needles to learn where they begin. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·霜枝灯议长·乌诺":{"zh":"他替爬山的人缝好行囊，总会留一根线不剪断。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He mends climbers’ packs, leaving one thread uncut. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·霜枝晶棘蜥龙领誓·维诺":{"zh":"龙沿着雷光沉睡，鳞片下藏着一枚碎裂的指南针。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The dragon sleeps along a seam of lightning. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·霜枝灯议长·希诺":{"zh":"他只在别人快撑不住时点亮灯，自己的灯却从没熄过。行囊里的最后一份药，仍留给与你同行的人。有些约定，比那扇门更让人安心。","en":"He lights a lamp when others falter. The last medicine in the pack is still for your companions. Some promises are more reassuring than any gate."},"鎏金·霜枝潜印客领誓·雅诺":{"zh":"他习惯让别人慢一步，好赶在雪崩前把人推开。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He makes others hesitate so he can push them clear before the avalanche. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·星铸铠卫领誓·洛玟":{"zh":"他守着星门前最后一段台阶，盾背刻满同行者的名字。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He guards the last steps to the star gate. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·星铸巡影狼领誓·阿霖":{"zh":"狼沿着星光寻找走散的群伴，每一次抬头都少一颗熟悉的星。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The wolf follows starlight in search of its pack. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·星铸铠卫领誓·芮烙":{"zh":"他把所有偏离道路的人拉回中央，害怕他们掉进星间的空隙。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He pulls every wanderer toward the center, away from the void. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·星铸铠卫领誓·米玟":{"zh":"他的盾记住了每一道雷，剑却忘了该指向谁。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"His shield remembers every bolt. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·星铸裂角客领誓·伊玟":{"zh":"他曾替星门看守钥匙，后来钥匙长成了会咬人的藤。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He once kept the gate’s key. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·星铸环藤蛇领誓·阿玟":{"zh":"蛇蜕下的皮铺满台阶，最旧的一层比星门还要古老。你们一起守过的火，留下了一点不肯熄灭的余温。下一次醒来，也许还能认得。","en":"The serpent’s cast skins cover the steps. The fire you tended together left warmth that will not die. Perhaps it will be recognized at the next awakening."},"鎏金·星铸裂角客领誓·艾玟":{"zh":"他把自己的心火借给每个走到这里的人，换来一句不会回头的承诺。行囊里的最后一份药，仍留给与你同行的人。有些约定，比那扇门更让人安心。","en":"He lends heartfire to every traveler who reaches him, asking them not to turn back. The last medicine in the pack is still for your companions. Some promises are more reassuring than any gate."},"鎏金·星铸峰脊巨灵领誓·欧玟":{"zh":"巨人捧着一颗落下的星，怕它烧穿回家的路。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"The giant cups a fallen star so it cannot burn through the road home. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."},"鎏金·星铸巡影狼领誓·乌玟":{"zh":"狼记得每一位没有回来的人，也记得他们离开时的气味。同行的日子被一笔笔刻进旧物。离出口还有多远，已经不再是唯一值得记住的事。","en":"The wolf remembers the scent of everyone who never returned. Your days together are marked on old belongings. The distance to the exit is no longer the only thing worth remembering."},"鎏金·星铸灯议长·雅玟":{"zh":"他替即将分别的人绑紧鞋带，从不说再见。如今旧路上多了两个人的脚印。若世界再从头开始，这段同行也不会因此变得虚假。","en":"He tightens the laces of those about to leave and never says goodbye. Two sets of tracks mark the old road now. If the world begins again, the journey you shared will still have been real."}};
const LOOP_STORY={"version":1,"title":{"zh":"回去的路","en":"The Way Home"},"opening":{"zh":{"title":"门外不是你的家","text":"你记得自己只是推开了一扇门。再抬头时，街道不见了，眼前只有浓雾、一盏灯，和一个等你出牌的陌生人。\n“想回去？先赢我。”他把牌推到你面前，仿佛这句话已经说过很多次。","button":"坐到牌桌前"},"en":{"title":"This Is Not Your Doorstep","text":"You remember opening a door. When you looked up, your street was gone. There was only fog, a lantern, and a stranger waiting for you to play.\n“Want to go home? Beat me first.” He slides the cards across as though he has said this many times before.","button":"Take a Seat"}},"home":{"zh":{"eyebrow":"一扇陌生的门，一条回家的路","subtitle":"赢过陌生人，带朋友回家","caption":"你不记得来路。有人却记得你。","text":"你误入一个陌生的世界，只能靠手中的牌寻找出口。六个世界里，守路人向你发起对局；被你选中的对手，会成为陪你前行的伙伴。可越接近最后一扇门，沿途的一切就越像曾经见过。","start":"寻找出口","return":"再走一次","loop":"第{loop}次上路 · 伙伴仍在身边"},"en":{"eyebrow":"A STRANGE DOOR. A WAY HOME.","subtitle":"Face strangers. Find companions.","caption":"You forgot the way here. Someone remembers you.","text":"Lost in an unfamiliar world, you play your cards to find a way home. Across six realms, the keepers of the road challenge you. The foes you choose become your companions. Yet the closer you get to the final door, the more familiar everything feels.","start":"Find the Way Home","return":"Walk the Road Again","loop":"Journey {loop} · Your companions are still with you"}},"chapters":{"mire":{"name":{"zh":"雾林","en":"Mistwood"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"雾里的第一盏灯","text":"你在湿冷的林间醒来，口袋里多了一副不认识的牌。守路人说，穿过六道门就能回家。你问他为什么拦路，他只答：“先看看你打算怎么走。”"},"en":{"title":"The First Lantern","text":"You wake in a cold, damp wood with an unfamiliar deck in your pocket. A keeper says six doors stand between you and home. When you ask why he blocks the road, he replies, “First, show me how you mean to travel.”"}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"对手坐到了你身旁","text":"林尽头的门终于打开。败下阵来的守路人没有走开，他指着你选中的牌：“带上它吧。下一段路，我认得。”你第一次觉得，这里并非只有敌人。"},"en":{"title":"A Seat Beside You","text":"The door beyond the wood finally opens. The defeated keeper stays. He points to the card you chose. “Bring it. I know the next stretch.” For the first time, this place feels less full of enemies."}}},"brass":{"name":{"zh":"钟城","en":"Bell City"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"慢了一拍的钟声","text":"城里的钟都指向不同的时刻。这里的守路人拿旧事作赌注，说赢了就给你一条去灰原的路。同行者却拉住你：不要拿自己的名字下注。"},"en":{"title":"A Bell One Beat Late","text":"Every clock in the city shows a different hour. Its keepers wager old memories and promise a road to the Ashlands if you win. A companion catches your sleeve: never wager your own name."}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"他记得你的名字","text":"最后一口钟响起时，有人喊出了你的名字。你明明没有告诉过他。新伙伴说自己只是猜的，却把一张写满旧笔记的纸藏进了衣袋。"},"en":{"title":"He Knows Your Name","text":"As the last bell rings, someone calls your name. You never told him. Your new companion says it was a guess, then slips a page covered in old notes into his pocket."}}},"cinder":{"name":{"zh":"灰原","en":"Ashlands"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"没有锁的钥匙","text":"灰原上到处都是造钥匙的炉子，却没人找得到相配的锁。守路人把出口画在地上，赢一局才肯补上一段。你照着图走，渐渐发现有些转弯不必看图也认得。"},"en":{"title":"Keys Without Locks","text":"The Ashlands are full of furnaces making keys, though nobody can find the locks. Keepers draw you a map, adding a stretch for every match you win. Soon you find yourself taking turns before you check the page."}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"旧地图上的新墨","text":"地图完成了，墨迹下面却压着一条更旧的路线。它与你走过的路一模一样。你想问清楚，伙伴已经替你收好牌：“先到港口，那里也许有人知道。”"},"en":{"title":"Fresh Ink, Old Map","text":"The map is complete. Beneath the fresh ink lies an older route, exactly the one you have taken. Before you can ask, a companion gathers your cards. “The harbor first. Someone there may know.”"}}},"tide":{"name":{"zh":"暮港","en":"Dusk Harbor"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"船票只写去处","text":"港口的船票都没有返程日期。摆渡人说，穿过雪岭就能看见最后的门，但每位乘客必须先打完自己的牌局。一个旧对手替你占好了船边的位置，像是等了你很久。"},"en":{"title":"A Ticket With No Return","text":"None of the harbor tickets has a return date. The ferryman says the last door lies beyond the Snowridge, but every passenger must finish a match before boarding. A former foe has saved you a place by the rail, as though he has waited a long time."}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"他们也想离开","text":"离岸后，伙伴们终于说起各自想回去的地方。原来他们拦路，不全是为了把你留下。有些人只是想找一个能赢过自己、也愿意一起走的人。"},"en":{"title":"They Want Out, Too","text":"Away from shore, your companions finally speak of the places they miss. Not all of them guarded the road to keep you here. Some were waiting for someone who could beat them and still offer a place beside them."}}},"frost":{"name":{"zh":"雪岭","en":"Snowridge"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"雪里的第二行脚印","text":"雪岭上有一行与你鞋底相同的脚印，走在你前面。守路人不再问你是谁，只问这次带了多少朋友。山顶的星门已经可见，你却开始害怕那种熟悉感。"},"en":{"title":"Your Footprints Ahead","text":"A trail of prints crosses the Snowridge ahead of you. They match your boots. The keepers no longer ask your name, only how many friends you brought this time. The Star Gate is visible above, but its familiarity frightens you."}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"“上一次，你也是这么说的。”","text":"你说，过了最后一扇门，大家就都能回家。新伙伴看了你很久，轻声回答：“上一次，你也是这么说的。”没有人肯解释上一次是什么时候。"},"en":{"title":"“You Said That Last Time.”","text":"You promise that beyond the final door, everyone can go home. Your new companion watches you for a while. “You said that last time, too.” Nobody will explain when last time was."}}},"astral":{"name":{"zh":"星门","en":"Star Gate"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"出口就在眼前","text":"最后的牌桌摆在一扇普通木门前，门把手与你家的一模一样。守门人说，这里没有谁能替你推门。你把伙伴的牌摊在桌上，决定这次一定走出去。"},"en":{"title":"The Door Before You","text":"The final table stands before an ordinary wooden door. Its handle is exactly like the one at home. The keeper says nobody can open it for you. You spread your companions across the table, certain you will get out this time."}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"门外还是那片雾","text":"你赢了最后一局，推开木门。门外没有你的街道，只有雾林和最初那盏灯。\n守路人抬起头：“想回去？先赢我。”\n你终于想起，自己已经听过这句话。可这一次，身后的朋友没有消失，手里的牌也还在。路又回到了起点，你却不再独自上路。"},"en":{"title":"Fog on the Other Side","text":"You win the last match and open the door. Your street is not there. Only Mistwood, and that first lantern.\nThe keeper looks up. “Want to go home? Beat me first.”\nNow you remember hearing it before. But this time your friends are still behind you, and the cards are still in your hand. The road has returned to its beginning. You will not walk it alone."}}}},"companions":{"zh":{"rewardTitle":"留一个位置给同行的人","rewardText":"选中守关者的牌，就是接受对方同行。曾经挡路的人，也可能陪你找到出口。","recruit":"{boss}收起对面的牌，坐到了你身旁。“下一段路，我陪你。”","recruitGold":"{boss}把最信任的那张牌交给你。它发着金光，像一句不会收回的承诺。","recruitAgain":"{boss}认出了你。“这回别走散了。”","cardNote":"曾经的对手，如今愿意与你一起寻找出口。","ordinaryReward":"沿路相识的身影化作新的牌。选一张，带上下一段旅程。","selectionHint":"选择Boss牌，可让这位旧对手成为同行伙伴；卡牌技能与组卡规则不变。"},"en":{"rewardTitle":"Make Room for a Companion","rewardText":"Choose a keeper's card to accept their company. Someone who blocked your path may help you find the way out.","recruit":"{boss} gathers the cards from the other side and sits beside you. “I'll come for the next stretch.”","recruitGold":"{boss} gives you a trusted card. Its gold light feels like a promise that will be kept.","recruitAgain":"{boss} recognizes you. “Let's not lose each other this time.”","cardNote":"Once an opponent, now a companion searching for the way home.","ordinaryReward":"Faces met along the road become new cards. Choose one for the journey ahead.","selectionHint":"Choose a Boss card to welcome a former foe as a companion. Card abilities and deck rules stay the same."}},"loop":{"zh":{"button":"带着伙伴回到雾林","continue":"继续寻找出口","notice":"道路回到雾林，已获得的伙伴、卡牌、收藏和保存的卡组仍然保留。","returnTitle":"你记得这盏灯","returnText":"雾林还是原来的雾林。守路人刚要说话，你已经替他摆好了牌。你没有忘记上一段路，也没有丢下那些愿意同行的人。","countLabel":"第{loop}次上路"},"en":{"button":"Return to Mistwood Together","continue":"Keep Looking for the Exit","notice":"The road returns to Mistwood. Your companions, cards, collection and saved deck stay with you.","returnTitle":"You Remember This Lantern","returnText":"The same mist hangs between the trees. Before the keeper can speak, you set out the cards. You remember the road you walked, and you have not left your companions behind.","countLabel":"Journey {loop}"}}};
const COMPANION_DIALOGUE={"苔庭铠卫·雅恩":{"join":"别怕，我认得第一段路。剩下的，我们一起找。","joinEn":"I know the first stretch. We can find the rest together."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·阿珀":{"join":"这一次，我不站在路边等了。","joinEn":"This time, I will not wait beside the road."},"苔庭赤角兽领誓·艾珀":{"join":"它低下断角，让你把行囊系在背上。","joinEn":"It lowers its broken horn and lets you tie your pack to its back."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·欧珀":{"join":"地上的路也行。只要这次不是独自回头。","joinEn":"A road on the ground will do, if I need not turn back alone."},"苔庭潜印客·莫恩":{"join":"好吧，这回我走前面。你可得跟紧。","joinEn":"Fine. I will go first this time. Keep up."},"苔庭铠卫·欧恩":{"join":"药用完之前，我会陪你走。之后也一样。","joinEn":"I will stay until the medicine runs out. And after that, too."},"苔庭绛纹蝶领誓·乌珀":{"join":"它落在你的空手上，翅尖指向雾的另一端。","joinEn":"It settles on your open hand, its wings pointing beyond the mist."},"苔庭织光蛛领誓·雅珀":{"join":"它将一根不会熄灭的细丝系在你的行囊上。","joinEn":"It ties one unextinguished thread to your pack."},"苔庭峰脊巨灵领誓·瑟珀":{"join":"小个子，你看远处。我来替你挡风。","joinEn":"Look ahead, little one. I will keep the wind off you."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·维珀":{"join":"雷声响的时候，记得站在我身后。","joinEn":"When the thunder comes, stand behind me."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·希珀":{"join":"屋门我已经锁好了。走吧。","joinEn":"The house is locked. Let us go."},"苔庭缄骨客领誓·米珀":{"join":"若我忘了为什么出发，替我读一遍这些名字。","joinEn":"If I forget why we left, read these names back to me."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·阿恩":{"join":"你开口之前，我不会再擅自退后了。","joinEn":"I will not fall back again unless you ask me to."},"苔庭晶棘蜥龙领誓·艾恩":{"join":"它折起伤翼，第一次沿着你的脚印前行。","joinEn":"It folds its injured wings and follows your footprints for the first time."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·伊恩":{"join":"别急着报名字。某些门，只认得陌生人。","joinEn":"Do not give your name too soon. Some gates admit only strangers."},"苔庭灯议长·图珀":{"join":"带上我。下一页，我不想再替别人翻。","joinEn":"Take me with you. I want to turn the next page for myself."},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·维拉":{"join":"我放开钟摆，你带我去听一次真正的清晨。","joinEn":"I will let the pendulum go. Take me to a real morning."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·瑟翎":{"join":"这条街太窄。我们得换一条路。","joinEn":"This street is too narrow. We need another way."},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·岚拉":{"join":"你把路指出来，我把最后一块石头放下。","joinEn":"Show me the road. I will put this last stone down."},"铜钟灯议长·莱拉":{"join":"空着的那盏灯，算我的位置吧。","joinEn":"Let the empty lamp mark my place beside you."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·岑拉":{"join":"这次的行李很轻。只带我们自己。","joinEn":"A lighter load this time. Just ourselves."},"铜钟环藤蛇领誓·伦拉":{"join":"它绕开地上的毒渍，在你身旁盘成一圈。","joinEn":"It avoids the spilled poison and coils beside you."},"铜钟裂角客领誓·佩拉":{"join":"等我们出去，你替我把那些地方重新画出来。","joinEn":"When we get out, help me draw those places again."},"铜钟裂角客领誓·泽拉":{"join":"若我再听不见，你就拉住我。","joinEn":"If I stop hearing them again, hold me back."},"铜钟织光蛛领誓·阿温":{"join":"幼蛛爬进你的行囊，它也慢慢跟了上来。","joinEn":"The little spiders climb into your pack. Their mother follows."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·欧温":{"join":"这里还有一卷绷带。路上总会用得着。","joinEn":"One roll of bandages left. We will need it on the road."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·乌温":{"join":"盾里的人留下。我跟你走。","joinEn":"The one in the shield can stay. I am coming with you."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·洛温":{"join":"最后一页先别看。我们去写新的。","joinEn":"Leave the last page alone. We can write a new one."},"铜钟枝灯树灵领誓·诺温":{"join":"它折下一根有新芽的枝条，轻轻推向你。","joinEn":"It bends a budding branch gently toward you."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·佩温":{"join":"不必再敲集合钟了。我已经在这里。","joinEn":"No more summons. I am already here."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·泽温":{"join":"这一次，跟着我们的脚步走。","joinEn":"This time, let the bells follow our footsteps."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·阿雅":{"join":"门把手交给你。别再让我替你按住时间。","joinEn":"The handle is yours. Do not ask me to hold time still again."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·乌弥":{"join":"炉门关好了。现在，轮到我们找门。","joinEn":"The furnace is shut. Now we find a door for ourselves."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·依弥":{"join":"若我停下来，你记得叫我一声。","joinEn":"If I stop, call my name."},"炽砂灯议长·诺弥":{"join":"真身走哪条路，分身就不用再猜了。","joinEn":"If I take the road myself, my doubles need not keep guessing."},"炽砂灯议长·瑟弥":{"join":"床铺收好了。今晚我守前半夜。","joinEn":"The beds are packed away. I will take the first watch."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·维弥":{"join":"灯还冷着。不过你在，这就够了。","joinEn":"The lamp is still cold. Your company will do."},"炽砂缄骨客领誓·希弥":{"join":"这只盒子我来背。你只管看前面的路。","joinEn":"I will carry the tin. Keep your eyes on the road."},"炽砂灯议长·米弥":{"join":"这回让影子看家。","joinEn":"Let the shadow mind the house this time."},"炽砂峰脊巨灵领誓·索弥":{"join":"别走火最亮的地方。踩着我的影子来。","joinEn":"Avoid the brightest fire. Follow my shadow."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·莱弥":{"join":"认路这件事，这次交给你。","joinEn":"You can lead this time."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·莫弥":{"join":"听见了吗？这一次，我们一起过去。","joinEn":"Did you hear that? This time, we go together."},"炽砂灯议长·伦弥":{"join":"不用叫我回来。我会一直跟上。","joinEn":"You will not need to call me back. I will keep up."},"炽砂灯议长·图弥":{"join":"这一次，前面若是黑的，我们就一起点灯。","joinEn":"If it is dark ahead, we can light the way together."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·芮弥":{"join":"兵器随便挑。同行的人，我已经选好了。","joinEn":"Choose any weapon. I have already chosen my company."},"炽砂灯议长·伊罗":{"join":"若我又说错了，你就拉着我走。","joinEn":"If I say the wrong one again, take my hand and keep walking."},"炽砂晶棘蜥龙领誓·雅罗":{"join":"它让出星图，把一枚温热的鳞片留在你掌心。","joinEn":"It releases the chart and leaves one warm scale in your hand."},"炽砂灯议长·诺罗":{"join":"这次别弄丢了。我还想知道它最后照见什么。","joinEn":"Do not lose it this time. I want to see what it lights at the end."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·莱尘":{"join":"它从浅滩走上堤岸，湿漉漉地停在你身边。","joinEn":"It leaves the shallows and stands, dripping, beside you."},"暮潮灯议长·岑尘":{"join":"帆留给港口吧。我们试试陆上的风。","joinEn":"Leave the sail to the harbor. We can try the wind ashore."},"暮潮裂角客领誓·莫尘":{"join":"别把手伸进雾里。我认得那里藏着什么。","joinEn":"Keep your hand out of the fog. I know what waits there."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·伦尘":{"join":"它轻轻撞了撞你的灯，转身走向堤上的路。","joinEn":"It touches your lamp with its antlers and turns toward the seawall."},"暮潮灯议长·佩尘":{"join":"明天我不在这里等了。","joinEn":"Tomorrow, I will not be waiting here."},"暮潮潜印客领誓·泽尘":{"join":"债主若追来，就说我跟你借了一条新路。","joinEn":"If the creditors come, say I borrowed a new road from you."},"暮潮织光蛛领誓·图尘":{"join":"它收起旧帆，给你的灯织了一层挡雨的网。","joinEn":"It folds the sail and weaves a rain cover around your lamp."},"暮潮缄骨客领誓·阿汀":{"join":"若你听见那只铃，别回头。我会叫醒你。","joinEn":"If you hear that bell, do not turn back. I will wake you."},"暮潮灯议长·艾汀":{"join":"船票先收好。说不定真正的港口还在后面。","joinEn":"Keep the ticket. The real harbor may still lie ahead."},"暮潮浮辉使领誓·塔尘":{"join":"它把窗里的光分给你，照亮了两个人的位置。","joinEn":"It shares the light from its window, making room for two."},"暮潮灯议长·乌汀":{"join":"钥匙我带着。若遇见门，我们就试一试。","joinEn":"I will bring the key. If we find a door, we try it."},"暮潮折面星客领誓·依汀":{"join":"它摘下面具，又把空白的一面朝向自己。","joinEn":"It removes the mask and turns its blank side inward."},"暮潮踏铃驹领誓·雅汀":{"join":"它把系在颈上的铃递给你，终于迈过最后一级。","joinEn":"It offers you the bell at its neck and steps past the last stair."},"暮潮灯议长·维汀":{"join":"信已经读完了。我们走吧。","joinEn":"I have finished the letter. Let us go."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·诺汀":{"join":"它不再退后，只让角上的微火替你照路。","joinEn":"It stops backing away and lights your path with its small flames."},"暮潮灯议长·希汀":{"join":"我想亲眼看看，这句话到底是谁刻的。","joinEn":"I want to see who carved those words."},"霜枝铜缄裂角客":{"join":"你若真的认得方向，我就跟着你的脚印。","joinEn":"If you truly know the direction, I will follow your tracks."},"霜枝铠卫领誓·泽芙":{"join":"这座桥，我们一起走完。","joinEn":"Let us cross the whole bridge together."},"霜枝苔痕赤角兽":{"join":"它在雪里刨出你的脚印，陪你踏上同一条路。","joinEn":"It uncovers your tracks in the snow and takes the path beside you."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·图芙":{"join":"幻影留下。要道别的人，得自己去见。","joinEn":"The phantom stays. I must say my own farewell."},"霜枝铠卫领誓·芮芙":{"join":"听我的脚步，别追那道回音。","joinEn":"Listen to my steps. Do not follow the echo."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·阿诺":{"join":"它砸碎脚边的薄冰，把一只旧手套放进你手中。","joinEn":"It breaks the thin ice and places an old glove in your hand."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·艾诺":{"join":"它把背留给你，缓缓踏出那个熟悉的雪坑。","joinEn":"It turns its back to you and slowly leaves the familiar hollow."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·伊诺":{"join":"它掰开那颗干果，把更大的一半递了过来。","joinEn":"It breaks the dried fruit and offers you the larger half."},"霜枝灯议长·欧诺":{"join":"日记你拿着。若我开始撒谎，就念给我听。","joinEn":"Keep the diary. Read it aloud if I start lying."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·依诺":{"join":"这一次，我们追声音的来处。","joinEn":"This time, we follow the sound to its source."},"霜枝灯议长·乌诺":{"join":"线剪断了。现在我记住你的声音。","joinEn":"The thread is cut. Now I will remember your voice."},"霜枝晶棘蜥龙领誓·维诺":{"join":"它把碎针推到你面前，等待你选定方向。","joinEn":"It sets the broken needle before you and waits for your choice."},"霜枝灯议长·希诺":{"join":"邀请上没写几个人。再多你一个，也不碍事。","joinEn":"The invitation gives no number. There is room for one more."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·雅诺":{"join":"这回不用谁推谁。我们一起跑。","joinEn":"No more pushing each other away. We run together."},"霜枝裂角客领誓·瑟诺":{"join":"灰里的人没有白等。替他们把最后一段路走完。","joinEn":"Those in the ash did not wait for nothing. Let us finish the road."},"霜枝灯议长·诺诺":{"join":"门就在前面。这一次，别把我们留在门外。","joinEn":"The gate is ahead. Do not leave us outside this time."},"星铸铠卫领誓·洛玟":{"join":"这块空白留给回来的人。走吧，我陪你。","joinEn":"That blank is for whoever returns. I am coming with you."},"星铸裂角客领誓·佩烙":{"join":"这一脚落下去，我跟你一起走。","joinEn":"When this step lands, I walk with you."},"星铸灯议长·泽烙":{"join":"地图随时能重画。同行的人，别再弄丢。","joinEn":"Maps can be redrawn. Do not lose the people beside you."},"星铸巡影狼领誓·阿霖":{"join":"它擦过你的手，转而守住行囊旁的位置。","joinEn":"It brushes your hand and takes its place beside your pack."},"星铸灯议长·图烙":{"join":"命令到此为止。后面的路，听我们自己的。","joinEn":"The orders end here. From now on, we choose."},"星铸铠卫领誓·芮烙":{"join":"若路又弯回去，至少这回我们是清醒的。","joinEn":"If the road bends back, at least we will be awake this time."},"星铸铠卫领誓·米玟":{"join":"别盯着天上。接下来这一手，我们一起出。","joinEn":"Do not stare at the sky. We play the next hand together."},"星铸裂角客领誓·伊玟":{"join":"钥匙扔掉了。没有锁，我们也能找一条路。","joinEn":"The key is gone. We can find a way without a lock."},"星铸环藤蛇领誓·阿玟":{"join":"它把旧皮留在台阶上，带着那道伤跟你下山。","joinEn":"It leaves the old skin on the steps and follows you, scar and all."},"星铸裂角客领誓·艾玟":{"join":"心火你收好。我也想见见你说的那个家。","joinEn":"Keep the heartfire. I want to see the home you speak of."},"星铸峰脊巨灵领誓·欧玟":{"join":"星我来拿。你别再一个人去敲门。","joinEn":"I will carry the star. Do not knock alone again."},"星铸巡影狼领誓·乌玟":{"join":"它没有再嗅那条旧路，只把头靠向你的膝边。","joinEn":"It stops scenting the old road and rests its head against your knee."},"星铸灯议长·雅玟":{"join":"鞋带系好了。若又回来，我们就再系一次。","joinEn":"Your laces are tied. If we return, we can tie them again."},"星铸铠卫领誓·维玟":{"join":"门后若还是雾，我也认得你的脚步。","joinEn":"If there is mist beyond the gate, I will still know your footsteps."},"星铸灯议长·诺玟":{"join":"记忆比伤口重要。这次我陪你一起记。","joinEn":"Memory matters more than wounds. I will remember with you."},"星铸折面星客领誓·瑟玟":{"join":"若门后还是起点，至少这次，你不是一个人。","joinEn":"If the gate leads back to the beginning, at least you will not be alone."}};
const STORY_BOSSES=new Set(Object.values(CAMPAIGNS).flat().map(st=>st.boss));
const STORY_STORAGE='lo_story_v1';
const STORY={version:1,friends:{},seen:{},pendingFriend:null};
const storyIdentityLabels=new Map();
try{const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORY_STORAGE)||'null');if(saved?.version===1){if(saved.friends&&typeof saved.friends==='object'&&!Array.isArray(saved.friends))STORY.friends=saved.friends;if(saved.seen&&typeof saved.seen==='object'&&!Array.isArray(saved.seen))STORY.seen=saved.seen;if(saved.pendingFriend?.boss)STORY.pendingFriend=saved.pendingFriend}}catch{}
function saveStory(){try{localStorage.setItem(STORY_STORAGE,JSON.stringify(STORY));return true}catch{return false}}
function shortCardName(card,language=gameLanguage){
 const id=typeof card==='string'?card:card?.n,entry=CARD_DISPLAY_NAMES[id];if(entry)return entry[language==='en'?'en':'zh'];
 const identity=typeof id==='string'?id.match(/^(.+)·死亡遗骸·第(\d+)轮$/):null;
 if(identity){const labels={zh:`${identity[1].slice(0,2)}·遗影${identity[2]}`,en:`${identity[1].slice(0,10)}'s Echo ${identity[2]}`};storyIdentityLabels.set(id,labels);return labels[language==='en'?'en':'zh']}
 return id||'';
}
function cardNarrative(card){return CARD_STORIES[card?.n]?.zh||card?.lore||''}
function storyText(path,params={},language=gameLanguage){
 let value=LOOP_STORY;for(const part of path.split('.'))value=value?.[part];
 if(value&&typeof value==='object')value=value[language==='en'?'en':'zh'];
 return typeof value==='string'?value.replace(/\{(\w+)\}/g,(all,key)=>params[key]??all):'';
}
function storyCopy(group,key,params={}){const data=LOOP_STORY[group]?.[gameLanguage==='en'?'en':'zh'];return (data?.[key]||'').replace(/\{(\w+)\}/g,(all,name)=>params[name]??all)}
function storyChapter(world=difficulty,part='intro'){
 const chapter=LOOP_STORY.chapters[world];return chapter?.[part]?.[gameLanguage==='en'?'en':'zh']||{title:'',text:''};
}
function storyWorldName(world=difficulty){return storyText(`chapters.${world}.name`)}
function storyParagraphs(text){return text.split('\n').map(p=>`<p>${esc(p)}</p>`).join('')}
function storeJourney(){try{localStorage.setItem(JOURNEY_STORAGE,JSON.stringify({version:3,cleared:journey.cleared,unlocked:journey.unlocked,loops:journey.loops}));return true}catch{return false}}
function beginNextStoryLoop(){
 if(journey.cleared!==DIFFICULTY_ORDER.length||G?.replay||G?.tutorial||OV==='win'&&!G?.rewardClaimed)return false;
 // Claim the final choice before crossing the door. Collections, identities,
 // custom decks, reserves and replay clears never belong to a single loop.
 if(G&&OV==='clear'&&typeof savePlayerDeck==='function')savePlayerDeck();
 const next={cleared:0,unlocked:DIFFICULTY_ORDER.length,loops:(journey.loops||0)+1};
 try{localStorage.setItem(JOURNEY_STORAGE,JSON.stringify({version:3,...next}))}catch{return false}
 Object.assign(journey,next);return true;
}
function storyBossIdentity(card){
 const id=card?.baseName||card?.n,base=POOL.find(c=>c.n===id);
 return base&&(base.kind==='boss'||STORY_BOSSES.has(id))?id:null;
}
function recordStoryCompanion(card){
 if(!card||G?.tutorial||G?.replay)return false;const boss=storyBossIdentity(card);if(!boss)return false;
 const repeat=!!STORY.friends[boss];if(!repeat)STORY.friends[boss]={firstLoop:journey.loops||0};
 STORY.pendingFriend={boss,repeat,gold:card.rarity==='rare'};saveStory();return true;
}
function storyCompanionText(){
 const pending=STORY.pendingFriend;if(!pending)return '';
 const own=COMPANION_DIALOGUE[pending.boss],line=own?.[gameLanguage==='en'?'joinEn':'join'];
 if(line&&!pending.repeat)return `${shortCardName(pending.boss)}${gameLanguage==='en'?': ':'：'}${line}`;
 return storyCopy('companions',pending.repeat?'recruitAgain':pending.gold?'recruitGold':'recruit',{boss:shortCardName(pending.boss)});
}
let storyToastKey=null,storyToastTimer=null;
function renderStoryToast(){
 const pending=STORY.pendingFriend,node=document.getElementById('story-companion-toast');
 if(!pending){node?.remove();storyToastKey=null;clearTimeout(storyToastTimer);return}
 if(OV!==null||infoPanel||DM||HOLD_DETAIL||G?.busy){node?.remove();storyToastKey=null;clearTimeout(storyToastTimer);return}
 const key=JSON.stringify(pending);let toast=node;
 if(!toast){toast=document.createElement('aside');toast.id='story-companion-toast';toast.className='story-companion-toast';toast.setAttribute('role','status');document.body.appendChild(toast)}
 toast.innerHTML=`<button data-story-dismiss aria-label="${gameLanguage==='en'?'Close':'关闭'}">×</button><small>${esc(storyCopy('companions','rewardTitle'))}</small><p>${esc(storyCompanionText())}</p>`;
 if(key===storyToastKey)return;storyToastKey=key;clearTimeout(storyToastTimer);
 storyToastTimer=setTimeout(()=>{if(STORY.pendingFriend&&JSON.stringify(STORY.pendingFriend)===key){STORY.pendingFriend=null;saveStory();renderStoryToast()}},9000);
}
function storyJournalButton(){return `<button type="button" data-story-journal>${gameLanguage==='en'?'Story':'旅途手记'}</button>`}
function storyJournalHTML(){
 const world=G?.st?.games?.[0]||difficulty||activeDifficulty(),chapter=storyChapter(world),opening=LOOP_STORY.opening[gameLanguage==='en'?'en':'zh'];
 const returned=world==='mire'&&(journey.loops||0)>0,title=returned?storyCopy('loop','returnTitle'):chapter.title;
 const text=returned?storyCopy('loop','returnText'):chapter.text;
 const friends=Object.keys(STORY.friends).filter(id=>CARD_DISPLAY_NAMES[id]),heading=gameLanguage==='en'?'Companions':'同行的人';
 return `<div class="drawer-backdrop"><button class="drawer-scrim" data-a="closepanel" aria-label="${gameLanguage==='en'?'Close story':'关闭手记'}"></button><section class="info-drawer story-drawer" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="story-title"><div class="drawer-head"><div><small>${esc(storyCopy('loop','countLabel',{loop:(journey.loops||0)+1}))} · ${esc(storyWorldName(world))}</small><h2 id="story-title">${esc(title)}</h2></div><button data-a="closepanel">${gameLanguage==='en'?'Continue':'继续前行'}</button></div><div class="drawer-scroll">${world==='mire'&&!(journey.loops||0)?`<h3>${esc(opening.title)}</h3>${storyParagraphs(opening.text)}`:''}${storyParagraphs(text)}<h3>${heading}</h3><p>${esc(friends.length?friends.map(id=>shortCardName(id)).join(' · '):storyCopy('companions','rewardText'))}</p><p class="story-note">${esc(storyCopy('companions','selectionHint'))}</p></div></section></div>`;
}
function storyClearHTML(){
 const last=difficulty===DIFFICULTY_ORDER[DIFFICULTY_ORDER.length-1],chapter=storyChapter(difficulty,'clear'),next=DIFFICULTY_ORDER[DIFFICULTY_ORDER.indexOf(difficulty)+1];
 return `<div class="ov modal-screen journey-clear story-clear"><div class="title-mark">✦</div><span class="modal-kicker">${esc(storyCopy('loop','countLabel',{loop:(journey.loops||0)+1}))}</span><h1>${esc(chapter.title)}</h1><div class="story-prose">${storyParagraphs(chapter.text)}</div>${STORY.pendingFriend?`<blockquote class="story-clear-companion">${esc(storyCompanionText())}</blockquote>`:''}${identityCampaignHTML()}<p class="story-note">${esc(last?storyCopy('loop','notice'):(gameLanguage==='en'?`Next: ${storyWorldName(next)}. Your deck and companions stay with you.`:`下一站：${storyWorldName(next)}。带上现在的牌组和伙伴继续前行。`))}</p><button class="pri" data-a="nextdifficulty">${esc(last?storyCopy('loop','button'):(gameLanguage==='en'?`Travel to ${storyWorldName(next)}`:`前往${storyWorldName(next)}`))}</button><button data-a="title">${gameLanguage==='en'?'Back to the Lantern':'回到灯台'}</button></div>`;
}
// The text layer covers cards, HUD names, tooltips, logs and old saved flavour.
const storyNameDictionary={};
for(const [id,label]of Object.entries(CARD_DISPLAY_NAMES)){
 storyNameDictionary[id]=label.zh;I18N_CARDS[id]={...(I18N_CARDS[id]||{}),name:label.en,lore:CARD_STORIES[id]?.en||I18N_CARDS[id]?.lore||''};
 I18N_STRINGS[label.zh]=label.en;
 const oldLore=POOL.find(c=>c.n===id)?.lore,story=CARD_STORIES[id];
 if(story){if(oldLore)I18N_STRINGS[oldLore]=story.en;I18N_STRINGS[story.zh]=story.en}
}
for(const world of Object.keys(LOOP_STORY.chapters)){
 const label=LOOP_STORY.chapters[world].name;I18N_STRINGS[GAME_META[world][0]]=label.en;I18N_STRINGS[label.zh]=label.en;storyNameDictionary[GAME_META[world][0]]=label.zh;
}
const storyNameKeys=Object.keys(storyNameDictionary).filter(id=>id!==storyNameDictionary[id]).sort((a,b)=>b.length-a.length);
const storyNameMatcher=new RegExp(storyNameKeys.map(s=>s.replace(/[.*+?^${}()|[\]\\]/g,'\\$&')).join('|'),'g');
function storyChineseText(text){if(typeof text!=='string')return text;let output=text.replace(storyNameMatcher,id=>storyNameDictionary[id]);for(const [id,labels]of storyIdentityLabels)output=output.split(id).join(labels.zh);return output}
const drawerBeforeStory=drawerHTML;drawerHTML=function(){return infoPanel==='story'?storyJournalHTML():drawerBeforeStory()};
const renderBeforeStory=render;render=function(){renderBeforeStory();renderStoryToast()};
const battleBeforeStory=battle;
battle=async function(){
 const game=G;await battleBeforeStory();if(G!==game||!G||G.tutorial||G.replay||OV||G.lv!==1||G.busy)return;
 const key=`${journey.loops||0}:${difficulty}`;if(STORY.seen[key])return;STORY.seen[key]=true;saveStory();infoPanel='story';render();
};
document.addEventListener('click',event=>{
 if(event.target.closest('[data-story-dismiss]')){event.preventDefault();STORY.pendingFriend=null;saveStory();renderStoryToast();return}
 if(!event.target.closest('[data-story-journal]'))return;event.preventDefault();if(G?.busy||drawRunning)return;infoPanel='story';render();
});

// Translation is a presentation layer: saved names, card instances and actions
// retain their original identifiers in both languages.
const LANGUAGE_STORAGE='lo_language_v1';
let gameLanguage='zh-CN';
try{const requested=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('lang'),saved=localStorage.getItem(LANGUAGE_STORAGE);gameLanguage=requested==='en'||(!requested&&saved==='en')?'en':'zh-CN'}catch{}
const localeTextCache=new Map(),localeNodeSource=new WeakMap(),localeAttributeSource=new WeakMap();
const localeHan=/[\u3400-\u9fff]/;
const localeDictionary=Object.assign({},I18N_STRINGS);
for(const [name,entry]of Object.entries(I18N_CARDS)){
 localeDictionary[name]=entry.name;
 const original=POOL.find(c=>c.n===name)?.lore;if(original&&entry.lore)localeDictionary[original]=entry.lore;
}
Object.assign(localeDictionary,{
 '灯誓牌':'Lantern Oath','余芯':'Wick','鎏金':'Gilded','稀':'R','灯息万象':'Lamp Archive',
 '苔庭':'Mireglass','铜钟':'Brassbell','炽砂':'Cinderglass','暮潮港湾':'Dusk-Tide Harbor','霜枝高地':'Frostbough March','星铸天穹':'Starforged Expanse',
 '苔雾荒庭':'Mireglass Reach','铜钟堡垒':'Brassbell Citadel','炽砂熔城':'Cinderglass Foundry','砂镜地窟':"Sandmirror Vault",'暮潮港湾':'Dusk-Tide Harbor','星铸天穹':'Starforged Expanse','折光边境':'Prism-Rift Frontier',
 '物理':'Physical','火':'Fire','雷':'Lightning','光':'Light','暗':'Dark','血':'Blood','魔':'Magic','冰':'Ice','毒':'Poison',
 '练习灯偶':'Training Dummy','练习巡灯者':'Practice Mireglass Silverdew Bonebound','鎏金灯蛛':'Gilded Wick Spider','鎏金余芯':'Gilded Wick','碎灯偶':'Bones',
 '新入场':'Newly played','可献祭':'Ready to sacrifice','中文':'中文'
});
for(const world of Object.keys(LOOP_STORY.chapters)){localeDictionary[GAME_META[world][0]]=LOOP_STORY.chapters[world].name.en;localeDictionary[LOOP_STORY.chapters[world].name.zh]=LOOP_STORY.chapters[world].name.en}
const localeEscape=s=>s.replace(/[.*+?^${}()|[\]\\]/g,'\\$&');
// Full sentences use O(1) lookup. Only short fragments take part in matching.
const localeFragments=Object.keys(localeDictionary).filter(k=>k.length>1&&k.length<=110&&localeHan.test(k)&&!/[<>]|\$\{/.test(k)).sort((a,b)=>b.length-a.length);
const localeMatcher=new RegExp(localeFragments.map(localeEscape).join('|'),'g');
const localeTemplates=Object.entries(localeDictionary).filter(([key])=>key.includes('${')).map(([source,target])=>{
 const parameters=[],pieces=source.split(/(\$\{[^}]+\})/g);
 const pattern=pieces.map(piece=>{if(piece.startsWith('${')){parameters.push(piece);return '(.+?)'}return localeEscape(piece)}).join('');
 return {match:new RegExp('^'+pattern+'$'),parameters,target};
});
